3,1a05bcc75698be5e,"Tue, 01 Sep 2026 07:08:40 +0000",Prometheus Federal Services <recruiting+431935524-3a35f2a0@applytojob.com>,Health IT Informaticist I - Application Status Change,"<p><span style=""display:none;"">&#160;</span>Hi&#160;Netanya,</p><p>Thank you for your interest in the&#160;Health IT Informaticist I role and for taking the time to apply. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application. Unfortunately, we have decided to cancel this position and will not be moving forward with the hiring process at this time. We value your interest in our organization and encourage you to continue to check the <a href=""https://pfs.us/careers/open-positions/"">Careers Page</a> for future opportunities that match your skills and experience.&#160;</p><p>Thank you again for considering us, and we wish you the best in your job search.<br>&#160;</p><p>Best Regards,</p><p>PFS Recruiting Team</p><p><img alt="""" height=""40"" src=""https://assets.jazz.co/customers/customer_20191024212858_0UQH2ZJ5HSY74CMJ/layout/20230223220822-image-20230223170825-24.png"" width=""119""></p><img src=""https://ea.pstmrk.it/open?m=v3_1.m6U4bZnGLmaSP3jcRVKUUQ.8CjeZJrRGCxvaqu8jlJ3S7oisjxGNX0fs2RC8BlSxm3aQyobu9Aeq_TTHcQ0ZB2I80OxR6tzrotmKm7vFi9r3GR4SB9cN5c1WFAWjiO1dvB6_RHv1EXju6isFqBpaPDFcHGMldK56pxWwszGrA_wyuA7YbRkIGsMQQwREWv9KiM7B4dzxiUzD22hoRutWOC1S1FgGtiLoCto9P5mcbECu4AOG92AHomanyhBHB4E6iZ1pOVXnS1ALJk5iUUCbLu0gV3mCCD-wkqlbPdvdxcMuZYUuBCmu-9irpv6SBwGmi7orpj4YDVAjDzQEwT8Po1UlYL2Xa6BwVPUoeSqJT1lJuHJEbF4WO-tHrI6e8qqlCCfvTykaamaD-D7J4Dmgeo892M5ygKmeb1Ki9PfVq2FVMQpa4ezpz6J1VjqwdHlo6HG2vVhJjn_6Dt1THnraAodA-bBcnJKhDzny33pfKtifKkPyjNgaKMRp2ZeEnOBDTEjrpqRb45QFz2NIu13W86pFjwxFg9BYVKLsVoU7JxO_bpmwXvmovLr3D89H49s76rc28yYR1s62fJD0liVhlK1hp9j7itWzPW4ojtaGzDb6hwA5ZzaJMkEQbx5-zd3feNgF-3cXr7pGyqIH2zk1uTvUQDL-DxLeguyltgB92IZ5g"" width=""1"" height=""1"" border=""0"" alt="""" />
","Hi Netanya,Thank you for your interest in the Health IT Informaticist I role and for taking the time to apply. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application. Unfortunately, we have decided to cancel this position and will not be moving forward with the hiring process at this time. We value your interest in our organization and encourage you to continue to check the Careers Page for future opportunities that match your skills and experience. Thank you again for considering us, and we wish you the best in your job search. Best Regards,PFS Recruiting Team",True,Prometheus Federal Services,Prometheus Federal Services,"Health IT Informaticist I role and for taking the time to apply. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application. Unfortunately, we have decided to cancel this",2026-09-01 07:08:40+00:00,2026-09,Tuesday
