5,1a0578d488f1b65f,"Mon, 31 Aug 2026 11:21:12 +0000 (UTC)",RR Donnelley Hiring Team <notifications@smartrecruiters.com>,RRD: Thank you for your interest - ​Billing Analyst - 2nd Shift ​,"
Hi&nbsp;Netanya,
Thank you for taking the time to apply to our Billing Analyst - 2nd Shift .&nbsp;
Upon consideration, we&#39;ve decided to move forward with other candidates at this time.
We encourage you to look at our career page for other opportunities that align with your interests and skill-set. Also feel free to follow us on LinkedIn as well as to stay up to date with our most recent roles and news here at RR Donnelley.
We hope that you will continue to consider RRD for possible future opportunities, and we with you the best of luck in your current search!
Sincerely,
RRD Human Resources
