   <body><div>Hi Netanya, <br/><br/>Thank you for your interest in the Business Analyst at LifeStance
      Health. We truly appreciate the time you invested in submitting your application.<br><br>After careful review, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience
      more closely matches our needs at this time.<br><br>We’re grateful you considered LifeStance and encourage you to explore other opportunities
      with us in the future by visiting our career site https://lifestance.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/login
      <br/><br/>Wishing you continued success in your professional journey.<br><br>Warm Regards,<br>LifeStance Health Talent Acquisition Team<br><br><br>Please note: Replies to this email are not monitored. If you have questions, feel
      free to reach out to us at globalrecruiting@lifestance.com.</div><div><br/></div><div>This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message.</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:qwqJyZyQGS""/></div>
