   <body><div>Dear Netanya, <br/><br/>Thank you for applying for the Project Finance Systems Specialist
      I position at Premier Research. We appreciate your interest in joining our team.<br><br>A member of our Talent team reviewed your application, and after thoughtful consideration
      of your application against the requirements of the role, we regret to inform you
      that we have decided to pursue other candidates whose experience align more closely
      with the specific needs of this position.<br><br>We encourage you to sign up for job alerts or join our talent network on our careers
      website to stay informed about future opportunities. Additionally, we invite you to
      follow us and connect with our Talent team on LinkedIn.<br><br>Best wishes for success in your job search,<br><br>The Premier Research Talent Team</div><div><br/></div><div>Business Process: Job Application: Netanya Kelley ‎- R6442 Project Finance Systems
      Specialist I (C57695) on 08/06/2026</div><div>Subject: Netanya Kelley ‎- R6442 Project Finance Systems Specialist I (C57695)</div><div><a href=""https://wd12.myworkday.com/premierresearch/email-universal/inst/779$1384783/rel-task/2997$4086.htmld"">Click here to view the notification details.</a></div>
