</html>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for applying for the Project Finance Systems Specialist I position at Premier Research. We appreciate your interest in joining our team.A member of our Talent team reviewed your application, and after thoughtful consideration of your application against the requirements of the role, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates whose experience align more closely with the specific needs of this position.We encourage you to sign up for job alerts or join our talent network on our careers website to stay informed about future opportunities. Additionally, we invite you to follow us and connect with our Talent team on LinkedIn.Best wishes for success in your job search,The Premier Research Talent TeamBusiness Process: Job Application: Netanya Kelley ‎- R6442 Project Finance Systems Specialist I (C57695) on 08/06/2026Subject: Netanya Kelley ‎- R6442 Project Finance Systems Specialist I (C57695)Click here to view the notification details. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Workday Notifications,Workdays,Unknown,2026-08-29 05:00:34+00:00,2026-08,Saturday
