11,1a043c297f249810,27 Aug 2026 15:07:00 +0000,noreplies@milliman.com,Thank you for applying to Milliman,"Re: Milliman Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) Application
Netanya,
Thank you for your interest in the Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) position with Milliman. 
After careful consideration, the local hiring team has decided to pursue other candidates for this position.
You are encouraged to visit the Milliman Careers page and apply for other interesting opportunities that match your qualifications.  Opportunities at Milliman, including the position criteria and hiring decisions, are managed by the leaders across the firm looking to add to their teams.
We sincerely wish you the best with your job search and appreciate your interest in Milliman.
<p><span>Re: Milliman Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) Application</span></p>
<p><span><span>Netanya,</span></span></p>
<p><span><span>Thank you for your interest in the Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) position with Milliman. </span></span></p>
<p><span>After careful consideration, the local hiring team has decided to pursue other candidates for this position.</span></p>
<p><span><span>You are encouraged to visit the Milliman Careers page and apply for other interesting opportunities that match your qualifications.&nbsp; Opportunities at Milliman, including the position criteria and hiring decisions, are managed by the leaders across the firm looking to add to their teams.</span></span></p>
<p><span>We sincerely wish you the best with your job search and appreciate your interest in Milliman.</span></p>","Re: Milliman Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) Application Netanya, Thank you for your interest in the Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) position with Milliman. After careful consideration, the local hiring team has decided to pursue other candidates for this position. You are encouraged to visit the Milliman Careers page and apply for other interesting opportunities that match your qualifications. Opportunities at Milliman, including the position criteria and hiring decisions, are managed by the leaders across the firm looking to add to their teams. We sincerely wish you the best with your job search and appreciate your interest in Milliman. Re: Milliman Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) Application Netanya, Thank you for your interest in the Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote) position with Milliman. After careful consideration, the local hiring team has decided to pursue other candidates for this position. You are encouraged to visit the Milliman Careers page and apply for other interesting opportunities that match your qualifications. Opportunities at Milliman, including the position criteria and hiring decisions, are managed by the leaders across the firm looking to add to their teams. We sincerely wish you the best with your job search and appreciate your interest in Milliman.",True,Milliman,Milliman,Integration Analyst - IntelliScript (Remote),2026-08-27 15:07:00+00:00,2026-08,Thursday
12,1a0432ebf8554a60,27 Aug 2026 12:25:31 +0000,recruiting@ntiva.com,Thank you for your interest in Ntiva! Let's Keep in Touch!,"<p>Hi Netanya,</p>
<p>First, I'd like to thank you for your interest in Ntiva!&nbsp;We received an overwhelming response to the Security Analyst I (Friday–Monday, 12am–11am CST) position, which makes us feel both humble and proud that so many talented individuals (like you!) want to join our team. This volume of response makes for an extremely competitive selection process. Although your background is impressive, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates whose qualifications are better suited for this position.&nbsp;</p>
<p>In the coming months, Ntiva will be advertising more positions. Just as we at Ntiva value our customers, we value our job candidates and invite you to review future job openings. <span>For your convenience, we encourage you to regularly check our careers page at careers.ntiva.com.&nbsp;It's&nbsp;a great way&nbsp;to stay updated on any new openings that may arise. </span>We hope you see another position that sparks your interest! Once again, Thank you for your interest in our company.</p>
<p>We wish you the best of luck with your job search.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Best wishes,</p>
<p>Jenny Gorena<br />Ntiva Talent Acquisition Team</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Hi Netanya,</p>
<p>First, I'd like to thank you for your interest in Ntiva!&nbsp;We received an overwhelming response to the Security Analyst I (Friday–Monday, 12am–11am CST) position, which makes us feel both humble and proud that so many talented individuals (like you!) want to join our team. This volume of response makes for an extremely competitive selection process. Although your background is impressive, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates whose qualifications are better suited for this position.&nbsp;</p>
<p>In the coming months, Ntiva will be advertising more positions. Just as we at Ntiva value our customers, we value our job candidates and invite you to review future job openings. <span>For your convenience, we encourage you to regularly check our careers page at careers.ntiva.com.&nbsp;It's&nbsp;a great way&nbsp;to stay updated on any new openings that may arise. </span>We hope you see another position that sparks your interest! Once again, Thank you for your interest in our company.</p>
<p>We wish you the best of luck with your job search.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Best wishes,</p>
<p>Jenny Gorena<br />Ntiva Talent Acquisition Team</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>","Hi Netanya, First, I'd like to thank you for your interest in Ntiva! We received an overwhelming response to the Security Analyst I (Friday–Monday, 12am–11am CST) position, which makes us feel both humble and proud that so many talented individuals (like you!) want to join our team. This volume of response makes for an extremely competitive selection process. Although your background is impressive, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates whose qualifications are better suited for this position. In the coming months, Ntiva will be advertising more positions. Just as we at Ntiva value our customers, we value our job candidates and invite you to review future job openings. For your convenience, we encourage you to regularly check our careers page at careers.ntiva.com. It's a great way to stay updated on any new openings that may arise. We hope you see another position that sparks your interest! Once again, Thank you for your interest in our company. We wish you the best of luck with your job search. Best wishes, Jenny GorenaNtiva Talent Acquisition Team Hi Netanya, First, I'd like to thank you for your interest in Ntiva! We received an overwhelming response to the Security Analyst I (Friday–Monday, 12am–11am CST) position, which makes us feel both humble and proud that so many talented individuals (like you!) want to join our team. This volume of response makes for an extremely competitive selection process. Although your background is impressive, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates whose qualifications are better suited for this position. In the coming months, Ntiva will be advertising more positions. Just as we at Ntiva value our customers, we value our job candidates and invite you to review future job openings. For your convenience, we encourage you to regularly check our careers page at careers.ntiva.com. It's a great way to stay updated on any new openings that may arise. We hope you see another position that sparks your interest! Once again, Thank you for your interest in our company. We wish you the best of luck with your job search. Best wishes, Jenny GorenaNtiva Talent Acquisition Team",True,Ntiva! Let's Keep in Touch!,Ntiva! Let's Keep in Touch!,Unknown,2026-08-27 12:25:31+00:00,2026-08,Thursday
