17,1a03f35dfe44a48c,"Wed, 26 Aug 2026 17:54:49 +0000",Allied Benefit Systems <donotreply@msg.paycomonline.com>,Thanks for Applying,"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN"" ""http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd"">
<html><body><p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">Dear&nbsp;Netanya</span></p>

<p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">We want to express our gratitude to you for taking the time to apply for the Revenue Analyst position at Allied Benefit Systems. We sincerely appreciate your interest in joining our team.<br>
<br>
After careful consideration, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match the requirements and qualifications we&rsquo;re seeking for this role. Please know that our decision was not easy as we received many impressive applications. We value your skills and experience, and we encourage you to keep an eye out for future opportunities with us.&nbsp;We wish you all the best and thank you again for your application and interest in Allied Benefit Systems.</span></p>

<p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">Regards,<br>
Talent Acquisition Team</span></p>

<p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">talent@alliedbenefit.com&nbsp;</span></p>
</body></html>

