   <body><div>Dear Netanya ,<br><br>Thank you for your interest and application for the R-99196 Contract Analyst position.
      The applicant pool was extremely competitive and we have chosen to move forward with
      other candidates whose qualifications more closely match the requirements of the position.<br><br>We appreciate your time and effort applying for this position and encourage you to
      apply to other positions in the future. Please visit our careers site by clicking
      the following link: jobs.geisinger.org.<br><br>Thank you,<br>Geisinger Talent Acquisition Team</div><div>Do not reply to this email.</div>
