</html>","Dear Netanya ,Thank you for your interest and application for the R-99196 Contract Analyst position. The applicant pool was extremely competitive and we have chosen to move forward with other candidates whose qualifications more closely match the requirements of the position.We appreciate your time and effort applying for this position and encourage you to apply to other positions in the future. Please visit our careers site by clicking the following link: jobs.geisinger.org.Thank you,Geisinger Talent Acquisition TeamDo not reply to this email. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-08-26 14:24:35+00:00,2026-08,Wednesday
19,1a039e68f24df2d6,"Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:10:05 +0000",Amplify Hiring Team <no-reply@ashbyhq.com>,Amplify : Update regarding your application for Reporting Associate,"Hello Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in Amplify and for taking the time to apply for the Reporting Associate position.

After reviewing your application, we have determined that we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time. Our team had the opportunity to review many qualified applicants, and this decision was made in the context of our current hiring needs.

We encourage you to continue checking our https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/amplify for future openings that may align with your background and interests.

Best regards,

Amplify Talent Acquisition Team
