   <body><div>Dear Netanya Thank you for your interest Payment Integrity Analyst - Data Mining .
      We truly appreciate your interest in Lyric!<br><br>After careful consideration, we have decided to move forward with other candidates
      for this role. This was a challenging decision due to the high caliber of applicants
      like yourself. We are grateful for the time and effort you put into your application
      and we wish you the best in your future endeavors.<br><br>We hope you will consider Lyric for future opportunities that align with your talents
      and career aspirations.<br><br>Sincerely,<br>Lyric Talent Acquisition Team</div><div><br/></div><div><a href=""https://wd12.myworkday.com/tbc/email-universal/inst/779$285915/rel-task/2997$4086.htmld"">Click here to view the notification details.</a></div><div><br/></div><div>This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message.</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:UibUOhZttw""/></div>
