   <body><div><img src=""cid:HbMbjFfztN""/></div><div><br/></div><div>Hi Netanya ,<br><br>Thank you for your interest in the Workforce Management Analyst (Remote) Role at Globe
      Life. We appreciate the time you took to submit your application and to engage with
      our process.<br><br>After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose
      skills and experience more closely align with our current needs. However, we encourage
      you to follow us on LinkedIn to stay up to date on our open positions and to apply
      for any future roles that interest you.<br><br>Wishing you continued success in your professional journey.<br><br>Best Regards,<br>The Globe Life Talent Acquisition Team</div><div><br/></div><div>This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message.</div><div><br/></div>
