27,1a02621031d71a52,"Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:01:31 +0000",no-reply@datavant.com,Important information about your application to Datavant,"Netanya,

Thanks for applying to work with us at Datavant. We appreciate your interest in joining our company.

We carefully reviewed applications for the Health Information Specialist I role, and unfortunately, at this time we will not be moving forward with your candidacy. However, we encourage you to continue visiting our careers page ( https://www.datavant.com/about/careers ) and to follow us on Linkedin ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/datavant/mycompany/ ) to see the most current job openings.

Thanks again for your interest in Datavant and we wish you luck in your search.

Regards,

The Datavant Recruiting Team
<p>Netanya,</p>
<p><!--StartFragment--><span style=""font-weight: 400;"">Thanks for applying to work with us at Datavant. We appreciate your interest in joining our company.</span><!--EndFragment--></p>
<p><!--StartFragment--><span style=""font-weight: 400;"">We carefully reviewed applications for the Health Information Specialist I role, and unfortunately, at this time we will not be moving forward with your candidacy. However, we encourage you to continue visiting our </span><a href=""https://www.datavant.com/about/careers""><span style=""font-weight: 400;"">careers page</span></a><span style=""font-weight: 400;""> and to follow us on&nbsp;</span><a href=""https://www.linkedin.com/company/datavant/mycompany/""><span style=""font-weight: 400;"">Linkedin</span></a><span style=""font-weight: 400;""> to see the most current job openings.</span><!--EndFragment--></p>
<p>Thanks again for your interest in Datavant and we wish you luck in your search.</p>
<p>Regards,</p>
<p>The Datavant Recruiting Team</p><img width=""1"" height=""1"" alt="""" src=""http://email.gh-mail.datavant.com/o/eJwczEFuwyAQheHTlF2tmcHGw4JV1RP0ANWQmcaoBFc2iZTbV2T79L9Pk89gCM4Srrz6OUBEtyWNqGjI2XtachBaWCNFzcJzYF5cSQQUgAkJAT1O6NnzzwqWOcfI-W2G6_Z-k1InlS4PaX267De3H9fvomkGwJkZgN2fHefexrgSAeDix3qkZl3aU36tVnuG4b20gZyl7uPArqevy2Z6r6Yf0rSodPscnbufdozGPRL9BwAA____O0WZ"">","Netanya, Thanks for applying to work with us at Datavant. We appreciate your interest in joining our company. We carefully reviewed applications for the Health Information Specialist I role, and unfortunately, at this time we will not be moving forward with your candidacy. However, we encourage you to continue visiting our careers page ( https://www.datavant.com/about/careers ) and to follow us on Linkedin ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/datavant/mycompany/ ) to see the most current job openings. Thanks again for your interest in Datavant and we wish you luck in your search. Regards, The Datavant Recruiting Team Netanya, Thanks for applying to work with us at Datavant. We appreciate your interest in joining our company. We carefully reviewed applications for the Health Information Specialist I role, and unfortunately, at this time we will not be moving forward with your candidacy. However, we encourage you to continue visiting our careers page and to follow us on Linkedin to see the most current job openings. Thanks again for your interest in Datavant and we wish you luck in your search. Regards, The Datavant Recruiting Team",True,Datavant,Datavant,Health Information Specialist I,2026-08-21 21:01:31+00:00,2026-08,Friday
28,1a02468a072f4f8c,"Fri, 21 Aug 2026 13:00:24 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Thank you from DV Trading,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in the Junior Quantitative Trader  role at DV Trading and for taking the time to apply.

After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we will not be moving forward with your application at this time.

While this role may not have been the right fit, we encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that may better align with your experience. As DV Trading continues to grow and evolve, we are always looking for talented individuals to join our team.

Due to the high volume of applications, we are unable to provide individualized feedback.

We appreciate your interest in DV Trading and wish you all the best in your job search.

Best,DV Trading Talent Acquisition Team
<p><!--StartFragment--></p>
