<p data-local-id=""8da9293d8271"" data-prosemirror-content-type=""node"" data-prosemirror-node-name=""paragraph"" data-prosemirror-node-block=""true"">While this role may not have been the right fit, we encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that may better align with your experience. As DV Trading continues to grow and evolve, we are always looking for talented individuals to join our team.</p>
<p data-local-id=""0cb11dc3d2a0"" data-prosemirror-content-type=""node"" data-prosemirror-node-name=""paragraph"" data-prosemirror-node-block=""true"">Due to the high volume of applications, we are unable to provide individualized feedback.</p>
