<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in our Marketing Operations Analyst position at Bullhorn. At this time, we have chosen to move forward with other candidates who may be a better match for the position. With that said, we absolutely encourage you to apply for additional roles again in the future. We are growing every day and are always on the lookout for great talent. Please keep an eye out on our https://bullhorn.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BullhornCareers and check our social media for regular updates (LinkedIn #lifeatbullhorn and Instagram @lifeatbullhorn). We know searching for a new job is a large undertaking and we appreciate your interest and consideration. Best of luck with the continued search! Bullhorn Talent Acquisition Team Search Careers This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Bullhorn,Bullhorn,Unknown,2026-08-21 08:41:06+00:00,2026-08,Friday
