 for further updates on your status. We also encourage you to keep an eye out for future opportunities that align with your qualifications and career aspirations. <br><br>You can search for other opportunities and check the status of your applications any time via your Candidate Home account by clicking the buttons below.<br><br>Sincerely,<br>Sentara Talent Acquisition</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:middle;width:200px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:middle;width:33%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:30px;"" class=""mj-column-per-33-333333333333336 mj-outlook-group-fix"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:30px;"" width=""100%"" ><tr><td align=""center"" vertical-align=""middle"" style=""font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;direction:ltr;"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""border-collapse:separate;line-height:100%;"" ><tr><td align=""center"" role=""presentation"" bg