<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Dear Netanya, We appreciate the time and effort you put forth in applying to Compensation Analyst at Virginia Remote . After thoughtful review and consideration of all applicants, we have decided to move forward with other candidates. While we didn’t feel that this role was a perfect fit for you, we appreciate your interest in Sentara. If you have other applications still in process with us, please proceed with any confirmed interviews and watch for further updates on your status. We also encourage you to keep an eye out for future opportunities that align with your qualifications and career aspirations. You can search for other opportunities and check the status of your applications any time via your Candidate Home account by clicking the buttons below.Sincerely,Sentara Talent AcquisitionLearn More About SentaraExplore Our Current Career OpportunitiesSign-In to View your Application Status and Open Tasks Emails replying to sentara@myworkday.com are not monitored. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-08-20 04:50:28+00:00,2026-08,Thursday
