bkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;background-color:#f3f3f3;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word""><table align=""center"" class=""container jv-container"" style=""Margin:0 auto;Margin-top:25px!important;background:#fefefe;background-color:#f3f3f3;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin:0 auto;margin-top:25px!important;max-width:960px!important;padding:0;text-align:inherit;vertical-align:top;width:95%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><td style=""-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word""><table class=""row jv-table-bg"" style=""background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cbcbcb;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th class=""small-12 large-12 columns first last"" style=""Margin:0 auto;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px;text-align:left;width:-zf-grid-calc-px(12,12,580px)""><table style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th style=""Margin:0;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left""><table height=""100"" class=""row jv-header"" style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;height:100px;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th class=""jv-logo-col small-12 large-12 columns first last"" height=""100"" valign=""middle"" style=""Margin:0 auto;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0 auto;margin-bottom:0!important;padding:0;padding-bottom:0!important;padding-left:0!important;padding-right:16px;text-align:left;width:-zf-grid-calc-pct(12,12)""><table style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th style=""Margin:0;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left""><img class=""jv-logo"" style=""-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;clear:both;display:block;max-height:50px;max-width:100%;outline:0;text-decoration:none;width:auto"" alt=""Quantum Health"" height=""50"" src=""https://d3igejkwe1ucjd.cloudfront.net/company/qVKaVfwu/assets/email/images/file/2026QHMeta_1768599085828.jpg""></th><th class=""expander"" style=""Margin:0;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0!important;text-align:left;visibility:hidden;width:0""></th></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table>  <p><b>Netanya</b>,<br /><br />Thank you so much for your interest in the <b>Pricing Analyst</b> position <b>(requisition 2026-3356)</b> at Quantum Health. <br /><br />We apologize for the delay in getting back to you. However, after reviewing your application, the hiring team has decided to pursue candidates who more closely align with the needs of this position at this time. Therefore, you will not be moving forward in the selection process for this opportunity. <br /><br />We know that finding your next opportunity can feel overwhelming, so we truly appreciate the time and energy you spent in our recruiting process. <br /><br />Moving forward, we encourage you to:<br />+ Visit <a href=""https://careers.quantum-health.com"">careers.quantum-health.com</a><br />+ Search/apply for other positions with our organization that interest you.<br />+ Sign up for job alerts to notify you as new positions become available.<br /><br />Note: this does not apply to other position(s) you may be in consideration for at Quantum Health. We will also keep your application on file for ongoing consideration (in accordance with company policies and applicable data privacy regulations).<br /><br />We wish you the best in your career search.<br /><br />--<br />Quantum Health Talent Acquisition<br />https://www.quantum-health.com/careers</p></th></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table><table class=""row center jv-footer-container"" style=""Margin-top:10px!important;background-color:#f3f3f3;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;margin-top:10px!important;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th class=""small-12 large-12 columns first last"" style=""Margin:0 auto;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px;text-align:left;width:-zf-grid-calc-px(12,12,580px)""><table style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th style=""Margin:0;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left""><span class=""jv-footer-identifier"" style=""display:none"">-*_____</span>  <table class=""row"" style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><p style=""Margin:0;Margin-bottom:10px;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.6px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;margin-bottom:10px;padding:0;text-align:left""> <a href=""https://app.jobvite.com/l?ksP22wlwf"" style=""color:#666666""><b>Email Preferences</b></a> |      <a href=""https://www.jobvite.com/"" style=""color:#666666""><b>Powered by Jobvite</b></a> </p></tr></tbody></table><span class=""jv-footer-identifier"" style=""display:none"">*______*</span></th></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></table><!-- prevent Gmail on iOS font size manipulation --><div style=""display:none;white-space:nowrap;font:15px courier;line-height:0""></div></body></html>","Netanya,Thank you so much for your interest in the Pricing Analyst position (requisition 2026-3356) at Quantum Health. We apologize for the delay in getting back to you. However, after reviewing your application, the hiring team has decided to pursue candidates who more closely align with the needs of this position at this time. Therefore, you will not be moving forward in the selection process for this opportunity. We know that finding your next opportunity can feel overwhelming, so we truly appreciate the time and energy you spent in our recruiting process. Moving forward, we encourage you to:+ Visit careers.quantum-health.com+ Search/apply for other positions with our organization that interest you.+ Sign up for job alerts to notify you as new positions become available.Note: this does not apply to other position(s) you may be in consideration for at Quantum Health. We will also keep your application on file for ongoing consideration (in accordance with company policies and applicable data privacy regulations).We wish you the best in your career search.--Quantum Health Talent Acquisitionhttps://www.quantum-health.com/careers-*_____ Email Preferences | Powered by Jobvite *______*",True,Quantum Health Recruiting Team,Quantum Health Recruiting Team,Pricing Analyst,2026-08-17 14:25:58+00:00,2026-08,Monday
42,1a0100cb668064e4,"Mon, 17 Aug 2026 14:07:27 +0000",Meggie Kennedy <meggie.kennedy@prominenceadvisors.com>,Data Engineer - Prominence Advisors,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in the Data Engineer position with Prominence Advisors. We truly appreciate both your interest in Prominence and this position. We've had a chance to review your qualifications and while we're impressed with your skills, we have decided to move forward with other candidates at this time.

I'm happy to stay in touch should anything change, or if other opportunities with Prominence come up that may better fit your background. You are also welcome to continue to check our careers page<https://prominenceadvisors.com/careers/> which stays up-to-date on openings.

Thank you again for your time and interest in Prominence. Best of luck in your search!

Meggie Kennedy

