45,1a00c20113984869,"Sun, 16 Aug 2026 19:50:23 +0000",Trend Health Partners <no-reply@hire.lever.co>,Thank you for your application to Trend Health Partners,"<p>Netanya,</p>
<p>Thank you for your interest in&nbsp;Trend Health Partners! We wanted to let you know we received your application for Claims Analyst I (US Remote), and we are delighted that you would consider joining our team.</p>
<p>Our team will review your application and will be in touch if your qualifications match our needs for the role. If you are not selected for this position, keep an eye on our jobs page as we're growing and adding openings.</p>
<p>Regards,</p>
<p>Trend Health Partners</p>
