ith us again soon.<br><br>Sincerely, <br><br>The Careers Team at Allstate Insurance Company <br/><br/>R32928</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></div><!--[if mso | IE]><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" width=""600"" align=""center"" style=""width:600px;""><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:auto;max-width:600px;"">
