</div>
<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Hello Netanya, Thank you for applying to the Entry Level Financial Analyst position. We know you have many options in your job search, and we appreciate you applying for a role here at Allstate Insurance Company. We reviewed your application, and while we selected another candidate for this position, we still think your skills have great potential here. New opportunities are always being posted on our careers site — we hope you will apply with us again soon.Sincerely, The Careers Team at Allstate Insurance Company R32928 This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,MyHR,MyHR,Allstate Insurance Company,2026-08-16 07:52:00+00:00,2026-08,Sunday
