49,1a0018a5b592fe5a,"Fri, 14 Aug 2026 18:30:38 +0000 (UTC)",Eaton TalentHub <noreply@talenthub.eaton.com>,Update Regarding Your Application,"<p>Hi Netanya,</p>

<p>Thank you for applying for the position of Scheduler - 1st Shift &ndash; 70648. We appreciate you considering a career at Eaton. After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match the current needs for this team and position.</p>

<p>We know that messages like this are disappointing, but we really hope you continue to pursue other opportunities at Eaton. Be sure to check out Eaton.com/careers, where you can find all our open jobs and set up a job alert.</p>

<p>Thank you for your interest in Eaton and wish you all the best!</p>

<p>Eaton Talent Acquisition Team</p>
","Hi Netanya, Thank you for applying for the position of Scheduler - 1st Shift – 70648. We appreciate you considering a career at Eaton. After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match the current needs for this team and position. We know that messages like this are disappointing, but we really hope you continue to pursue other opportunities at Eaton. Be sure to check out Eaton.com/careers, where you can find all our open jobs and set up a job alert. Thank you for your interest in Eaton and wish you all the best! Eaton Talent Acquisition Team",True,Eaton TalentHub,Eaton,Unknown,2026-08-14 18:30:38+00:00,2026-08,Friday
