52,19ffbc6f7f359460,"Thu, 13 Aug 2026 15:39:07 +0000 (GMT)",<AirLife.hr@adp.com>,Application Status Update,"<html><head><style type=""text/css"">p {margin-block-start: 0 !important; margin-block-end: 0 !important; margin: 0px !important;}</style></head><body><div style='background-color: #ffff00;padding: 5px 10px 5px 10px;width:100%;text-align: center'>Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at AirLife using ADP services. </div><br/><br/><p><link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.2.0/css/froala_editor.pkgd.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""><link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.2.0/css/froala_style.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""></p><div class=""fr-view""><p><a href=""https://www.myairlife.com/careers/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer""><img src=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/cccustom/Client/Recruitment/airlife%20banner_ff335764-d6a8-4038-976f-3143ec8f044b.jpg"" style=""width: 1114px;"" class=""fr-fic fr-dib"" filepath=""/Client/Recruitment/airlife%20banner_ff335764-d6a8-4038-976f-3143ec8f044b.jpg"" status=""success"" isreadonly=""false"" requestresponseid=""a31860c1-1c10-46d1-ad1c-b4a1cc9c29a5"" servertimetaken=""1171""></a><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Dear <span comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Candidate First Name"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272509"" class=""fr-deletable"">Netanya</span> <span comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Candidate Last Name"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272511"" class=""fr-deletable"">Kelley</span>,</p><p><br></p><p id=""isPasted"">Thank you for your interest in our <span class=""fr-deletable"" contenteditable=""false"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272512"" label=""Position Title"" datatype=""Text"" comboservice=""undefined"">Data Analyst</span> at AirLife. At this time, we will not be moving forward with your application for this opportunity. We will retain your application for future opportunities. We wish you the best in your career search and appreciate your interest in AirLife. </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>AirLife Talent Acquisition Team</p><p><br></p><p><img src=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/cccustom/Client/Recruitment/airlife_final_color_dd2db940-0447-4777-83e9-1f812b555049.jpg"" style=""width: 172px;"" class=""fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil"" filepath=""/Client/Recruitment/airlife_final_color_dd2db940-0447-4777-83e9-1f812b555049.jpg"" status=""success"" isreadonly=""false"" requestresponseid=""f40e76a2-2107-4d94-bca6-89d3ade36484"" servertimetaken=""1216""></p></div><style>p {margin-block-start: 0em !important; margin-block-end: 0em !important;}</style><br/><a href=""https://brightjump.adp.com/public/home"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer""><img src=""https://workforcenow.adp.com/mascsr/default/mdf/recruitment/brightJump.png"" alt=""ADP BrightJump Career Resources"" style=""display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;"" /></a><br/><br/>Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.<img style=""display:none !important;border-style:none !important;""  alt="""" width=""1"" height=""1"" src=""https://netsecure.adp.com/communication-ui/event/id/y6tv1sj1qe2qkrh5.jpg?eventDetails=cgWVO7wAvJP0e55vk3avQZwQNbb20qdKigbIXublz1KN-PM1GIdwIMSgA7hhlwXZr0LQKvSQv26tUqViYQRAGOa_6c1IOgHx06PemYcik5cyEqOb-RauCpwcmEehIenwOQ19gtDe3G64ku9Kj9dE7GvPYtNYcsFX8uO8aAA0ghQUefZvlbETxwtl-7-Is3ZjH51aLBe5QscR3glzRt9ebTXBYHKCwvOHAWHbdoi3E95KHaQPmcbGlXRsWsvzHFQ3"" /></body></html>","Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at AirLife using ADP services. Dear Netanya Kelley,Thank you for your interest in our Data Analyst at AirLife. At this time, we will not be moving forward with your application for this opportunity. We will retain your application for future opportunities. We wish you the best in your career search and appreciate your interest in AirLife. AirLife Talent Acquisition TeamNote: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.",True,,,Unknown,2026-08-13 15:39:07+00:00,2026-08,Thursday
53,19ffb6d374890075,"Thu, 13 Aug 2026 14:00:59 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Togetherwork Application for Data Migration Specialist Position,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for applying for the Data Migration Specialist position at Togetherwork. We really appreciate your interest in joining our company and want to thank you for the time and energy you invested in applying for our job opening.

After careful consideration of all applications received, we regret to inform you that we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time. While your qualifications are impressive, we have decided to proceed with candidates whose experience more closely aligns with our current needs.

We encourage you to check our careers page for opportunities that match your skills and interests. Your application will remain in our database for future consideration.

To assist you in your job search, we recommend the following resources:

Work It Daily ( https://www.workitdaily.com/ )
The Muse ( https://www.themuse.com/advice/the-ultimate-interview-guide-30-prep-tips-for-job-interview-success )
Andrew LaCivita ( https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP1UlYJH_QL4m5HVyikcxfQ )

We wish you the best in your professional endeavors.

Sincerely,

Togetherwork Recruitment Team
