56,19ff714144cb38a5,"Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:45:14 +0000 (UTC)",CHS Careers <careers@chs.net>,Healthcare Technology Management Analyst Application Response,"<p style=""font-family:'-apple-system' , 'blinkmacsystemfont' , 'segoe ui' , 'helvetica neue' , 'arial' , sans-serif;background-color:rgb( 255 , 255 , 255 )"">Dear Netanya,<br><font color=""#222222""><font face=""Arial, sans-serif""><br>
   Thank you for your interest in employment opportunities with our organization and for applying to the Healthcare Technology Management Analyst position at&nbsp;https://fa-evxo-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com:443/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/job/158186</font><span style=""font-family:'arial' , sans-serif"">. </span></font><span style=""color:rgb( 34 , 34 , 34 );font-family:'arial' , sans-serif"">This message serves as confirmation that your application has been received.<br></span><span style=""color:rgb( 34 , 34 , 34 );font-family:'arial' , sans-serif""><br>
  Based on our review of your application in relation to the requirements for this role, we will not be moving forward with next steps at this time.<br></span><span style=""color:rgb( 34 , 34 , 34 );font-family:'arial' , sans-serif""><br>
  Your application profile will remain active within our talent community and could be considered for future opportunities aligned with your background and experience. You may also receive notifications regarding positions aligned with your interests and experience.&nbsp;<br></span><span style=""color:rgb( 34 , 34 , 34 );font-family:'arial' , sans-serif""><br>
  We appreciate your interest in our organization and thank you for the time invested in applying.&nbsp;</span></p>
","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in employment opportunities with our organization and for applying to the Healthcare Technology Management Analyst position at https://fa-evxo-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com:443/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/job/158186. This message serves as confirmation that your application has been received. Based on our review of your application in relation to the requirements for this role, we will not be moving forward with next steps at this time. Your application profile will remain active within our talent community and could be considered for future opportunities aligned with your background and experience. You may also receive notifications regarding positions aligned with your interests and experience. We appreciate your interest in our organization and thank you for the time invested in applying.",True,CHS Careers,CHS Careers,Healthcare Technology Management Analyst,2026-08-12 17:45:14+00:00,2026-08,Wednesday
57,19ff60f1ef81fe9c,"Wed, 12 Aug 2026 13:00:11 +0000",Allied Benefit Systems <donotreply@msg.paycomonline.com>,Thanks for Applying,"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN"" ""http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd"">
<html><body><p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">Dear&nbsp;Netanya</span></p>

<p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">We want to express our gratitude to you for taking the time to apply for the Reporting Specialist position at Allied Benefit Systems. We sincerely appreciate your interest in joining our team.<br>
<br>
After careful consideration, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match the requirements and qualifications we&rsquo;re seeking for this role. Please know that our decision was not easy as we received many impressive applications. We value your skills and experience, and we encourage you to keep an eye out for future opportunities with us.&nbsp;We wish you all the best and thank you again for your application and interest in Allied Benefit Systems.</span></p>

<p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">Regards,<br>
Talent Acquisition Team</span></p>

<p><span style=""font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"">talent@alliedbenefit.com&nbsp;</span></p>
</body></html>

