61,19fec1310e8e7402,"Mon, 10 Aug 2026 14:28:19 +0000",MediaRadar <noreply@candidates.workablemail.com>,"Data Analyst, Advertising Insights & Strategy - MediaRadar","
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------



Hi Netanya,

Thank you for taking the time to apply for our position of Data Analyst,
Advertising Insights &amp; Strategy here at MediaRadar. We really appreciate
your interest in joining the team!

We had a ton of great talent apply for this opening, and while your background
is impressive, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose
experience is a slightly closer match for what we need right now.

I know this isn't the news you were hoping for, and rejections are never fun to
read. But please keep an eye on our Careers page for anything further that may
interest you. As we continue to grow, we're always opening up new positions.

Wishing you all the best, Netanya!

Julia Dolson



-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

