  <div>
    <div>
  <p>Hi Netanya,</p>
<p>Thank you for taking the time to apply for our position of Data Analyst, Advertising Insights &amp; Strategy here at MediaRadar. We really appreciate your interest in joining the team!</p>
<p>We had a ton of great talent apply for this opening, and while your background is impressive, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience is a slightly closer match for what we need right now.</p>
<p>I know this isn't the news you were hoping for, and rejections are never fun to read. But please keep an eye on our <a href=""https://mediaradar.com/careers/"" rel=""nofollow noreferrer noopener"" class=""external"">Careers</a> page for anything further that may interest you. As we continue to grow, we're always opening up new positions.</p>
<p>Wishing you all the best, Netanya!</p>
<p>Julia Dolson<br /></p>
</div>

