   <body><div>Dear Netanya ,<br><br>We have received your application for the position of R-49815 Intern - Provider Data
      Reporting . After careful consideration, we have decided to pursue other candidates
      at this time.<br><br>We will retain your candidate file in our database and we also invite you to visit
      the Career Section on our website regularly.<br><br>We thank you for your interest in our Company and we wish you all the best in your
      career.<br><br>Best regards,<br><br>Talent Acquisition<br>BlueCross BlueShield of Tennessee<br><br>Replies to this message are undeliverable and will not reach the Talent Acquisition
      Department. Please do not reply.</div><div><img src=""cid:fxhcBNyNUj""/></div>
