</html>","Dear Netanya ,We have received your application for the position of R-49815 Intern - Provider Data Reporting . After careful consideration, we have decided to pursue other candidates at this time.We will retain your candidate file in our database and we also invite you to visit the Career Section on our website regularly.We thank you for your interest in our Company and we wish you all the best in your career.Best regards,Talent AcquisitionBlueCross BlueShield of TennesseeReplies to this message are undeliverable and will not reach the Talent Acquisition Department. Please do not reply. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-08-10 14:23:46+00:00,2026-08,Monday
