64,19fe1e3f7995d5a5,"Sat, 08 Aug 2026 15:00:39 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Important information about your application to Securitize,"Netanya,

Thanks for your interest in Securitize.

Unfortunately, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy for the Investor Relations Analyst position.

After careful review, we’ve determined that your background is not the right match for the requirements of this position at this time. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team.

Thanks again for your interest in Securitize and we wish you luck in your search.

Regards,
Securitize
<p>Netanya,</p>
<p>Thanks for your interest in Securitize.</p>
<p>Unfortunately, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy for the Investor Relations Analyst position.</p>
<p><!--StartFragment-->After careful review, we&rsquo;ve determined that your background is not the right match for the requirements of this position at this time. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team.<!--EndFragment--></p>
<p>Thanks again for your interest in Securitize and we wish you luck in your search.</p>
<p>Regards,<br>Securitize</p>","Netanya, Thanks for your interest in Securitize. Unfortunately, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy for the Investor Relations Analyst position. After careful review, we’ve determined that your background is not the right match for the requirements of this position at this time. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team. Thanks again for your interest in Securitize and we wish you luck in your search. Regards, Securitize Netanya, Thanks for your interest in Securitize. Unfortunately, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy for the Investor Relations Analyst position. After careful review, we’ve determined that your background is not the right match for the requirements of this position at this time. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team. Thanks again for your interest in Securitize and we wish you luck in your search. Regards,Securitize",True,Securitize,Securitize,Unknown,2026-08-08 15:00:39+00:00,2026-08,Saturday
