<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Hello Netanya, Thank you for applying for the Government Provider Operations Analyst position at Teladoc Health. We had a highly competitive pool of applicants, and making a decision was incredibly difficult. Unfortunately, we will not be moving forward with your application for this position. However, we were genuinely impressed by your background and industry knowledge. At Teladoc Health, we’re committed to helping you discover a meaningful career path. We encourage you to stay connected by exploring our career page for new opportunities. Check back often as our job postings are updated regularly, and sign up for job alerts so you don’t miss a chance to grow your career with us.Career PageJob AlertsThank you again for your interest in Teladoc Health. Best of luck with your current search. Warm regards,Teladoc Health Recruiting TeamTeladoc Health (NYSE: TDOC), the global leader in virtual care. Here, you’re empowered to bring your true self to work while helping millions of people live their healthiest lives.Join a high-performing culture where colleagues embrace challenges, drive transformative solutions, and provide diverse opportunities for personal and professional growth. Together, we’re transforming how better health happens. © Teladoc Health, Inc. All rights reserved. 155 E 44th Street, Suite 1700, New York, NY 10017This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-08-08 05:16:25+00:00,2026-08,Saturday
66,19fddb950d675bf0,"Fri, 7 Aug 2026 19:35:36 +0000 (GMT)",<DeceraClinical.hr@adp.com>,Thank you for your interest in Decera Clinical,"<html><head><style type=""text/css"">p {margin-block-start: 0 !important; margin-block-end: 0 !important; margin: 0px !important;}</style></head><body><div style='background-color: #ffff00;padding: 5px 10px 5px 10px;width:100%;text-align: center'>Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at Decera Clinical using ADP services. </div><br/><br/>
    <link href=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/mas/mdf-components/25.49.15/styles/froala_editor.pkgd.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css"" />
    <link href=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/mas/mdf-components/25.49.15/styles/froala_style.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css"" />

    <div class=""fr-view"">
      <p data-pasted=""true"">Hi <span data-placeholder-token=""true""><span contenteditable=""false"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272509"" label=""Candidate First Name"" datatype=""Text"" comboservice=""undefined"">Netanya</span></span>,</p><p>Thank you for taking the time to apply for the <span data-placeholder-token=""true""><span contenteditable=""false"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272512"" label=""Position Title"" datatype=""Text"" comboservice=""undefined"">Associate Data & Analytics Engineer </span></span> role at Decera Clinical. We appreciate your interest and the effort you put into your application.</p><p>After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with our current needs.</p><p>This was not an easy decision, and we encourage you to apply for future opportunities with us that may be a better fit for your background and interests. We truly appreciate your interest in joining our team and wish you all the best in your job search.</p><p>Warm regards,</p><p>Decera Clinical Talent Acquisition Team</p><p><a target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"" href=""//deceraclinical.com"">deceraclinical.com</a></p>
    </div>
  <br/><a href=""https://brightjump.adp.com/public/home"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer""><img src=""https://workforcenow.adp.com/mascsr/default/mdf/recruitment/brightJump.png"" alt=""ADP BrightJump Career Resources"" style=""display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;"" /></a><br/><br/>Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.<img style=""display:none !important;border-style:none !important;""  alt="""" width=""1"" height=""1"" src=""https://netsecure.adp.com/communication-ui/event/id/wssx7isdpksnby2b.jpg?eventDetails=iTF2dPCvDKsQcUp655bG9fPnO-yPbenoOtZvgHERKhcKjMlth89hn08bnXzYetj_weX8rhD0JCNu4h5li1Tpa4L-P1NrWq9s-fdCr93wccZjcpaavYcOkGa4LTKSYkjqFfyS2trGvt0Y5cxhpLOWuMZGytl2wVCceXONrBqbuNCpSwGGBYSrreap51An9VzLliP-jPP5tpiv2trtzI2VX412Y2OFW6DSvJeTLfOQ7DW6yfE1jtbpMm0zx6yC8QeG"" /></body></html>","Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at Decera Clinical using ADP services. Hi Netanya,Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Associate Data & Analytics Engineer role at Decera Clinical. We appreciate your interest and the effort you put into your application.After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with our current needs.This was not an easy decision, and we encourage you to apply for future opportunities with us that may be a better fit for your background and interests. We truly appreciate your interest in joining our team and wish you all the best in your job search.Warm regards,Decera Clinical Talent Acquisition Teamdeceraclinical.com Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.",True,,,Unknown,2026-08-07 19:35:36+00:00,2026-08,Friday
