68,19fd85c4489927e0,"Thu, 06 Aug 2026 18:35:53 +0000",Highland Electric Fleets <no-reply@hire.lever.co>,Thank you for your application to Highland Electric Fleets,"<div>Hi Netanya,</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Thank you for your interest in Highland Electric Fleets! We wanted to let you know we received your application for Federal Incentive Analyst.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Our team will review your application and will be in touch if your qualifications match our needs for the role. If you are not selected for this position, keep an eye on our jobs page as we're growing and adding openings.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Best,</div>
<div>The Highland Electric Fleets Team</div>
","Hi Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Highland Electric Fleets! We wanted to let you know we received your application for Federal Incentive Analyst. Our team will review your application and will be in touch if your qualifications match our needs for the role. If you are not selected for this position, keep an eye on our jobs page as we're growing and adding openings. Best, The Highland Electric Fleets Team",True,Highland Electric Fleets,Highland Electric Fleets,Unknown,2026-08-06 18:35:53+00:00,2026-08,Thursday
