<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Guidehouse and your application for the Palantir Data Engineer position. We have reviewed your resume and have carefully considered your qualifications. While your skills are certainly impressive, we have decided to pursue other candidates for this position. We will maintain your records and should a position open that matches your qualifications, we will contact you. We also encourage you to visit our website as new positions become available as well as set up job alerts where the system will notify you automatically when new positions become available that match your criteria. We appreciate your interest in our firm and wish you success in your career search. Thank You, Guidehouse Talent Acquisition Team NOTE: Replies to this email inbox are not monitored. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com Guidehouse, Inc. • Washington, D.C.",True,Guidehouse Workday Notification,Guidehouse Workday,42342 Palantir Data Engineer (Open),2026-08-06 13:46:25+00:00,2026-08,Thursday
