<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Hi Netanya , Thank you for your interest in the Junior Product Analyst position at Assurant.While this email is automatically generated, our review process is not. Here is what will happen next:Our Talent Acquisition Team is working hard to review every resume/CV submitted to us and identify the strongest candidates to move forward in the process. Additionally, you can always check the status of your application for this position by visiting your Candidate Home page by clicking the button below. Candidate Home PageIf you are selected, an associate from our Assurant Talent Acquisition Team will reach out to you via phone, email, or text to discuss next steps.If you are not selected, please understand that several factors can influence our decision. Often, we are fortunate to have a robust candidate response and are not able to connect personally with every applicant. We encourage you to visit our career site using the button below, and to apply to other opportunities we may have available. We also invite you to join our Talent Community to receive updates about Assurant and our open roles. Careers SiteTalent Community Assurant is dedicated to ensuring you have a great candidate experience. We aim to provide consistent communication throughout your candidacy with us, regardless of the outcome. You may receive an email to complete a quick survey to provide feedback on the recruiting process. Thank you again for your interest in Assurant, where we help people thrive in a connected world. Sincerely, Assurant Talent Acquisition Assurant collects your professional and employment related personal information for purposes of employment, benefits and compensation. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Junior Product Analyst,2026-08-06 08:51:03+00:00,2026-08,Thursday
