</html>","Hello Netanya, Thank you again for submitting your application for the position of Customs Analyst We have carefully reviewed your application. While we were impressed by your experience, we have not selected your application for this position. We encourage you to keep checking for job opportunities on our Careers page and to apply for positions that reflect your professional goals.Please note through your application you agree that your Personal Data is matched with job profiles within Magna’s global recruitment program for the purpose of contacting you and offering you potentially suitable positions within Magna Group Companies. Furthermore, you consent to your profile with your Personal Data being recommended to all Magna Affiliate Companies for potentially suitable positions.Thank you for your interest in Magna, we wish you all the best for your future and your career.Best Regards,Magna Recruitment Team This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,MIT_SH_Workday_Support,MIT_SH_Workday_Support,Unknown,2026-07-31 04:03:22+00:00,2026-07,Friday
