","Hi Netanya,Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Production Implementation Analyst position with PakEnergy, LLC. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team.After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose qualifications more closely match the needs of this role. This was not an easy decision, as we had many strong applicants.Thank you once again for your interest, and we wish you the very best in your job search and career journey.Best regards,PakEnergy, LLC Recruiting Team ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏An update on your application from PakEnergy, LLCHi Netanya,Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Production Implementation Analyst position with PakEnergy, LLC. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team.After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose qualifications more closely match the needs of this role. This was not an easy decision, as we had many strong applicants.Thank you once again for your interest, and we wish you the very best in your job search and career journey.Best regards,PakEnergy, LLC Recruiting TeamReplying to this email will not result in sending a message to the employer.© 2026 Indeed, Inc.Austin Indeed Tower, 200 West 6th Street, Floor 36, Austin, TX 78701Indeed.comPrivacy PolicyTermsHelp",True,"""PakEnergy, LLC""","""PakEnergy, LLC""",Production Implementation Analyst,2026-07-30 16:01:04+00:00,2026-07,Thursday
83,19fb184595583482,"Thu, 30 Jul 2026 05:34:28 +0000",rockwellautomation <rockwellautomation@myworkday.com>,An update for you from Rockwell Automation (USA) on your recent application for IT Analyst - Business Operations,"<!doctype html><html xmlns:v=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml"" xmlns:o=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"">
   <head>
      <meta http-equiv=""Content-Type"" content=""text/html; charset=UTF-8"">
      <title></title><style type=""text/css"">body, table {
  font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;
