{
  border:0px;
}</style></head>
   <body><div>Dear Netanya, <br/><br/>Thank you for taking the time to apply with the Rockwell Automation
      (USA) team for the IT Analyst - Business Operations role. We want to express our sincere
      appreciation for taking the time and energy in dedicating to the application and interview
      process. Your application shows many powerful skills and abilities to do amazing work
      and we are very fortunate you took the time and consideration to apply to our organization.<br><br>After careful review, unfortunately, we regret to inform you that we have decided
      to move forward with other applicants. While we will not be moving forward with your
      application for IT Analyst - Business Operations, we hope you continue to apply for
      other positions. If you wish to receive automated job alerts for positions you may
      be interested in, please sign up for our Talent Network.<br><br>We wish you the best going forward with your career search. <br/><br/>Sincerely, <br/><br/>Talent
      Acquisition</div>
