</html>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for taking the time to apply with the Rockwell Automation (USA) team for the IT Analyst - Business Operations role. We want to express our sincere appreciation for taking the time and energy in dedicating to the application and interview process. Your application shows many powerful skills and abilities to do amazing work and we are very fortunate you took the time and consideration to apply to our organization.After careful review, unfortunately, we regret to inform you that we have decided to move forward with other applicants. While we will not be moving forward with your application for IT Analyst - Business Operations, we hope you continue to apply for other positions. If you wish to receive automated job alerts for positions you may be interested in, please sign up for our Talent Network.We wish you the best going forward with your career search. Sincerely, Talent Acquisition This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com Rockwell Automation · 1201 S 2nd St. Milwaukee, WI, United States.",True,rockwellautomation,rockwellautomation,IT Analyst - Business Operations,2026-07-30 05:34:28+00:00,2026-07,Thursday
