86,19fa5389d3d93d08,"Mon, 27 Jul 2026 20:16:17 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Important information about your application to Ashley Digital,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Product Analyst position at Ashley Digital and for sharing your background and experience with us.

After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates for this role. This decision was not easy given the number of strong applications we received, including yours.

We sincerely appreciate your interest in Ashley Digital and the time you invested in the application process. We encourage you to keep an eye on future opportunities with us, as we’re always looking for great talent to join our team.

Wishing you all the best in your job search and future endeavors.

Warm regards,The Ashley Digital Talent Team
