<body style='font-family: Arial, Times New Roman, Verdana, Sans-Serif; padding: 5px 5px 5px 5px; margin: 0px; border-style: none; background-color: #ffffff'>
<div><div><img src= ""https://hyatt.taleo.net/custom/images/company_logo_01.gif""> </img></div>
<div><br />
</div>
<div>Dear Netanya,</div>
<div><br />
</div>
<p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"">Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Data Quality Analyst opportunity at Global Care Center>Global Care Center Americas - Omaha Hub!&nbsp; After careful review and consideration, we have decided to move forward with other candidates at this time.</p>
<p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px""><br />
</p>
<p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"">We value your experience and invite you to update your profile in order to be notified when opportunities become available based on your interest or specifications.&nbsp; To access your profile and update these preferences, click here. Your username is: netanyakelley6@gmail.com. You may also visit careers.hyatt.com to view other jobs that may interest you.</p>
<p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px""><br />
</p>
<p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"">Thank you again for your interest in Global Care Center>Global Care Center Americas - Omaha Hub and for the time you have invested in pursuing a career with us. We wish you the best of luck with your job search and hope you will keep us in mind for future positions.</p>
<p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px""><br />
</p>
<div>Kind Regards,</div>
<p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"">The Global Care Center>Global Care Center Americas - Omaha Hub Team</p>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>At Hyatt, we care for people so they can be their best!</div>
<div><br />
</div>
<div>Follow us on:&nbsp;</div>
