gcolor=""#f3f3f3"" style=""-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;background-color:#f3f3f3;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word""><table align=""center"" class=""container jv-container"" style=""Margin:0 auto;Margin-top:25px!important;background:#fefefe;background-color:#f3f3f3;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin:0 auto;margin-top:25px!important;max-width:960px!important;padding:0;text-align:inherit;vertical-align:top;width:95%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><td style=""-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word""><table class=""row jv-table-bg"" style=""background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cbcbcb;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th class=""small-12 large-12 columns first last"" style=""Margin:0 auto;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px;text-align:left;width:-zf-grid-calc-px(12,12,580px)""><table style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th style=""Margin:0;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left""> <table class=""spacer"" style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><td height=""20"" style=""-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:20px;margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word"">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table> <p>Dear Netanya,<br /><br />Thank you for applying for the Specialist, People Analytics and Data Analysis position with Partners In Health. We appreciate your interest in our organization and your commitment to transforming global health care.<br /><br />We have been fortunate to receive applications from many qualified candidates. Although we are impressed with your background and experience, we have decided to pursue other candidates who we believe more closely match the requirements for the position and needs of the department. <br /><br />On behalf of our team, thank you again for the time you have invested in this opportunity. We wish you the best as you continue your job search, and we encourage you to visit the PIH website for future openings.<br /><br /><br />Sincerely,<br /><br />The Partners In Health Recruiting Team</p></th></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table><table class=""row center jv-footer-container"" style=""Margin-top:10px!important;background-color:#f3f3f3;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;margin-top:10px!important;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th class=""small-12 large-12 columns first last"" style=""Margin:0 auto;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px;text-align:left;width:-zf-grid-calc-px(12,12,580px)""><table style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><th style=""Margin:0;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left""><span class=""jv-footer-identifier"" style=""display:none"">-*_____</span>  <table class=""row"" style=""border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%""><tbody><tr style=""padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top""><p style=""Margin:0;Margin-bottom:10px;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.6px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;margin:0;margin-bottom:10px;padding:0;text-align:left""> <a href=""https://app.jobvite.com/l?ksP22wlwf"" style=""color:#666666""><b>Email Preferences</b></a> |      <a href=""https://www.jobvite.com/"" style=""color:#666666""><b>Powered by Jobvite</b></a> </p></tr></tbody></table><span class=""jv-footer-identifier"" style=""display:none"">*______*</span></th></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></table><!-- prevent Gmail on iOS font size manipulation --><div style=""display:none;white-space:nowrap;font:15px courier;line-height:0""></div></body></html>","Dear Netanya,Thank you for applying for the Specialist, People Analytics and Data Analysis position with Partners In Health. We appreciate your interest in our organization and your commitment to transforming global health care.We have been fortunate to receive applications from many qualified candidates. Although we are impressed with your background and experience, we have decided to pursue other candidates who we believe more closely match the requirements for the position and needs of the department. On behalf of our team, thank you again for the time you have invested in this opportunity. We wish you the best as you continue your job search, and we encourage you to visit the PIH website for future openings.Sincerely,The Partners In Health Recruiting Team-*_____ Email Preferences | Powered by Jobvite *______*",True,Partners In Health Recruiting Team,Partners In Health Recruiting Team,"Specialist, People Analytics and Data Analysis at Partners In Health",2026-07-26 19:00:13+00:00,2026-07,Sunday
