94,19f90fa879defc4e,"Thu, 23 Jul 2026 21:56:04 +0000 (UTC)",Linnelle Prudhomme from RR Donnelley <notifications@smartrecruiters.com>,RRD: Thank you for your interest - eBilling Analyst - Remote (Legal Services),"
Hi Netanya,
We&rsquo;re delighted you would consider RRD for your next career opportunity and appreciate the time you took to apply for the eBilling Analyst - Remote (Legal Services) &nbsp;role. Upon careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we&#39;ve decided to move forward with other candidates that more closely match our needs.
We know that this isn&rsquo;t the news you hoped to hear and this is the hardest part of the process. However, we encourage you to actively check our career page for other opportunities, and to follow us on LinkedIn to keep up with new roles and opportunities at R.R. Donnelley. We hope to see you apply for other roles in the future that align with your interests and skill-set and we wish you the best in finding your next opportunity.&nbsp;
Sincerely,
RRD Human Resources
&nbsp;
Disclaimer: If you have applied to multiple roles with us, please note that you may receive separate notifications regarding each position.
<div style=""color:transparent;height:1px"">&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;</div><p><span style=""color:#000000"">Hi Netanya</span><span style=""color:#000000"">,</span></p><p><span style=""color:#000000"">We&rsquo;re delighted you would consider RRD for your next career opportunity and appreciate the time you took to apply for the <strong>eBilling Analyst - Remote (Legal Services) </strong></span><span style=""color:#000000"">&nbsp;role. Upon careful consideration, we regret to inform you that </span><span style=""color:#202124""><span style=""background-color:#ffffff"">we&#39;ve decided to move forward with other candidates that more closely match our needs.</span></span></p><p><span style=""color:#000000"">We know that this isn&rsquo;t the news you hoped to hear and this is the hardest part of the process. However, we encourage you to actively check our</span><a href=""https://www.rrd.com/about/careers"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"" style=""text-decoration:none;"" target=""_blank""><span style=""color:#000000""> </span><span style=""color:#1155cc""><u>career page</u></span></a><span style=""color:#000000""> for other opportunities, and to follow us on</span><a href=""https://www.linkedin.com/company/rr-donnelley/about/"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"" style=""text-decoration:none;"" target=""_blank""><span style=""color:#000000""> </span><span style=""color:#1155cc""><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a><span style=""color:#000000""> to keep up with new roles and opportunities at R.R. Donnelley. We hope to see you apply for other roles in the future that align with your interests and skill-set and we wish you the best in finding your next opportunity.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=""color:#000000"">Sincerely,</span></p><p><span style=""color:#000000"">RRD Human Resources</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Disclaimer: If you have applied to multiple roles with us, please note that you may receive separate notifications regarding each position.</p>

","Hi Netanya, We’re delighted you would consider RRD for your next career opportunity and appreciate the time you took to apply for the eBilling Analyst - Remote (Legal Services) role. Upon careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we've decided to move forward with other candidates that more closely match our needs. We know that this isn’t the news you hoped to hear and this is the hardest part of the process. However, we encourage you to actively check our career page for other opportunities, and to follow us on LinkedIn to keep up with new roles and opportunities at R.R. Donnelley. We hope to see you apply for other roles in the future that align with your interests and skill-set and we wish you the best in finding your next opportunity. Sincerely, RRD Human Resources Disclaimer: If you have applied to multiple roles with us, please note that you may receive separate notifications regarding each position. ​​​​​​​​​​Hi Netanya,We’re delighted you would consider RRD for your next career opportunity and appreciate the time you took to apply for the eBilling Analyst - Remote (Legal Services) role. Upon careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we've decided to move forward with other candidates that more closely match our needs.We know that this isn’t the news you hoped to hear and this is the hardest part of the process. However, we encourage you to actively check our career page for other opportunities, and to follow us on LinkedIn to keep up with new roles and opportunities at R.R. Donnelley. We hope to see you apply for other roles in the future that align with your interests and skill-set and we wish you the best in finding your next opportunity. Sincerely,RRD Human Resources Disclaimer: If you have applied to multiple roles with us, please note that you may receive separate notifications regarding each position.",True,Linnelle Prudhomme from RR Donnelley,Linnelle Prudhomme from RR Donnelley,eBilling Analyst - Remote (Legal Services),2026-07-23 21:56:04+00:00,2026-07,Thursday
