97,19f8f3e58386019d,"Thu, 23 Jul 2026 13:50:55 +0000",thinkbrg@myworkday.com,Thank you for considering BRG,"<!doctype html><html xmlns:v=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml"" xmlns:o=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"">
