   <body><div>Dear Netanya, <br/><br/>We hope this email finds you well. We wanted to inform you
      that the Data Analyst position at BRG has been filled. We appreciate your interest
      in joining our team and the time you invested in the application process.<br><br>While we have selected another candidate for this role, we were impressed with your
      qualifications and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future openings
      that may align with your skills and experience.<br><br>Thank you for considering BRG and we wish you the best in your job search. <br/><br/>Sincerely,<br><br>BRG Talent Management</div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message.</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:CwdfYVEWEK""/></div>
