</html>","Dear Netanya, We hope this email finds you well. We wanted to inform you that the Data Analyst position at BRG has been filled. We appreciate your interest in joining our team and the time you invested in the application process.While we have selected another candidate for this role, we were impressed with your qualifications and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future openings that may align with your skills and experience.Thank you for considering BRG and we wish you the best in your job search. Sincerely,BRG Talent ManagementThis email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-07-23 13:50:55+00:00,2026-07,Thursday
98,19f876e12b733081,"Wed, 22 Jul 2026 01:26:05 +0000",NXTThing RPO <recruiting+429333865-f80c9828@applytojob.com>,"Junior Reporting & Analytics Specialist Update, NXTThing RPO","<p><span style=""font-size:12px;"">Hi&#160;Netanya,</span></p><p><span style=""font-size:12px;""><span style=""font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;""><span style=""font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;"">Thank you for your interest in the <strong>Junior Reporting &amp; Analytics Specialist</strong>&#160;position at NXTThing RPO. We truly appreciate the effort you've invested in applying and sharing your skills and experiences with us.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=""font-size:12px;""><span style=""font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;""><span style=""font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;"">We regret to inform you that, after careful consideration, we have chosen to move forward with other candidates for the next phase of the process. While we recognize the value you bring, we have had to make difficult decisions in determining the best match for this particular role.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=""font-size:12px;""><span style=""font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;""><span style=""font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;"">We encourage you to continue exploring opportunities with us. We believe there may be other positions that align more closely with your talents and aspirations, please continue to check our website for more opportunities</span></span></span></p><p><span style=""font-size:12px;""><span style=""font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;""><span style=""font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;""><span style=""color:#000000;"">Thank you once again for considering NXTThing RPO&#160;as a potential employer. </span></span><span style=""font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;"">We wish you the very best in your job search and hope to have the opportunity to connect with you again in the future.</span></span></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=""font-size:12px;""><span style=""font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;""><span style=""font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;"">Best Regards,</span></span></span></p><p><span style=""font-size:12px;""><span style=""font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;""><span style=""font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;"">NXTThing RPO Recruitment Team</span></span></span></p><img src=""https://ea.pstmrk.it/open?m=v3_1.ua5-6jkH6ec4F3vGoij9JQ.LyhZ32ZSO2QWZZKBmHWj8mmDcHzuGpOySkREqx0wRylhoCe8wyXWoMa3fNC62AU9Li97YplWMHXsDZimJa9qzGMtRY4AJ3SF3YTnbulWT-DdkaJQfFMdBSE6IbYfahomVM_nEAUwSb65NfBa7HAbjd4SpjX8DfzNAGe_IP5aYJHsPOVIUHWxCQhMkcUeLc2Yu2BJAj1RWVYVw6ig8SzOJbPtlHLLDolxjlCradkrzMGmKZSb_gq2gXRxUEWNoAZpf9Lzi90J7KcVPH-M-izWm7X56f2s6oz-w6AEyw4tYPnUya1nbd4C_2b8yYBTgRGtk5pvvw2t87Atng1NvPklmdIeD_pdR1uoa09XIeDbbn22LbkwePvFUovRNy63XpnKhzbVasU64tahEiaxc1JD0GbtZiBEH_1YMT3jS1NjC1ALLJdI4bZ_quQwV_6GcfsxZCd1i8onaTeYC_24Wi1Qc-LmfROtgb3UxtP6QaBud9DFYDwrpCFc-2KRjH7OhOI1c__8qBbDMnv4LPLOxXzSC-MMthc6v6k8leisOY6l6Qoj2h9W5VLRanx9mOy7T-T0DQQbiSuvC5-HOXRy6Uu7EqwOE8-USSB6K7Hrh7mEWyLWDaQ7zb60Tsk123VZGnis"" width=""1"" height=""1"" border=""0"" alt="""" />
","Hi Netanya,Thank you for your interest in the Junior Reporting & Analytics Specialist position at NXTThing RPO. We truly appreciate the effort you've invested in applying and sharing your skills and experiences with us.We regret to inform you that, after careful consideration, we have chosen to move forward with other candidates for the next phase of the process. While we recognize the value you bring, we have had to make difficult decisions in determining the best match for this particular role.We encourage you to continue exploring opportunities with us. We believe there may be other positions that align more closely with your talents and aspirations, please continue to check our website for more opportunitiesThank you once again for considering NXTThing RPO as a potential employer. We wish you the very best in your job search and hope to have the opportunity to connect with you again in the future. Best Regards,NXTThing RPO Recruitment Team",True,NXTThing RPO,NXTThing RPO,Junior Reporting & Analytics Specialist,2026-07-22 01:26:05+00:00,2026-07,Wednesday
