103,19f71f0748823447,17 Jul 2026 17:16:51 -0400,"""BAESystemsTalent@trm.brassring.com"" <Enterprise@trm.brassring.com>","BAE Systems - Application Status for Junior Power BI Systems Analyst, 123299BR","							Hello Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in BAE Systems.  We place a great emphasis on matching a candidate's background and interests with available opportunities and are continually impressed by the caliber of today's candidates.

While we regret to inform you that you were not selected for the position below, we will retain your resume in our database.

Junior Power BI Systems Analyst, 123299BR 

We encourage you to:Log into your candidate portal to check on that status of any other positions you applied to Browse our open positions as they become availableJoin our Talent Community to receive job recommendations and stay up to date on career-related newsWe appreciate your interest in BAE Systems and we wish you success in your professional endeavors.

Thank you,BAE Systems Talent Acquisition Team				    		 

