   <body><div><br/></div><div>Hello Netanya <br/><br/>Thank you for your interest in becoming a part of World Fuel.
      After careful review for the R22467 Data Analyst (Open) role, we regret to inform
      you that we will not be moving forward with your application. <br/><br/>This decision
      applies only to your application for the R22467 Data Analyst (Open) role and does
      not apply to any other applications you may have submitted with us. We encourage you
      to stay up to date with our job openings, and apply for other opportunities, please
      visit our careers page at https://www.world-kinect.com/careers<br><br>Thanks again for your interest in World Fuel, we wish you great success in your career
      search!<br><br>Kind Regards,<br>Talent Acquisition Team</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:pJHhrqwBvk""/></div><div>Please do not respond to this email. This email box is not monitored.</div>
