</html>","Hello Netanya Thank you for your interest in becoming a part of World Fuel. After careful review for the R22467 Data Analyst (Open) role, we regret to inform you that we will not be moving forward with your application. This decision applies only to your application for the R22467 Data Analyst (Open) role and does not apply to any other applications you may have submitted with us. We encourage you to stay up to date with our job openings, and apply for other opportunities, please visit our careers page at https://www.world-kinect.com/careersThanks again for your interest in World Fuel, we wish you great success in your career search!Kind Regards,Talent Acquisition TeamPlease do not respond to this email. This email box is not monitored. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,workday wfscorp,workday wfscorp,R22467 Data Analyst (Open),2026-07-17 20:42:48+00:00,2026-07,Friday
