ody></table></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:top;width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px;"" class=""mj-column-per-100-0 mj-outlook-group-fix"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""vertical-align:top;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px;"" width=""100%"" ><tr><td align=""left"" style=""font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;direction:ltr;"" ><div style=""font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.15;text-align:left;color:#494949;word-break:break-word;"">Dear Netanya, <br/><br/>Thank you for your interest in joining the DICK'S Sporting Goods, Inc. team.<br><br>Unfortunately, we have decided to move forward with other candidates for the Retail Media Reporting & Insights Analyst (REMOTE) position. <br/><br/>At DICK'S Sporting Goods, Inc. we believe that sports have the power to change lives, and we are always looking for talented individuals who share our passion. While this wasn’t the best match for you to join our team right now, new opportunities are posted often. <br><br>We recommend keeping an eye on our career site and applying to future roles that match your experience and skillset. You can also stay-in-the-know about what’s happening here and receive job-alerts that match your interests by joining our Talent Community on our career site. <br><br>We wish you every success in your career search. <br><br>Thank you, <br>Talent Acquisition Team <br/><br/>DICK'S Sporting Goods, Inc. <br/><br/>Replies to this message are undeliverable.</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></div><!--[if mso | IE]><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" width=""600"" align=""center"" style=""width:600px;""><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:auto;max-width:600px;"">
<table border=""0"" align=""center"" style=""font-size:0px;width:100%;"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0"">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style=""text-align:center;vertical-align:top;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0px;"">

<!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0""><tr><td style=""vertical-align:top;width:600px;""><![endif]-->

<div style=""vertical-align:top;display:inline-block;font-size:13px;text-align:left;width:100%;""class=""mj-column-per-100"" aria-labelledby=""mj-column-per-100""><table border=""0"" width=""100%"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" >
<tbody>
<tr>
<td align=""center"" style=""word-break:break-word;font-size:0px;padding-bottom:0px;""><div style=""cursor:auto;color:#98a0a6;font-family:Roboto;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;"">This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com </div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in joining the DICK'S Sporting Goods, Inc. team.Unfortunately, we have decided to move forward with other candidates for the Retail Media Reporting & Insights Analyst (REMOTE) position. At DICK'S Sporting Goods, Inc. we believe that sports have the power to change lives, and we are always looking for talented individuals who share our passion. While this wasn’t the best match for you to join our team right now, new opportunities are posted often. We recommend keeping an eye on our career site and applying to future roles that match your experience and skillset. You can also stay-in-the-know about what’s happening here and receive job-alerts that match your interests by joining our Talent Community on our career site. We wish you every success in your career search. Thank you, Talent Acquisition Team DICK'S Sporting Goods, Inc. Replies to this message are undeliverable. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,"""Dick's Sporting Goods""","""Dick's Sporting Goods""",Unknown,2026-07-17 04:12:47+00:00,2026-07,Friday
106,19f61f728df542bb,"Tue, 14 Jul 2026 18:50:15 +0000",Linktree Recruiting <no-reply@appreview.gem.com>,"Thank you for your interest in Linktree, Netanya","<div>Hi Netanya,</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you so much for taking the time to apply for our Data Analyst, Business opportunity with Linktree! We had the chance to review your application and while your experience is impressive, the team has decided to move forward with other candidates at this time.</div><div><br></div><div>We're always hiring and would love to reach back out should we identify a good fit for one of our future roles! In the meantime, our <a href=""https://linktr.ee/s/about/careers/"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"" target=""_blank""><u>careers page</u></a> is up to date with all roles we have available so we encourage you to keep an eye out for upcoming opportunities that could be a fit.</div><div><br></div><div>All the best in your job search!</div><div><br></div><div>The Linktree Talent Team</div><div><a href=""https://linktr.ee/linktreehiring"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"" target=""_blank""><u>Linktree Hiring</u></a></div><div><br></div>","Hi Netanya,Thank you so much for taking the time to apply for our Data Analyst, Business opportunity with Linktree! We had the chance to review your application and while your experience is impressive, the team has decided to move forward with other candidates at this time.We're always hiring and would love to reach back out should we identify a good fit for one of our future roles! In the meantime, our careers page is up to date with all roles we have available so we encourage you to keep an eye out for upcoming opportunities that could be a fit.All the best in your job search!The Linktree Talent TeamLinktree Hiring",True,Linktree Recruiting,Linktree Recruiting,Unknown,2026-07-14 18:50:15+00:00,2026-07,Tuesday
107,19f5d56f5411300f,"Mon, 13 Jul 2026 21:16:47 +0000",Gravie Hiring Team <no-reply@ashbyhq.com>,Your application for Configuration Analyst at Gravie,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Configuration Analyst position at Gravie. We genuinely appreciate your interest in our company. After carefully reviewing your application, we've decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely matches our current needs. This was a competitive process, and this decision is not a reflection of your qualifications.

We'll keep your information on file and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that may be a great fit. Thank you again for your interest in Gravie, and we wish you the very best in your search.

Gravie Recruiting Team
<html><head><meta http-equiv=""Content-Type"" content=""text/html; charset=utf-8""></head><body><div style=""min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"">Hi <span>Netanya</span>,</div><div style=""min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"">&nbsp;</div><div style=""min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"">Thank you for taking the time to apply for the <span>Configuration Analyst</span> position at Gravie. We genuinely appreciate your interest in our company. After carefully reviewing your application, we've decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely matches our current needs. This was a competitive process, and this decision is not a reflection of your qualifications.</div><div style=""min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"">&nbsp;</div><div style=""min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"">We'll keep your information on file and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that may be a great fit. Thank you again for your interest in Gravie, and we wish you the very best in your search.</div><div style=""min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"">&nbsp;</div><div style=""min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"">Gravie Recruiting Team</div></body></html>","Hi Netanya, Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Configuration Analyst position at Gravie. We genuinely appreciate your interest in our company. After carefully reviewing your application, we've decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely matches our current needs. This was a competitive process, and this decision is not a reflection of your qualifications. We'll keep your information on file and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that may be a great fit. Thank you again for your interest in Gravie, and we wish you the very best in your search. Gravie Recruiting Team Hi Netanya, Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Configuration Analyst position at Gravie. We genuinely appreciate your interest in our company. After carefully reviewing your application, we've decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely matches our current needs. This was a competitive process, and this decision is not a reflection of your qualifications. We'll keep your information on file and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that may be a great fit. Thank you again for your interest in Gravie, and we wish you the very best in your search. Gravie Recruiting Team",True,Gravie Hiring Team,Gravie Hiring Team,Configuration Analyst at Gravie,2026-07-13 21:16:47+00:00,2026-07,Monday
108,19f5a62374324045,"Mon, 13 Jul 2026 07:30:13 +0000",no-reply.recruitment@team.wrike.com,Important information about your application to Wrike,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for your application for the Sales Strategy & Operations Analyst at Wrike.

After careful consideration, the decision has been made to move forward with other candidates at this time.

Despite this, finding the right role for our applicants remains important to us. Therefore, we encourage you to create a job alert on LinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/wrike/jobs/ ). All our jobs are advertised on LinkedIn. You can also follow the Wrike Blog ( https://wrike.medium.com/ ) and stay up to date on new articles and events!

Kind Regards,

Wrike Recruitment team

** Please do not reply to this email. This email is sent from an unattended mailbox.
