/img></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:top;width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px 25px 25px 25px;"" class=""mj-column-per-100-0 mj-outlook-group-fix"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""vertical-align:top;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px 25px 25px 25px;"" width=""100%"" ><tr><td align=""left"" style=""font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;direction:ltr;"" ><div style=""font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.15;text-align:left;color:#000000;word-break:break-word;"">Dear Netanya, <br/><br/>Thank you for your interest in R0942276 Data Engineer (Evergreen) (Open) . After careful review, we will not be moving forward with your application for this role.<br><br>We also encourage you to explore other opportunities at CVS Health® that match your skills and interests. Visit <A HREF=https://jobs.cvshealth.com/us/en><div style=""word-break:break-all"">https://jobs.cvshealth.com/us/en</div></a> or text “CVS” to 29000 to connect with our virtual recruiting assistant.<br><br>To support your career journey, we’re offering free access to a virtual career development platform with tools for networking, resume building and interview prep. Enroll here: <A HREF=https://cvshealthcareers.yournextstep.com/users/sign_up?direct=XM73OrS-nKtg6Gk1><div style=""word-break:break-all"">https://cvshealthcareers.yournextstep.com/users/sign_up?direct=XM73OrS-nKtg6Gk1</div></a>.<br><br>Thank you again for considering CVS Health. We wish you success in your career.<br><br>Sincerely,<br>CVS Health Talent Acquisition</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:middle;width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:middle;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:0;"" class=""mj-column-per-100-0 mj-outlook-group-fix"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:0;"" width=""100%"" ><tr><td align=""center"" style=""font-size:0px;word-b