<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in R0942276 Data Engineer (Evergreen) (Open) . After careful review, we will not be moving forward with your application for this role.We also encourage you to explore other opportunities at CVS Health® that match your skills and interests. Visit https://jobs.cvshealth.com/us/en or text “CVS” to 29000 to connect with our virtual recruiting assistant.To support your career journey, we’re offering free access to a virtual career development platform with tools for networking, resume building and interview prep. Enroll here: https://cvshealthcareers.yournextstep.com/users/sign_up?direct=XM73OrS-nKtg6Gk1.Thank you again for considering CVS Health. We wish you success in your career.Sincerely,CVS Health Talent AcquisitionLife at CVS HealthCandidate HomeJoin #TeamCVS on social! *This is an automated e-mail; please do not reply to this message. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com CVS Health • One CVS Drive, Woonsocket, Rhode Island 02895",True,Colleague Zone,Colleague Zone,Unknown,2026-07-11 04:49:47+00:00,2026-07,Saturday
111,19f4bf78f87263a6,10 Jul 2026 12:19:02 +0000,noreplies@milliman.com,Thank you for applying to Milliman,"<p><span>Re: Milliman Product Support Analyst Application</span></p>
<p><span><span>Netanya,</span></span></p>
<p><span><span>Thank you for your interest in the Product Support Analyst position with Milliman. </span></span></p>
<p><span>After careful consideration, the local hiring team has decided to pursue other candidates for this position.</span></p>
<p><span><span>You are encouraged to visit the Milliman Careers page and apply for other interesting opportunities that match your qualifications.&nbsp; Opportunities at Milliman, including the position criteria and hiring decisions, are managed by the leaders across the firm looking to add to their teams.</span></span></p>
<p><span>We sincerely wish you the best with your job search and appreciate your interest in Milliman.</span></p>
<p><span>Re: Milliman Product Support Analyst Application</span></p>
