      15px;"" valign=""top""><!-- INTENTIONAL OPEN DIV --><div style=""font-family: Arial, Helvetica,
      sans-serif;""></div><div>Hi Faith, <br/><br/>Thank you for your application and interest in working at CrowdStrike.
      Although we have decided to move forward with other candidates for R27809 - Machine
