<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Netanya, Thank you for your interest in our organization and investing the time to submit your resume for the Applications Support Analyst - Health Plan position. We have reviewed your skills and accomplishments along with your experience and have decided to pursue other candidates at this time. Although you were not selected, we encourage you to visit our career site at Sanford Careers frequently to review open positions or join our Talent Community to connect with a member from our hiring team for potential career opportunities that align with your talents and skillsets.Again, we appreciate your interest in the organization. We hope that you will keep us in mind and apply again! Best wishes with your job search and personal endeavors. Sincerely, Sanford Human Resources This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com This message was sent from an unmonitored address. Please do not respond to this message. For assistance, please contact the Sanford Employee Service Center at (877) 949-5678. Sanford • https://www.sanfordhealth.org",True,Sanford Health,Sanford Health,Unknown,2026-07-10 05:57:40+00:00,2026-07,Friday
