<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in a position at Grand Valley State University. We regret to inform you that we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time. As noted in our job posting, this position does not support visa sponsorship now or in the future. We appreciate the time you invested in applying and wish you the best in your job search. Please feel free to apply for other positions at the university that may align with your qualifications and visa status in the future.Warm Regards,Human ResourcesGrand Valley State UniversityWorking at GVSUGVSU CareersGVSU Human Resources · 1090 James H. Zumberge Hall · Allendale, MI 49401 · (616) 331-2215 This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com Grand Valley State University • 1 Campus Drive, Allendale, MI 49401-9403",True,Grand Valley State University,Grand Valley State University,Unknown,2026-07-09 14:24:15+00:00,2026-07,Thursday
