118,19f3e5c5d1b331bd,"Tue, 7 Jul 2026 20:54:27 +0000",ProAmpac <no-reply@notifications.ukg.net>,Update on Your Application for Analyst - Sourcing Services at ProAmpac,"Hello Netanya,
We wanted to update you on the status of your application for the Analyst - Sourcing Services role at ProAmpac.
We appreciate the time you took to apply for the position. After careful consideration, we have decided to pursue other candidates whose qualifications more closely match our needs.
We understand this might not be the outcome you were hoping for. Know that we genuinely appreciate the time you invested in applying with us and your interest in joining our team. Please feel free to explore our website to learn more about our company and consider future opportunities that may align with your skills and goals. We wish you the best of luck in your job search.
 
Best regards,
The ProAmpac Talent Acquisition Team
