      but we have decided to pursue other candidates whom we believe more closely match
      the requirements of the position and needs of our firm. Therefore, we are not able
      to move forward with you as a candidate at this time.<br><br>Best wishes for a successful employment search.<br><br>Best, <br/><br/>BRG Talent Management</div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message.</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:shRIcduFSz""/></div>
