121,19f3d24212eda0a5,"Tue, 07 Jul 2026 15:13:25 +0000",no-reply@samsara.com,Thank you for your interest in Samsara,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in Samsara.

We wanted to update you that the Digital Innovation Co-Op – Supply Chain role has been filled, so we will not be moving forward with the interview process at this time.

We are continuously growing and evolving and invite you to visit our careers page ( https://samsara.com/company/careers/roles/ )and apply for any roles that may be of interest to you.

We appreciate your interest in Samsara and wish you success in your job search.

Best regards,
The Samsara Recruiting Team
samsara.com ( https://www.samsara.com/about )
<p>Hi Netanya,<br><br>Thank you for your interest in Samsara.<br><br>We wanted to update you that the&nbsp;Digital Innovation Co-Op – Supply Chain role has been filled, so we will not be moving forward with the interview process at this time.<br><br>We are continuously growing and evolving and invite you to visit our&nbsp;<a href=""https://samsara.com/company/careers/roles/"">careers page </a>and apply for any roles that may be of interest to you.<br><br>We appreciate your interest in Samsara and wish you success in your job search.<br><br><span style=""font-weight: 400;"">Best regards,<br>The Samsara Recruiting Team<br><a href=""https://www.samsara.com/about"">samsara.com</a></span></p><img width=""1"" height=""1"" alt="""" src=""http://email.gh-mail.samsara.com/o/eJwczEFuwyAQheHTlF0jGMwAC1ZVT9ADVGNmiFGxXYFTKbevyPJJ3_s5LWvhEpUk44NdrAft1Jbcig4w2sVgycEQF4eEtFLmEm3QqibQgNprb5yx4G4xA1MAjZzBo5e3Rd-3951quw3aB3W65XNXZ79_V06L9lb9Sh_n8ZoenQlgourpkIuOJ_1Ia_LEmXlF5nnUdk5u1JW-8ib8aMIfdHBluuRzOvUY0qdRfwn-AwAA___TUUTI"">","Hi Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Samsara. We wanted to update you that the Digital Innovation Co-Op – Supply Chain role has been filled, so we will not be moving forward with the interview process at this time. We are continuously growing and evolving and invite you to visit our careers page ( https://samsara.com/company/careers/roles/ )and apply for any roles that may be of interest to you. We appreciate your interest in Samsara and wish you success in your job search. Best regards, The Samsara Recruiting Team samsara.com ( https://www.samsara.com/about ) Hi Netanya,Thank you for your interest in Samsara.We wanted to update you that the Digital Innovation Co-Op – Supply Chain role has been filled, so we will not be moving forward with the interview process at this time.We are continuously growing and evolving and invite you to visit our careers page and apply for any roles that may be of interest to you.We appreciate your interest in Samsara and wish you success in your job search.Best regards,The Samsara Recruiting Teamsamsara.com",True,Samsara,Samsara,Unknown,2026-07-07 15:13:25+00:00,2026-07,Tuesday
