 href=""https://jobs.iqvia.com/""> exploring career possibilities</a> that align with your goals. If nothing is available right now, we value the opportunity to stay connected and invite you to join our <a href=""https://jobs.iqvia.com/en/talent-network/"">Global Talent Network</a>.<br><br>Please note: This notification relates specifically to your application for the position R1519496 Business Systems Analyst 1 . If you have applied to other roles, those applications may still be under review. We encourage you to regularly check your <a href=""https://iqvia.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/IQVIA/"">Candidate Home Account</a> for updates on their status.<br><br>Thank you again for your time and interest in the IQVIA family of companies. We wish you the very best in your job search and hope to connect with you in the future.<br><br>Warm regards,<br><br>Global Talent Acquisition</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:middle;width:200px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:middle;width:33%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px;"" class=""mj-column