&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;</div> <!--[if mso]> <table align='center' class='backgroundmso'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <table align=""center"" style=""width: 100%;background-color: #FAFCFD""> <!--<![endif]--> <tbody>  <tr> <td align=""center""> <div style=""width: 680px;border-radius: 20px;border: 1px solid rgba(75, 88, 99, 0.5);box-shadow: 0px 4px 12px 0px rgba(75, 88, 99, 0.5);border-collapse: collapse;background-color: #ffffff;color: #222222;font-size: 14px;text-align: left""> <table cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" align=""center"" style=""table-layout: fixed;border-radius: 20px;width: 680px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: #ffffff;color: #222222;font-size: 14px;text-align: left""> <tbody> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td></td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td>  <td style=""color: #4B5863; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;""> Kinective [308023] </td>  <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr height=""44px""> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td></td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td> <p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Hi Netanya,</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Thank you for your interest in Kinective!</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">After careful consideration and reviewing all applications thoroughly, we have chosen to move forward with other candidates whose qualifications more closely align with our current needs. We received an overwhelming response for the Technical Business Analyst position at Kinective, which made the decision even more difficult.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">&nbsp;</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">We were genuinely impressed with your skills and experience and we encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that match your background and interests.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Thank you again for taking the time to apply and for considering Kinective as your next team. We wish you all the best in your job search and invite you to keep an eye out for future roles!&nbsp;</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Best wishes,<br>The Kinective Talent Team</p><table cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody>  </tbody> </table> &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br> </td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <!--[if mso]> <div style='height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'></div> <table style='width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <div style=""height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""></div> <table style=""width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <tbody> <tr> <td> <table align=""center"" style=""width:440px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;""> <tbody> <!--[if mso]> <tr style='background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <tr style=""background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <td> <table style=""table-layout:fixed;"" align=""center"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody> <tr height=""39px""> <td>&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td style=""text-align:center""> <span style=""c