125,19f389dd21885fff,"Mon, 6 Jul 2026 18:08:14 +0000",Ramp Talent Team <no-reply@ashbyhq.com>,Update on your application to Ramp,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in joining Ramp. We greatly appreciate you considering us in your job search. We've reviewed your application and, unfortunately, will not be moving forward with your candidacy for the Employee Lifecycle Analyst opening. Although your experience is impressive, we have received many qualified applicants for the role. 

We'll be sure to keep your information on file as we continue to grow.

Wishing you all the best,


Ramp
