130,19f328684efc819b,"Sun, 05 Jul 2026 13:45:04 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,"Re: Your Application for Data Analyst (Consumer Product Safety), Limited Duration at Consumer Reports","Dear Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in the Data Analyst (Consumer Product Safety), Limited Duration position at Consumer Reports and for sharing your background and experience with us.

We have reviewed your application carefully. While we were impressed with your qualifications, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match the specific needs of the role at this time.

We appreciate the effort you put into your application and encourage you to apply for future positions that align with your background and skills.

Thank you again for considering a career with Consumer Reports.

Thank you,
CR Talent Acquisition Team

( https://www.cr.org )

We encourage you to learn more about us on LinkedIn: Life at CR ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/consumer-reports/life/ ) and read about our latest news ( https://www.consumerreports.org/media-room/ ).
