133,19f295f3986fa301,"Fri, 03 Jul 2026 19:05:33 +0000 (UTC)",TheGuarantors <no-reply@ats.rippling.com>,Thank you for applying to TheGuarantors,"Hi Netanya ,

Thank you for applying to TheGuarantors! We have received your application for the Claims Analyst position. We will reach out to candidates whose qualifications closely match our needs and will do our best to notify you in a timely manner if you will not be moving forward.

Our team will be diligently reviewing applications over the next 1-2 weeks, and during this time, we will reach out to candidates whose qualifications closely match our needs. If you do not receive a response within this timeframe, it's likely that we have chosen to move forward with other candidates.

Thank you once again for considering TheGuarantors as your potential employer.

Kind regards,

TheGuarantors

Please do not reply to this email. It is sent from an unmonitored inbox and replies will not be read.
