135,19f2463b8a4e26af,"Thu, 2 Jul 2026 15:52:21 -0400 (EDT)","""PlanSource @ icims"" <plansource+autoreply@talent.icims.com>",Thank you for your application,"Dear Netanya,
 
Thank you very much for your interest in PlanSource. We appreciate the time you took to apply for the Premium Billing Treasury Analyst position and look forward to reviewing your application.
 
Pursuing a career change can be exciting – and sometimes stressful. This is particularly true when you see a position that matches your profile, you apply, and wait, and then wait some more. Many of us have been there too, so we want to share what will happen next now that you clicked the “submit” button.
 
Very soon, your resume will be reviewed by a real-life human – one of our Talent Acquisition Specialists (As a technology company, there are many things we like to automate, but this is not one of them). If selected for an interview, we will reach out to you to schedule a call so we can know more about you and your background, tell you about the interview process, share all the great stuff we are doing at PlanSource and answer any questions you may have.
 
If you are not selected for this position as we move forward, this does not mean you are not great in what you do, it simply means that our needs may not be aligned at this time or for this position. There are also many times we will reach back to you for a similar position that opens up or for another position that may better fit your profile.

Thanks again and we wish you great success as you pursue your career search.


This is an automated email response. Please do not reply.
 
If you no longer wish to receive e-mail from PlanSource, click here: https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/rQePULGWdQipVucmyPs6VQ~~/AAIB5hA~/8K-tP03oGdnsChSC-Cezr1LlhG9hlw7mLrEs_UStzZY9x3mhfnWPrvloMo0Zd6UHJ3UpfAD_qkXG_w9lwxnX9IAnlM75PnTpcyi9zG26lYiT1eAI-0B6knTLoQyVZErPkiRb9D3PsVyKMr68jIJ1dd2iwcliLv3HntCb0J9MYMsV23Qn-pBaQVBRGuSgI83eWR4Mtg8z5Msp8yB-YiUAvA~~.


