","Dear Netanya,Thank you for your interest in employment with Conduent.After reviewing your resume and considering your qualifications, we have decided to pursue other candidates who better match the qualifications for this position. We encourage you to visit our website and apply for new positions as they become available. We appreciate your interest in our company and wish you success in your career search.Regards,ConduentBeware of work-from-home job scams from criminals posing as Conduent recruiters.Here are signs of impersonation to look out for:Email that does not come from an Conduent.com email address.Conduent recruiters do not use personal email accounts such as Gmail or yahoo for official business. Also be aware of misspellings of Conduent in the email addressRequests for interviews over Skype, IM, Facebook Chat, or other social media messaging apps. Conduent recruiters will always communicate with official Conduent.com email, talk to you directly over the phone or send you an SMS to remind you of the next steps in the recruitment processConduent will never ask you to deposit checks, provide bank account information, or purchase equipment as part of the interview processIf you have any concerns about communications from recruiters claiming to be from Conduent, please don’t hesitate to verify by contacting Conduent HR at: recruitmentcontactcenter@conduent.comConnect With us onCopyrights 2026, ConduentTo ensure delivery to your inbox, please add TalentAcquisition@jobalerts.conduent.com to your address bookYou can unsubscribe here and stop receiving these job alert emails Dear Netanya,Thank you for your interest in employment with Conduent.After reviewing your resume and considering your qualifications, we have decided to pursue other candidates who better match the qualifications for this position. We encourage you to visit our website and apply for new positions as they become available. We appreciate your interest in our company and wish you success in your career search.Regards,ConduentBeware of work-from-home job scams from criminals posing as Conduent recruiters.Here are signs of impersonation to look out for:Email that does not come from an Conduent.com email address.Conduent recruiters do not use personal email accounts such as Gmail or yahoo for official business. Also be aware of misspellings of Conduent in the email addressRequests for interviews over Skype, IM, Facebook Chat, or other social media messaging apps. Conduent recruiters will always communicate with official Conduent.com email, talk to you directly over the phone or send you an SMS to remind you of the next steps in the recruitment processConduent will never ask you to deposit checks, provide bank account information, or purchase equipment as part of the interview processIf you have any concerns about communications from recruiters claiming to be from Conduent, please don’t hesitate to verify by contacting Conduent HR at: recruitmentcontactcenter@conduent.comConnect With us onCopyrights 2026, ConduentTo ensure delivery to your inbox, please add TalentAcquisition@jobalerts.conduent.com to your address bookYou can unsubscribe here and stop receiving these job alert emails",True,Conduent,Conduent,Unknown,2026-07-01 20:13:59+00:00,2026-07,Wednesday
140,19f1edd02b278e1f,"Wed, 01 Jul 2026 18:07:04 +0000",no-reply@consumer.org,Application Received: Thank You for Applying to Consumer Reports,"Dear Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in Consumer Reports (CR), an independent, nonprofit member organization that works side-by-side with consumers for truth, transparency, and fairness in the marketplace.

We appreciate you taking the time to apply for the role of Data Analyst (Consumer Product Safety), Limited Duration at CR. If your qualifications meet the position criteria, a member of our Talent Acquisition team will reach out to you regarding next steps.

Thank you,
CR Talent Acquisition Team

( https://www.cr.org )

We encourage you to learn more about us on LinkedIn: Life at CR ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/consumer-reports/life/ ) and read about our latest news ( https://www.consumerreports.org/media-room/ ).

** Please Note: We receive many applications and are unable to provide individual feedback if you are not selected to move forward and/or when the job has been filled. This email is sent from an unattended mailbox.
Do not reply to this email. Replies will not be read. **
<p><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">Dear Netanya,</span></p>
<p><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">Thank you for your interest in Consumer Reports (CR), an independent, nonprofit member organization that works side-by-side with consumers for truth, transparency, and fairness in the marketplace.</span></p>
<p><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">We appreciate you taking the time to apply for the role of Data Analyst (Consumer Product Safety), Limited Duration at CR. If your qualifications meet the position criteria, a member of our Talent Acquisition team will reach out to you regarding next steps.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">Thank you,<br></span><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">CR Talent Acquisition Team</span></p>
<p><a href=""https://www.cr.org"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener""><img src=""https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1IxiaFJ7BYnjigFt_qW5VhwQ0g_BJ414nvqXllycg_Uuh8vVuQQe8NH3DWPrd66CBt34fTRVGPIh_Ak-1KU=s1600"" width=""141"" height=""36""></a></p>
<p><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">We encourage you to learn more about us on <a title=""Life at CR"" href=""https://www.linkedin.com/company/consumer-reports/life/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">LinkedIn: Life at CR</a> and read about our <a title=""CR in the news"" href=""https://www.consumerreports.org/media-room/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">latest news</a>.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr>
<p style=""text-align: center;""><em><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">** Please Note: We receive many applications and are unable to provide individual feedback if you are not selected to move forward and/or when the job has been filled. This email is sent from an unattended mailbox.&nbsp;<br></span></em><em><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">Do not reply to this email. </span></em><em><span style=""font-size: 14px;"">Replies will not be read. **</span></em></p><img width=""1"" height=""1"" alt="""" src=""http://email.gh-mail.consumer.org/o/eJwszEtuxCAQhOHThF2spnk0LFhEuUEuEGHo8aBgsLAdybePHM32L9WXA1mrkhYcJDn06BFJPMPD6hmTJXImkWLvOMH8UGi811myEiUgoAUCKR0Q6Ikga4dkZ6dgJuY3DcvzfY2lTqm3_Vx5TH0soo_lu-SgAVCiASCx8dh7uyNJAANG3nWExkdsV_zhWvmyt_fSVrGX2v8P4gifseWS48Ef59G_eKuXOHce9yx-A_4FAAD__76ZQ_U"">","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Consumer Reports (CR), an independent, nonprofit member organization that works side-by-side with consumers for truth, transparency, and fairness in the marketplace. We appreciate you taking the time to apply for the role of Data Analyst (Consumer Product Safety), Limited Duration at CR. If your qualifications meet the position criteria, a member of our Talent Acquisition team will reach out to you regarding next steps. Thank you, CR Talent Acquisition Team ( https://www.cr.org ) We encourage you to learn more about us on LinkedIn: Life at CR ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/consumer-reports/life/ ) and read about our latest news ( https://www.consumerreports.org/media-room/ ). ** Please Note: We receive many applications and are unable to provide individual feedback if you are not selected to move forward and/or when the job has been filled. This email is sent from an unattended mailbox. Do not reply to this email. Replies will not be read. ** Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Consumer Reports (CR), an independent, nonprofit member organization that works side-by-side with consumers for truth, transparency, and fairness in the marketplace. We appreciate you taking the time to apply for the role of Data Analyst (Consumer Product Safety), Limited Duration at CR. If your qualifications meet the position criteria, a member of our Talent Acquisition team will reach out to you regarding next steps. Thank you,CR Talent Acquisition Team We encourage you to learn more about us on LinkedIn: Life at CR and read about our latest news. ** Please Note: We receive many applications and are unable to provide individual feedback if you are not selected to move forward and/or when the job has been filled. This email is sent from an unattended mailbox. Do not reply to this email. Replies will not be read. **",True,Consumer Reports,Consumer Reports,"role of Data Analyst (Consumer Product Safety), Limited Duration at CR. If your qualifications meet the",2026-07-01 18:07:04+00:00,2026-07,Wednesday
141,19f1e754da9f176b,"Wed, 01 Jul 2026 16:13:42 +0000","""LUCY LEIGHTON [Champions Oncology Inc.]"" <LUCY.LEIGHTON@msg.paycomonline.com>",Position Closed- Associate Data Analyst,"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN"" ""http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd"">
<html><body><p>Dear Netanya,</p>

<p>Thank you for your interest in Champions Oncology and for taking the time to apply for the Associate Data Analyst&nbsp;position.</p>

<p>After careful consideration, we have made the decision to close this position due to changing business needs and will not be moving forward with the recruitment process at this time.</p>

<p>We appreciate your interest in joining our team and will retain your application for consideration should a suitable opportunity become available in the future.</p>

<p>Thank you again for your interest in Champions Oncology. We wish you every success in your career.</p>

<p>Sincerely,</p>

<p><strong>Champions Oncology Human Resources Department</strong></p>
</body></html>

