146,19f1a74c1ed1a5d5,"Tue, 30 Jun 2026 17:34:45 -0400",notify@dayforce.com,Thank you for your interest in career opportunities with Vitu,"<img class='OfferCompanyLogo' src='cid:VGUM3630OTU4LT9LKT5C3C012azg1r72app037' style='margin-left:10px;margin-right:auto;width:162px;height:91px' height='91' width='162' /><br><p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;""><span style=""font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"">Dear Netanya,</span></p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;""><span style=""font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"">Thank you for your interest in career opportunities with Vitu.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;""><span style=""font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"">We appreciate the time you have put into your application and choosing Vitu as an employer of choice. We are delighted by the number of highly qualified applicants such as you, who consider us as a potential employer of choice.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;""><span style=""font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"">We have completed the initial interview screening process for Technical Analyst I (Remote) and unfortunately, we will not be moving forward with your application at this time. Should other positions be of interest to you in the future, we welcome you to apply to <a rel=""noopener"" href=""https://vitu.com/company/careers.html"" target=""_blank"">https://vitu.com/company/careers.html</a>. Thank you again for your continued interest with Vitu and we wish you the best of luck in your career search.</span></p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;""><span style=""font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"">Regards,</span></p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;""><span style=""font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"">Vitu Hiring Team</span></p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=""margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;""><span style=""font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"">**Please note: Do not reply to this email.&nbsp; This email is sent from an unattended mailbox.&nbsp; Replies will not be read.</span></p> <br/> </div>","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in career opportunities with Vitu. We appreciate the time you have put into your application and choosing Vitu as an employer of choice. We are delighted by the number of highly qualified applicants such as you, who consider us as a potential employer of choice. We have completed the initial interview screening process for Technical Analyst I (Remote) and unfortunately, we will not be moving forward with your application at this time. Should other positions be of interest to you in the future, we welcome you to apply to https://vitu.com/company/careers.html. Thank you again for your continued interest with Vitu and we wish you the best of luck in your career search. Regards, Vitu Hiring Team **Please note: Do not reply to this email. This email is sent from an unattended mailbox. Replies will not be read.",True,career opportunities with Vitu,career opportunities with Vitu,Unknown,2026-06-30 21:34:45+00:00,2026-06,Tuesday
147,19f1a734e69d32cd,"Tue, 30 Jun 2026 21:33:10 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Thank you for applying to Habitat Health,"Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in Habitat Health. We wanted to let you know we received your application for the Quality Improvement Analyst  position, and we are delighted that you would consider joining our team.

Our team will review your application and will be in touch if your qualifications match our needs for the role. If you are not selected for this position, keep an eye on our jobs page as we're growing and adding openings.

Thank you!

Warm Regards,
Habitat Health

