151,19f155c77a3776a8,"Mon, 29 Jun 2026 21:50:08 +0000",Vultr Hiring Team <no-reply@ashbyhq.com>,Thank you for your interest in Vultr,"Netanya,

We are working through a large volume of applicants as of late, and appreciate your patience with a slower than normal response.

We have reviewed your application, resume and qualifications for the Procurement Analyst position at Vultr, and have  made the tough decision to pursue other candidates that more closely align to the qualifications for the role. 

Thank you for your interest in Vultr. We hope that you continue to stay engaged with Vultr and apply for future positions as they come available. 

All the best to you in your continued search.

Sincerely, 
Vultr Talent Acquisition Team
