hey come available. All the best to you in your continued search. Sincerely, Vultr Talent Acquisition Team Netanya, We are working through a large volume of applicants as of late, and appreciate your patience with a slower than normal response. We have reviewed your application, resume and qualifications for the Procurement Analyst position at Vultr, and have made the tough decision to pursue other candidates that more closely align to the qualifications for the role. Thank you for your interest in Vultr. We hope that you continue to stay engaged with Vultr and apply for future positions as they come available. All the best to you in your continued search. Sincerely, Vultr Talent Acquisition Team",True,Vultr Hiring Team,Vultr Hiring Team,Unknown,2026-06-29 21:50:08+00:00,2026-06,Monday
152,19f13a8931339229,"Mon, 29 Jun 2026 09:54:01 -0400 (EDT)",Shrestha Jain <drfirst+email+4dx7-f4b45a8bde@talent.icims.com>,Thank you for your interest in DrFirst!,"Dear Netanya,
 
Thank you for your interest in employment with DrFirst. 
 
We have reviewed your resume and have carefully considered your qualifications. While your skills are certainly impressive, we have decided to pursue other candidates for this position.
 
We will maintain your records and should a position open that matches your qualifications, we will contact you. We also encourage you to visit our website as new positions become available Careers at DrFirst - Job Listings at DrFirst (icims.com).
 
I'd love to stay in touch with you, please connect with me on Linkedin at: https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/RClQch28WJMLv03OllHYwA~~/AAIB5hA~/6I_jJV8akl7W6bhRSOXFSivtrws3u-lHcUE-obsnECsw7Mj0kx_3j3fHT5ahLuSOupSRfP8J3KzIbcKOY7NzTT8A7sq8oTpwawmPY4HvSXdEUX9t0Ym7n7Z86WxJw-CJIKi9f9S4SCmytZYPfQsPaw~~
 
We wish you success in your career search.
 
Kind regards,
 
Gregory Fleischman
Principal Recruiter
gfleischman@drfirst.com


