153,19f1345f565867a1,"Mon, 29 Jun 2026 12:06:18 +0000 (UTC)",Ava Cado from Chipotle <ava.cado@chipotle.com>,Chipotle Application Update,"|   
---  
|  |  |  Hi Netanya,  
  
Thank you for your interest in Chipotle. We appreciate the time and effort you invested in the application process.  
  
After consideration, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates whose qualifications more closely align with the requirements of the position which may include scheduling availability.  
  
We encourage you to apply to future openings and wish you success in your job search.  
  
Thank you again for your interest in Chipotle.  
---  
|  If you no longer want to receive these alerts, you can [manage preferences](https://olivia.paradox.ai/communication-preferences?token=UFJEMjUzozSrAo7q2qrw3D6uoYxTkIwPmylkp05YubeFT5PfMbeJh68XpIhlR59Jqcg) or [unsubscribe](https://olivia.paradox.ai/candidate-experience/unsubscribe?token=w4TDmcKowrnCkMOxwrrDqMOhw5PDo8Knw5V_wo7DnMK2woPDnMKgwqXCicKtw4HClMKowopcw6FsY8KJwqHCnsKOwqnCkHPClHbCvcKEwqlrwoZkW8KqwpvCpsKGwrXCgWDCglLCjA==).  2016-2026 Ava Cado by [**Paradox**](https://www.paradox.ai/powered-by-paradox)   
6330 E Thomas Rd, Scottsdale, Arizona 85251, United States   
