</html>","Dear Netanya ,We have received your application for the position of R-49500 Associate Data Engineer 1 . After careful consideration, we have decided to pursue other candidates at this time.We will retain your candidate file in our database and we also invite you to visit the Career Section on our website regularly.We thank you for your interest in our Company and we wish you all the best in your career.Best regards,Talent AcquisitionBlueCross BlueShield of TennesseeReplies to this message are undeliverable and will not reach the Talent Acquisition Department. Please do not reply. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-06-26 20:07:55+00:00,2026-06,Friday
158,19f058603013d5fd,"Fri, 26 Jun 2026 20:01:35 +0000 (UTC)",Thrive Notification <notification@thrivehrgateway.com>,Thank you for your interest in FLUOR Corporation,"<p>​<br><img src=https://performancemanager4.successfactors.com/companyLogoServlet/?companyId=fluor&amp;mod=1765826420318 alt='Company Logo' style='background-color:#fff;' /></p>
<p>Dear Netanya,</p>
<p>Thank you for your expressed interest in employment opportunities with Fluor. We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into applying for 4301 Project Business Analyst I.</p>
<p>We regret to inform you that you were not selected for the position at this time. Your profile will be kept in our database and should our needs change, we will contact you.</p>
<p>Fluor would very much like to stay connected and encourage you to check our website at http://www.fluor.com/careers for suitable opportunities on a regular basis as it is updated frequently.</p>
<p>We wish you the best in your career search.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Best Regards,</p>
<p>Fluor's Talent Acquisition Team</p>
<p>​</p>
","​ Dear Netanya, Thank you for your expressed interest in employment opportunities with Fluor. We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into applying for 4301 Project Business Analyst I. We regret to inform you that you were not selected for the position at this time. Your profile will be kept in our database and should our needs change, we will contact you. Fluor would very much like to stay connected and encourage you to check our website at http://www.fluor.com/careers for suitable opportunities on a regular basis as it is updated frequently. We wish you the best in your career search. Best Regards, Fluor's Talent Acquisition Team ​",True,Thrive Notification,Thrive,Unknown,2026-06-26 20:01:35+00:00,2026-06,Friday
159,19f050284efc8c5e,"Fri, 26 Jun 2026 10:37:57 -0700 (PDT)",Cigna Notifications <CignaNotifications@workday.cigna.com>,Update: Job Application- Technical Support Analyst (26006574),"<!doctype html><html xmlns:v=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml"" xmlns:o=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"">
   <head>
