   <body><div><img src=""cid:PsgrNBHTcY""/></div><div><br/></div><div>Hello Netanya, <br/><br/>Thank you for the time and effort you put into applying for
      the <b> Technical Support Analyst - 26006574 </b> position and considering The Cigna
      Group in your career journey. <br/><br/>Applications are carefully reviewed and evaluated
      by our team. After thoughtful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other
      candidates whose experience more closely aligns with the needs of this position. <br/><br/>Even
      though we've chosen to move forward with other candidates, we encourage you to explore
      future opportunities with us. You can: <br/><br/>• Sign up for our <a href=""https://jobs.thecignagroup.com/us/en/jointalentcommunity"">Talent
      Community</a> to receive job recommendations that align with your interests and our
      hiring needs.<br>• Visit our <a href=""https://jobs.thecignagroup.com/us/en/"">career site</a> and apply
      for other open jobs. <br/><br/>If you’ve applied for other positions with us, we will
      update you on those separately. <br/><br/>Thank you again for considering The Cigna
      Group for the next chapter in your career! <br/><br/>Wishing you the best, <br/><br/>The
      Cigna Group Recruitment Team</div>
