</html>","Hello Netanya, Thank you for the time and effort you put into applying for the Technical Support Analyst - 26006574 position and considering The Cigna Group in your career journey. Applications are carefully reviewed and evaluated by our team. After thoughtful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with the needs of this position. Even though we've chosen to move forward with other candidates, we encourage you to explore future opportunities with us. You can: • Sign up for our Talent Community to receive job recommendations that align with your interests and our hiring needs.• Visit our career site and apply for other open jobs. If you’ve applied for other positions with us, we will update you on those separately. Thank you again for considering The Cigna Group for the next chapter in your career! Wishing you the best, The Cigna Group Recruitment Team This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Cigna Notifications,Cignas,Unknown,2026-06-26 17:37:57+00:00,2026-06,Friday
160,19f0336228f02c26,26 Jun 2026 09:15:06 +0000,no-reply@sisfirst.com,Surgical Information Systems  - Status Update,"Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in our Transcription Quality Analyst position.
 
After further review with the hiring team, unfortunately, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates for this opportunity.
 
We will keep your resume in our database for any future career opportunities that may be a fit.
 
Best of luck and success with your career.

Surgical Information Systems 
<p>Netanya,</p>
<p></p>
<p>Thank you for your interest in our Transcription Quality Analyst position.</p>
