<p>We will keep your resume in our database for any future career opportunities that may be a fit.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Best of luck and success with your career.</p>
<p></p>
<p>Surgical Information Systems </p>","Netanya, Thank you for your interest in our Transcription Quality Analyst position. After further review with the hiring team, unfortunately, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates for this opportunity. We will keep your resume in our database for any future career opportunities that may be a fit. Best of luck and success with your career. Surgical Information Systems Netanya, Thank you for your interest in our Transcription Quality Analyst position. After further review with the hiring team, unfortunately, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates for this opportunity. We will keep your resume in our database for any future career opportunities that may be a fit. Best of luck and success with your career. Surgical Information Systems",True,sisfirst,Surgical Information Systems,Unknown,2026-06-26 09:15:06+00:00,2026-06,Friday
