                  <tr><td align=""left"" valign=""top"" colspan=""12"">
    <table width=""600"" border=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" bgcolor=""#ffffff"" class=""containerWidth"">
    <tr>
        <td align=""left"" style=""padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0;line-height:20px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;background-color:#ffffff;"">&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
</table><table width=""600"" border=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" bgcolor=""#ffffff"" class=""containerWidth"">
    <tr>
        <td class=""image-column"" align=""left"" style=""padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0;display:block;"">           
            <img width=""250"" height=""60"" class=""imageFix"" src=""https://www1.deltadentalins.com/content/dam/ddins/en/talent-acq/ddins-logo-talent-acq.png"" style=""max-width:600px !important;max-height:60px !important""/>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table><table width=""600"" border=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" bgcolor=""#ffffff"" class=""containerWidth"">
  <tr>
    <td style=""padding-left:25px;padding-right:25px;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px"">
      <div>
 Hi Netanya,
</div>
<div>
 &nbsp;
</div>
<div>
 Thank you for your application to Delta Dental. We appreciate your interest in joining our company and want to thank you for the time and energy you invested in applying to the People Analytics Analyst role. Unfortunately, based on the hiring needs of this position, we have decided to move forward with other candidates at this time. That being said, we’d like to keep your resume on file as our team continues to grow.
</div>
<div>
 &nbsp;
</div>
<div>
 Again, we appreciate your interest in Delta Dental and encourage you to check our&nbsp;<a href=""https://www1.deltadentalins.com/careers.html"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">career site</font></a>&nbsp;for future openings.&nbsp;
</div>
<div>
 <br/>
</div>
<div>
 <div>
  Sincerely,
 </div>
 <div>
  Delta Dental Talent Acquisition Team
 </div>
 <div>
  Delta Dental of California and its Affiliates
 </div>
 <div>
  <i>Our purpose is to improve health by providing access to quality care.</i>
 </div>
 <div>
  <br/>
 </div>
 <div>
 </div>
 <div>
  <b><font color=""#41a928"">Life at Delta Dental&nbsp;</font></b>
 </div>
 <div>
  Here at Delta Dental, we’re behind millions of smiles and counting. Since 1955, we’ve served our communities by increasing access to affordable, quality care – but that commitment to care extends beyond the people we serve, to the dedicated employees who make those smiles genuine. We've come this far by building fair programs that offer opportunities for advancement, create meaningful connections, and improve the lives of our employees and their families. Because we know that when we take exceptional care of each other, we can make a positive impact for all.
 </div>
 <div>
  <br/>
 </div>
 <div>
  To learn more about what a career at Delta Dental looks like, we recommend you:&nbsp;
 </div>
 <div>
  <ul>
   <li><b>Review our&nbsp;<a href=""https://www1.deltadentalins.com/content/dam/ddins/en/pdf/careers/employee-benefits-brochure-delta-dental.pdf"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">comprehensive benefits brochure</font></a>!</b>&nbsp;Our benefits program reflects the shared interests and passions of our employees. We prioritize holistic well-being to ensure you have the resources and support to protect your personal and professional health.&nbsp;</li>
   <li><b>Follow us on&nbsp;<a href=""https://www.linkedin.com/company/delta-dental"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">LinkedIn</font></a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=""https://www.instagram.com/lifeatddins/"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">Instagram</font></a>!&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;</li>
  </ul>
  <div>
   <div>
    Please note, replies to this email will not be received. To reply, please forward this message with your response to our Talent Acquisition Team Mailbox at&nbsp;<a href=""mailto:talentacquisition@delta.org"" target=""_blank"" style=""font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;"">talentacquisition@delta.org</a>.
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
","View in Browser Hi Netanya, Thank you for your application to Delta Dental. We appreciate your interest in joining our company and want to thank you for the time and energy you invested in applying to the People Analytics Analyst role. Unfortunately, based on the hiring needs of this position, we have decided to move forward with other candidates at this time. That being said, we’d like to keep your resume on file as our team continues to grow. Again, we appreciate your interest in Delta Dental and encourage you to check our career site for future openings. Sincerely, Delta Dental Talent Acquisition Team Delta Dental of California and its Affiliates Our purpose is to improve health by providing access to quality care. Life at Delta Dental Here at Delta Dental, we’re behind millions of smiles and counting. Since 1955, we’ve served our communities by increasing access to affordable, quality care – but that commitment to care extends beyond the people we serve, to the dedicated employees who make those smiles genuine. We've come this far by building fair programs that offer opportunities for advancement, create meaningful connections, and improve the lives of our employees and their families. Because we know that when we take exceptional care of each other, we can make a positive impact for all. To learn more about what a career at Delta Dental looks like, we recommend you: Review our comprehensive benefits brochure! Our benefits program reflects the shared interests and passions of our employees. We prioritize holistic well-being to ensure you have the resources and support to protect your personal and professional health. Follow us on LinkedIn and Instagram! Please note, replies to this email will not be received. To reply, please forward this message with your response to our Talent Acquisition Team Mailbox at talentacquisition@delta.org.",True,Delta Dental,Delta Dental,"People Analytics Analyst role. Unfortunately, based on the hiring needs of this",2026-06-25 22:00:58+00:00,2026-06,Thursday
162,19f000da834c5159,"Thu, 25 Jun 2026 18:32:02 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Thank you for applying to QuinStreet,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for applying to the Data Analyst  position. While this letter is automatically generated, our candidate review process is not. Here's what will happen next:

People, not robots read your resume. People who know about the position review each resume that is submitted to us.

Our goal is to have your resume reviewed within two weeks of submitting it to us.

If you're selected to move to the next stage of the interview process, a recruiter will reach out to conduct a preliminary phone screening.

If you're not selected for an interview, please know there are most likely several factors that influenced our decision. One major influencer is unfortunately out of your control - the strength of our candidate pool. Oftentimes, you may have good to great professional experience, but we have to send a rejection because of the level of competition for the role is so high.

Thank you again for submitting your resume for our review. We will make every effort to provide you with consistent communication during your candidacy with us, regardless of the outcome.

Please keep in mind, a QuinStreet Recruiter will never ask you to purchase equipment or ask for any personal information (ie - bank information, deposit checks, personal identity number, government identification) and will only receive email communication from our domains, @quinstreet.com and/or @us.greenhouse-mail.io.

Thank you for applying!

The Recruiting Team
