163,19eff84654994932,"Thu, 25 Jun 2026 16:02:06 +0000 (UTC)",System System <SystemMessage@successfactors.com>,Status of your application with W. L. Gore & Associates,"<table style=""width: 600.0px;"" border=""0"" cellspacing=""1"" cellpadding=""1"" align=""center"">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;""><span id=""cke_bm_92S"" style=""display: none;""> </span><img style=""height: 74.0px; width: 600.0px;"" src=""https://rmkcdn.successfactors.com/06fd4c88/1fda8ef7-f032-44cc-bce7-8.png"" alt=""""></span></span></p>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;"">Dear Netanya,</span></span></p>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;"">Thank you for applying to the Data Operations Specialist -Remote (1708) opportunity at W. L. Gore &amp; Associates. We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and the interest you have shown in our company.</span></span></p>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;"">After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we have decided to move forward with other candidates for this position. Please know that this decision was not easy, as we had many strong applicants.</span></span></p>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;"">We encourage you to follow our careers site for future openings that fit your skills and interests. Additionally, if you have applied for multiple positions, your other applications may still be under consideration. You can check your application status in your <a style=""color: #da291c;"" href=""https://wlgore.jobs.hr.cloud.sap/"" target=""_self"">profile</a> at any time.</span></span></p>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;"">We wish you all the best in your career search and thank you again for your interest in W. L. Gore &amp; Associates. We hope to have the opportunity to consider you for future roles.</span></span></p>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;"">Best Regards,</span></span></p>
<p><span style=""font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;""><span style=""font-size: 12.0px;"">Talent Acquisition<br>W. L. Gore &amp; Associates</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p> </p>
","Dear Netanya, Thank you for applying to the Data Operations Specialist -Remote (1708) opportunity at W. L. Gore & Associates. We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and the interest you have shown in our company. After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we have decided to move forward with other candidates for this position. Please know that this decision was not easy, as we had many strong applicants. We encourage you to follow our careers site for future openings that fit your skills and interests. Additionally, if you have applied for multiple positions, your other applications may still be under consideration. You can check your application status in your profile at any time. We wish you all the best in your career search and thank you again for your interest in W. L. Gore & Associates. We hope to have the opportunity to consider you for future roles. Best Regards, Talent AcquisitionW. L. Gore & Associates",True,System System,System System,"Data Operations Specialist -Remote (1708) opportunity at W. L. Gore & Associates. We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and the interest you have shown in our company. After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we have decided to move forward with other candidates for this",2026-06-25 16:02:06+00:00,2026-06,Thursday
