   <body><div><img src=""cid:zSnskTShGC""/></div><div><br/>We appreciate your interest in our company and the time you’ve invested in applying
      for the Data Analyst opening. <br/><br/>We’ve reviewed your application and have decided
      to move forward with other candidates we feel better align to the job requirements.
      This decision is only for the above referenced job and does not impact your application
      status as it relates to other job(s) for which you may have expressed interest.<br><br>We will be delighted if you’ll keep us in mind as you look at opportunities to grow
      your career and we encourage you to apply again.<br><br>We wish you the very best in your job search.<br><br>Best regards,<br>Talent Acquisition Partner</div>
