   <body><div>Dear Netanya, <br/><br/>After reviewing your information, we regret to inform you
      that your application for Data Analyst was not selected for further consideration.
      We appreciate the time you invested in completing the application. Please remember,
      this status change is only for the job listed above and does not impact your application
      status as it relates to any other job(s) for which you may have applied. <br/><br/>We
      wish you every personal and professional success with your job search and hope you’ll
      consider other opportunities with Kyndryl. To receive alerts on new positions becoming
      available, please be sure to sign up for our Talent Community https://kyndryl.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/KyndrylProfessionalCareers
      if you haven't done so already. <br/><br/>Regards,<br>Kyndryl Talent Acquisition Team</div><div><br/></div><div>Business Process: Review Candidate for Job Application: Netanya Kelley ‎- R-57844
      Data Analyst (C1525904)</div><div>Subject: Job Application: Netanya Kelley ‎- R-57844 Data Analyst (C1525904) on 06/23/2026</div><div><a href=""https://wd5.myworkday.com/kyndryl/email-universal/inst/779$50744871/rel-task/2997$4086.htmld"">Click here to view the notification details.</a></div>
      	     <div>
      	    <!--[if mso | IE]>
