</html>","Dear Netanya, After reviewing your information, we regret to inform you that your application for Data Analyst was not selected for further consideration. We appreciate the time you invested in completing the application. Please remember, this status change is only for the job listed above and does not impact your application status as it relates to any other job(s) for which you may have applied. We wish you every personal and professional success with your job search and hope you’ll consider other opportunities with Kyndryl. To receive alerts on new positions becoming available, please be sure to sign up for our Talent Community https://kyndryl.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/KyndrylProfessionalCareers if you haven't done so already. Regards,Kyndryl Talent Acquisition TeamBusiness Process: Review Candidate for Job Application: Netanya Kelley ‎- R-57844 Data Analyst (C1525904)Subject: Job Application: Netanya Kelley ‎- R-57844 Data Analyst (C1525904) on 06/23/2026Click here to view the notification details. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com Kyndryl Inc. · One Vanderbilt Avenue 15th Floor, New York, NY 10017-3852",True,Unknown,Unknown,Data Analyst,2026-06-24 17:54:26+00:00,2026-06,Wednesday
167,19efaaac065f1068,"Wed, 24 Jun 2026 17:25:54 +0000",OCHIN <do-not-reply@mail.paylocity.com>,Thank you for applying!,"<html style=""background-color: #F4F6F8;""><head><meta http-equiv=""Content-Type"" content=""text/html; charset=us-ascii""> <!--[if mso]> <html style='background-color: #FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!-->  <!--<![endif]-->   </head> <body><div style=""display: none; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; max-height: 0px; max-width: 0px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;""> Dear Faith,Thank you for submitting your application to APPRENTICE EPIC REVENUE CYCLE ANALYST- INSTA...</div> <div style=""display: none; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; max-height: 0px; max-width: 0px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;""> &nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;</div> <!--[if mso]> <table align='center' class='backgroundmso'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <table align=""center"" style=""width: 100%;background-color: #FAFCFD""> <!--<![endif]--> <tbody>  <tr> <td align=""center""> <div style=""width: 680px;border-radius: 20px;border: 1px solid rgba(75, 88, 99, 0.5);box-shadow: 0px 4px 12px 0px rgba(75, 88, 99, 0.5);border-collapse: collapse;background-color: #ffffff;color: #222222;font-size: 14px;text-align: left""> <table cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" align=""center"" style=""table-layout: fixed;border-radius: 20px;width: 680px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: #ffffff;color: #222222;font-size: 14px;text-align: left""> <tbody> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td></td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td>  <td style=""color: #4B5863; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;""> OCHIN [135628] </td>  <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr height=""44px""> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td></td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td> <p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Dear Faith,<br><br>Thank you for submitting your application to APPRENTICE EPIC REVENUE CYCLE ANALYST- INSTALL. &nbsp;We are excited that you are interested in joining the OCHIN team! Our hiring team is currently hard at work reviewing applications. While you await the next steps, we'd like to provide insights into our hiring process.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>What Happens Next</strong></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Our Talent Acquisition team will review your application. If there is strong alignment with the position, we will reach out to schedule a video call. This is an opportunity to get to know you better and answer any questions you may have about OCHIN and the role and to discuss our culture, benefits and total rewards package.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>Our Culture and Values</strong></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">At OCHIN, culture is something we do. Guided by our values and our commitment to diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging, OCHIN strives to create a workplace where employees are heard, respected, challenged, and safe. Our values are listed below:</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><ul><li><strong>Belonging - </strong>welcoming each person’s need to feel seen, heard, supported &amp; understood</li><li><strong>Learning - </strong>being open/curious, seeking new ideas &amp; incorporating lessons learned</li><li><strong>Heart - </strong>speaking our truth &amp; demonstrating courage in all that we pursue- authenticity</li><li><strong>Impact - </strong>creating positive changes through strong partnerships, thoughtful use of resources &amp; a clear path to the future</li></ul><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">We understand the time it takes to put together a resume and apply for a position, and we appreciate the energy you've already invested in this process. We receive a significant number of applications, and we review them with care. <strong>If you are not selected to move forward, we will let you know.</strong></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br><br>Warm Regards,<br>OCHIN People &amp; Culture Team</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">P.S. Learn more about us on <a href=""https://prod.url.paylocity.com?q=8434e5de22ec44dc92d17b67d384a84a"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer nofollow"">LinkedIn</a> and <a href=""https://prod.url.paylocity.com?q=71f85442e00e4efd9b0dbbbb31fa70f8"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer nofollow"">Instagram</a> !</p><table cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody>  </tbody> </table> &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br> </td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <!--[if mso]> <div style='height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'></div> <table style='width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <div style=""height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""></div> <table style=""width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <tbody> <tr> <td> <table align=""center"" style=""width:440px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;""> <tbody> <!--[if mso]> <tr style='background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <tr style=""background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <td> <table style=""table-layout:fixed;"" align=""center"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody> <tr height=""39px""> <td>&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td style=""text-align:center""> <span style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"">This email is only for the person(s) addressed.</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=""text-align:center""> <span style=""text-align:center""> <a style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"" href=""https://www.paylocity.com/privacy/"">Privacy Policy</a>   | <a style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"" href=""https://app.paylocity.com/Communication