receive a significant number of applications, and we review them with care. If you are not selected to move forward, we will let you know.Warm Regards,OCHIN People & Culture TeamP.S. Learn more about us on LinkedIn and Instagram ! This email is only for the person(s) addressed. Privacy Policy | Unsubscribe",True,OCHIN,OCHIN,APPRENTICE EPIC REVENUE CYCLE ANALYST- INSTA,2026-06-24 17:25:54+00:00,2026-06,Wednesday
168,19efa87fedb95ca4,"Wed, 24 Jun 2026 16:47:56 +0000 (UTC)",RR Donnelley Hiring Team <notifications@smartrecruiters.com>,RRD: Thank you for your interest - ​Operations Associate Development Program​,"
Hi&nbsp;Netanya,
Thank you for taking the time to apply to our Operations Associate Development Program.&nbsp;
Upon consideration, we&#39;ve decided to move forward with other candidates at this time.
We encourage you to look at our career page for other opportunities that align with your interests and skill-set. Also, feel free to follow us on LinkedIn, as well as to stay up to date with our most recent roles and news here at RR Donnelley.
We hope that you will continue to consider RRD for possible future opportunities, and we wish you the best of luck in your current search!
Sincerely,
RRD Human Resources
&nbsp;
Disclaimer: If you have applied to multiple roles with us, please note that you may receive separate notifications regarding each position.
