  <body style=""background-color: #ffffff;"">
    <table width=""100%"" border=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0"">
      <tr>
        <td style=""font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;"">
          <p style=""margin-bottom:10px"">Hi Netanya,</p><p style=""margin-bottom:10px"">Thank you for your interest in HelioCampus!</p><p style=""margin-bottom:10px"">We received an overwhelming response to the Implementation Associate position, which makes us feel both humble and proud that so many talented individuals (like you!) want to join our team. This volume of response makes for an extremely competitive selection process. Although your background is impressive, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates for the position at this time.</p><p style=""margin-bottom:10px"">Just as we at HelioCampus value our clients, we value our job candidates and invite you to review future job openings. We hope you see another position that sparks your interest!</p><p style=""margin-bottom:10px"">All the best,</p>

<p class=""signature"" style=""margin-bottom:10px"">-- <br>Carolina Bartolome-Pate<br>HelioCampus</p>
