<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Hello Faith, Thank you for taking the time to apply for the position of Program Business Analyst HEALTH PROGRAM (Texas REMOTE) with ICF. We appreciate your interest in joining us in our purpose-driven work. Our team weighs factors such as timing, the number and caliber of candidates who apply, and the needs of our project teams to make these choices. Unfortunately, for this particular role, we’re not moving forward with your application. We respect your talents and hope you keep ICF in consideration as you search for your next role. You can sign up for job alerts here, search our other opportunities on www.icf.com/careers, and join our Talent Community for company updates and more. We wish you all the best in your job search and hope you find work you believe in. Thank you, ICF Global Talent AcquisitionJOB SEARCH This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,ICF Human Resources,ICF Human Resources,Unknown,2026-06-22 22:33:54+00:00,2026-06,Monday
