176,19ee1985f631773f,"Fri, 19 Jun 2026 20:35:19 +0000",Alex Ruedger <aruedger@acceleratecontent.recruitmail.com>,Thank you for your interest in Mathematica," Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Mathematica and for your recent application to the  Data Analytics Developer (Remote Eligible) position. We sincerely appreciate your time and energy. After careful review, we regret to inform you that we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time. While your qualifications are impressive, we have decided to pursue other candidates whose profiles more closely align with our current needs and requirements for this role. We appreciate your interest in joining our team, and we encourage you to explore future openings that match your skills and experience:  www.mathematica.org/career-opportunities . Again, thank you for considering a career with Mathematica. We wish you all the best in your job search and future career endeavors. Sincerely, Mathematica Talent Acquisition Team 
