g forward with your candidacy at this time. While your qualifications are impressive, we have decided to pursue other candidates whose profiles more closely align with our current needs and requirements for this role. We appreciate your interest in joining our team, and we encourage you to explore future openings that match your skills and experience: www.mathematica.org/career-opportunities . Again, thank you for considering a career with Mathematica. We wish you all the best in your job search and future career endeavors. Sincerely, Mathematica Talent Acquisition Team Dear Netanya,Thank you for your interest in Mathematica and for your recent application to the Data Analytics Developer (Remote Eligible) position. We sincerely appreciate your time and energy.After careful review, we regret to inform you that we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time. While your qualifications are impressive, we have decided to pursue other candidates whose profiles more closely align with our current needs and requirements for this role.We appreciate your interest in joining our team, and we encourage you to explore future openings that match your skills and experience: www.mathematica.org/career-opportunities.Again, thank you for considering a career with Mathematica. We wish you all the best in your job search and future career endeavors.Sincerely,Mathematica Talent Acquisition Team",True,Alex Ruedger,Alex Ruedger,Unknown,2026-06-19 20:35:19+00:00,2026-06,Friday
177,19ee006fe840a017,"Fri, 19 Jun 2026 13:16:52 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Important information about your application to Whalar,"Hi Netanya,

We want to thank you wholeheartedly for applying to the Data Analyst position at Whalar.

While your experience is impressive, we received an overwhelming number of applications, making the selection process incredibly competitive. As such, we have made the decision to move forward with other candidates at this time.

Please know that this decision was not taken lightly, and it does not diminish our appreciation for your interest in joining our team.

We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page ( https://whalargroup.com/careers/ ) for future opportunities that pique your interest and align with your professional experience and expertise!

Thank you once again for your enthusiasm and interest in joining Whalar and we wish you all the best in your job search.

Best Wishes,
Whalar Group Recruitment
