<p>Please know that this decision was not taken lightly, and it does not diminish our appreciation for your interest in joining our team.</p>
<p>We encourage you to keep an eye on our <a href=""https://whalargroup.com/careers/"">careers page</a> for future opportunities that pique your interest and align with your professional experience and expertise!&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you once again for your enthusiasm and interest in joining Whalar and we wish you all the best in your job search.</p>
