182,19ec8940c73493d4,"Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:05 +0000 (GMT)","""Revecore Careers (do_not_reply@adp.com)"" <jobs+5e7c758da85d4380ab69fcb3ed10620c@adp.com>",Update on Your Application - Revecore,"<DIV><img border=0 src='http://recruiting.adp.com/portal-upload/encoded.?encoding=v02PXXc7DvTRDPmPMsWcs4unZ%2F2aFqtcWVaj0ys0vWaZhsr0NHKw23H9ofAG__6m4PtcPXvL%2FKneq9SfJmfsnNTIrcevC_%2Ff7uEZ0oWjTIsMpCC4RiF8VHYz2WEMuggPTpjlDWuT07tr3Ner9WB2ihBKoZ9%2FqQmjjUZiTcH2%2Fj3PZ8B%2Fj%2FNIrQw7973tUu1VPIHKQ4RaHph4q6_x9tcAhAQqjaeTlH2p5WsQobatVECe3c%3D'></DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><SPAN style=""font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"">Dear Netanya:</SPAN></DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV>
<DIV><SPAN style=""font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"">Thank you for applying&nbsp;for the position of Data Operations Analyst&nbsp;-&nbsp;1039. We've decided to move forward with other candidates who qualifications more closely align with this specific opportunity. After a careful review of your background and experience, we've determined that this role is not the right fit at this time.&nbsp;</SPAN></DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><SPAN style=""font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"">We appreciate the time you invested in applying and encourage you to visit our Career Center to explore other opportunities that may be of interest to you.&nbsp;</SPAN></DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><SPAN style=""font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"">Sincerely,&nbsp;</SPAN></DIV>
<DIV><SPAN style=""font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;""><SPAN style=""font-size: 12pt;"">Adam&nbsp;Bacheller</SPAN></SPAN></DIV>
</DIV>
<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>
