   <body><div>Dear Netanya ,<br><br>Thank you for your interest in the R056496 Sr. Loan Boarding Coordinator position
      with First American. We were impressed with your skills and experiences, however we
      have selected another candidate who we believe more closely matches the job qualifications.
      First American actively recruits for open positions nationwide. In the future, we
      invite you to apply for any available positions that you find of interest, posted
      on <a href=""www.firstam.com/careers"">First American Careers</a>.<br><br>*Note: If you applied to another First American position, you can confirm your status
      by visiting your candidate profile, noting the specific requisition number. Thank
      you again for your consideration and we wish you well in your search.<br><br>Regards,<br><br>Talent Acquisition Team</div><div><img src=""cid:KnMhyyEIhi""/></div>
