187,19eac89b9448b548,"Tue, 9 Jun 2026 09:19:26 -0400 (EDT)",Peraton <peraton+autoreply@talent.icims.com>,Peraton Application Update,"Dear Netanya,
 
I would like to take this opportunity to thank you for applying to our Applications Programming, Associate (2026-167298) position.

After careful consideration of your qualifications, we regret to inform you that we have decided to pursue other candidates for this role.

We will maintain your records and should a position open that matches your qualifications, we will contact you. We also encourage you to visit our career site as new positions become available daily.

We appreciate your interest in our company and wish you success in your career search. To review the status of all applications you’ve submitted for Peraton positions, please sign in to your Peraton careers profile from our career site as a returning applicant and review your applicant dashboard.

Regards,


Talent Acquisition

