{
  border:0px;
}</style></head>
   <body><div>Hi Faith, <br/><br/>Thank you for your interest in the Associate Research Analyst,
      Property Tax position at DMA and for taking the time to apply. After careful consideration
      and review of all applicants, we regret to inform you that we have decided not to
      proceed with your application for this position at this time.<br><br>If you have applied for other opportunities with DMA, please know that your applications
      remain active and you are still being considered for those roles.<br><br>We sincerely appreciate your interest in joining DMA and wish you the best of luck
      in your job search.<br><br>Sincerely,<br>DMA Careers</div><div><br/></div><div>This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message.</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:MkCCceTTLI""/></div>
