191,19ea29928d807840,"Sun, 07 Jun 2026 15:00:04 +0000",no-reply@smithrx.com,Update on your application for Marketing Data Analyst with SmithRx,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for applying for the Marketing Data Analyst role at SmithRx. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team.

After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience and qualifications more closely align with the needs of this role.

We truly value your interest in SmithRx and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that match your skills and interests.

Thank you again for considering SmithRx, and we wish you the best in your job search.

Best regards,

SmithRx Team
<p>Hi Netanya,</p>
<p>Thank you for applying for the Marketing Data Analyst role at SmithRx. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team.</p>
<p>After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience and qualifications more closely align with the needs of this role.</p>
<p>We truly value your interest in SmithRx and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that match your skills and interests.</p>
<p>Thank you again for considering SmithRx, and we wish you the best in your job search.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Best regards,<br><br>SmithRx Team</p><img width=""1"" height=""1"" alt="""" src=""http://email.gh-mail.smithrx.com/o/eJwczEFuwyAQheHTlF2tYRgGvGBV9QQ9QEU8kxgV2xUmVXP7iGyf_vdJiheO3hpNNkSIRATerAmFQ7g4nJHFX71zM0FcOBBaXtzVmZIQkIEhWA8ANGUVnnEm54NHC_GN4La-b7nU6dxKX9v_tBybOdrtu0giAIwMAGh-tZ3HPkYMhDEQ2DG3tGvP-yP_aK364OG9tKGcpR6vh-npa1lV7lXlI-9SJHf9HJ25n9pGY_4SPgMAAP__NixEZA"">","Hi Netanya, Thank you for applying for the Marketing Data Analyst role at SmithRx. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team. After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience and qualifications more closely align with the needs of this role. We truly value your interest in SmithRx and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that match your skills and interests. Thank you again for considering SmithRx, and we wish you the best in your job search. Best regards, SmithRx Team Hi Netanya, Thank you for applying for the Marketing Data Analyst role at SmithRx. We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team. After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience and qualifications more closely align with the needs of this role. We truly value your interest in SmithRx and encourage you to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that match your skills and interests. Thank you again for considering SmithRx, and we wish you the best in your job search. Best regards,SmithRx Team",True,smithrx,SmithRx,Marketing Data Analyst with SmithRx,2026-06-07 15:00:04+00:00,2026-06,Sunday
