y to review open positions or join our <a href = ""https://sanfordcareers.com/talent-community/"">Talent Community</a> to connect with a member from our hiring team for potential career opportunities that align with your talents and skillsets.<br><br>Again, we appreciate your interest in the organization. We hope that you will keep us in mind and apply again! <br> <br>Best wishes with your job search and personal endeavors.<br> <br>Sincerely,  <br><br>Sanford Human Resources</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></div><!--[if mso | IE]><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" width=""600"" align=""center"" style=""width:600px;""><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:auto;max-width:600px;"">
