Thank you for your interest in Mercury Insurance. We truly appreciate the time and effort you invested in applying for 2026-6462: Product Analyst I and considering joining our team.
 
After careful review and consideration of all applications, we regret to inform you that we have decided to move forward with other candidates whose qualifications more closely align with the requirements of the position at this time.
 
Please know that this decision was not easy, as we received many strong applications, including yours. Your skills and experience are impressive, and we encourage you to continue to apply to positions that match your interest and qualifications.
 
We genuinely value your interest in joining our team and wish you all the best in your job search.
 
 
Sincerely,
 
Mercury Insurance Talent Acquisition Team
 


 


