195,19e94077af261f2a,"Thu, 4 Jun 2026 19:06:17 +0000 (GMT)",<LighthouseDocumentTechnologiesInc.hr@adp.com>,Thank you for your interest,"<html><head><style type=""text/css"">p {margin-block-start: 0 !important; margin-block-end: 0 !important; margin: 0px !important;}</style></head><body><div style='background-color: #ffff00;padding: 5px 10px 5px 10px;width:100%;text-align: center'>Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at Lighthouse Document Technologies Inc using ADP services. </div><br/><br/><link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.2.2/css/froala_editor.pkgd.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""> <link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.2.2/css/froala_style.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""><div class=""fr-view"">Thank you for your interest in Lighthouse, and applying to our open <span class=""fr-deletable"" comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Position Title"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272512"">Billing Analyst</span>. At this time, we will not be moving forward with your candidacy.  Please visit our careers page often as we encourage you to apply to future opportunities with Lighthouse.<br>Thank you,<br><br>Lighthouse Recruiting Team<style>p {margin-block-start: 0em !important; margin-block-end: 0em !important;}</style></div><br/><a href=""https://brightjump.adp.com/public/home"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer""><img src=""https://workforcenow.adp.com/mascsr/default/mdf/recruitment/brightJump.png"" alt=""ADP BrightJump Career Resources"" style=""display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;"" /></a><br/><br/>Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.<img style=""display:none !important;border-style:none !important;""  alt="""" width=""1"" height=""1"" src=""https://netsecure.adp.com/communication-ui/event/id/1ueb4ry96djcb972.jpg?eventDetails=uXJMbd7rFe1mp0PCoO_34GBEeLwbvfSVE4to39UlTbCqrRsbIf50ellDNpSS2QFSt-ODe2lhraFFvlVdlldsL2sYB0JAsy1Dm23vDV_VOJ9w_HPbMuyAaXsQnijxKdZBAYM2a016jn2o6Btl6vgLijSyTShOHrfHC9kHSRxLBBu9xNABJ9S-4qujPS5bd-FpHjZyEMn032KwjETT2neZKYeLi5I0SgkDhkyRZW2Esrlux_o7rFFmbkNPSzDE_8V9"" /></body></html>","Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at Lighthouse Document Technologies Inc using ADP services. Thank you for your interest in Lighthouse, and applying to our open Billing Analyst. At this time, we will not be moving forward with your candidacy. Please visit our careers page often as we encourage you to apply to future opportunities with Lighthouse.Thank you,Lighthouse Recruiting TeamNote: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.",True,,,Unknown,2026-06-04 19:06:17+00:00,2026-06,Thursday
196,19e92d60bfcb4223,"Thu, 4 Jun 2026 13:32:40 +0000 (UTC)",Eaton TalentHub <noreply@talenthub.eaton.com>,Update Regarding Your Application,"<p>Hi Netanya,</p>

<p>Thank you for applying for the position of Logistics Analyst &ndash; 65727. We appreciate you considering a career at Eaton. After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match the current needs for this team and position.</p>

<p>We know that messages like this are disappointing, but we really hope you continue to pursue other opportunities at Eaton. Be sure to check out Eaton.com/careers, where you can find all our open jobs and set up a job alert.</p>

<p>Thank you for your interest in Eaton and wish you all the best!</p>

<p>Eaton Talent Acquisition Team</p>
","Hi Netanya, Thank you for applying for the position of Logistics Analyst – 65727. We appreciate you considering a career at Eaton. After careful review, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match the current needs for this team and position. We know that messages like this are disappointing, but we really hope you continue to pursue other opportunities at Eaton. Be sure to check out Eaton.com/careers, where you can find all our open jobs and set up a job alert. Thank you for your interest in Eaton and wish you all the best! Eaton Talent Acquisition Team",True,Eaton TalentHub,Eaton,Unknown,2026-06-04 13:32:40+00:00,2026-06,Thursday
