at Skylo and for taking the time to apply. After careful consideration, we will not be moving forward with your application at this time, as we are seeking candidates whose qualifications more closely match our current requirements. We appreciate your interest in Skylo and encourage you to apply for future opportunities that align with your experience. Thank you once again for your time. Thanks, The Skylo Hiring Team Follow us on https://www.linkedin.com/company/skylotech/posts/?feedView=all to get the latest job updates. Hi Netanya, Thank you for your interest in the Technical Business Analyst role here at Skylo and for taking the time to apply. After careful consideration, we will not be moving forward with your application at this time, as we are seeking candidates whose qualifications more closely match our current requirements. We appreciate your interest in Skylo and encourage you to apply for future opportunities that align with your experience. Thank you once again for your time. Thanks, The Skylo Hiring Team Follow us on LinkedIn to get the latest job updates.",True,Skylo Technologies Hiring Team,Skylo Technologies Hiring Team,Skylo,2026-06-04 00:05:19+00:00,2026-06,Thursday
199,19e8f05aa0f0305d,"Wed, 3 Jun 2026 19:46:13 +0000",humana@myworkday.com,An Update on Your Humana Application: R-418368 Correspondence Representative,"<!doctype html><html xmlns:v=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml"" xmlns:o=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"">
   <head>
      <meta http-equiv=""Content-Type"" content=""text/html; charset=UTF-8"">
      <title></title><style type=""text/css"">body, table {
  font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;
