}
div {
  padding-top:5px;
  padding-bottom:5px;
}
img 
{
  border:0px;
}</style></head>
   <body><div>Hi Faith, <br/><br/>Thank you for taking the time to apply for R-418368 Correspondence
      Representative. We truly appreciate your interest and for considering us as a future
      employer.<br><br>After reviewing your application, we found that certain job requirements weren’t the
      right match at this time, or, we’ve identified other candidates who more closely match
      these requirements. We will not be moving forward with your candidacy for this position.
      We know this isn’t the news you were hoping for, and we don’t take these decisions
      lightly.<br><br>Although we are not pursuing you for this opportunity, your journey with us doesn’t
      have to end here. Our team is always evolving, and new positions open regularly that
      may better align. Here are a few ways to stay connected and be among the first to
      hear about future opportunities:<br><br>1) Join our talent communities: <a href=""https://careers.humana.com/us/en/jointalentcommunity"">Humana</a>
      and <a href=""https://www.centerwellcareers.com/us/en/jointalentcommunity"">CenterWell</a><br>2) Sign up for personalized job alerts: <a href=""https://careers.humana.com/us/en/search-results"">Humana</a>
      and <a href=""https://www.centerwellcareers.com/us/en/search-results"">CenterWell</a><br>3) Explore upcoming career events: <a href=""https://careers.humana.com/us/en/events"">Humana</a>
      and <a href=""https://www.centerwellcareers.com/us/en/events"">CenterWell</a><br>4) Follow us on LinkedIn: <a href=""https://www.linkedin.com/company/humana/"">Humana</a>
      and <a href=""https://www.linkedin.com/company/centerwell/"">CenterWell</a><br><br>Thanks again for considering us. We’re looking forward to reconnecting soon!<br><br>Sincerely, <br/>Humana Talent Acquisition Team<br><br><br>Interested in contract opportunities? <a href=""https://humana.talentnet.community/"">Explore
      contractor roles available at Humana and CenterWell.</a></div><div><p style=""display: none;"">For administrative use only: Pd56JnWeR</p></div>
