200,19e8e1f251fa2fd7,"Wed, 3 Jun 2026 11:34:25 -0400 (EDT)",Samantha Berg <samantha.berg@kentro.us>,Application Update - Jr. Data Analyst – Software Asset Management (VA ESOM),"Dear Netanya,
 
Thank you for taking the time to consider Kentro. We will not be moving forward with next steps for the Jr. Data Analyst &ndash; Software Asset Management (VA ESOM) position. This is not a rejection email, but a notification that we are finalizing steps with a qualified candidate and will not be pursuing others at this time.
 
Our team was impressed by your skills and accomplishments listed on your resume. You could be a good fit for other future openings. Please continue to check our positions as we update weekly: Job Listings at Kentro.
 
Thank you for your time and communication. We wish you the best.
 
Regards,
Kentro Talent Acquisition Team
 
Kentro Company Brief: 2026 Recruiting 1 Pager Kentro–Core of More Slick Sheet


**************************************************
This message was sent to netanyakelley6@gmail.com. If you don't want to receive these emails from this company in the future, please go to:
