/n &#169; Kentro, Virginia USA/n

<p style=""margin: 0px;""><span style=""font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"">Dear&nbsp;<img class=""w-phr candidate_first_name"" title=""[candidate_first_name]"" src=""data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw=="" alt=""[candidate_first_name]"" />Netanya,</span></p><p style=""margin: 0px;"">&nbsp;</p><p style=""margin: 0px;""><span style=""font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"">Thank you for taking the time to consider Kentro. We will not be moving forward with next steps for the Jr. Data Analyst &ndash; Software Asset Management (VA ESOM)<img class=""w-phr job"" title=""[job]"" src=""data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw=="" alt=""[job]"" />&nbsp;position. This is not a rejection email, but a notification that we are finalizing steps with a qualified candidate and will not be pursuing others at this time.</span></p><p style=""margin: 0px;"">&nbsp;</p><p style=""margin: 0px;""><span style=""font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"">Our team was impressed by your skills and accomplishments listed on your resume. You could be a good fit for other future openings. Please continue to check our positions as we update weekly: <a href=""https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/ihl8HGl69_8x5LcUHdYMKA~~/AAIB5hA~/DdLYc1kVf_ha9KPjKr5lNFJwyDOYqqmYU9fB945J3mb3Gtyl7jNKA1B1jn8TUFo15g1ceXN15btBbHNEOuOUi7eZMpr5NK3ljpBLIm1Pmq_Xupk0yzlUpxejU1N5G3369tVDtrw6u3rtkPLzfyn4042E0Zg1VVKuSQxSvon54hviGS8dBdX5ZHUbiJ8NcH17S0sHkyIgIbfUEBN7MYLRuwn2CTFzGPPH1VZodk6Nrl8pAkTAaL2U5_FNcbBWv7E06W1yfMpA2ivxem9Z81eXmwmNJTnJj24BvZk_qGzcPJ0~"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Job Listings at Kentro</a>.</span></p><p style=""margin: 0px;"">&nbsp;</p><p style=""margin: 0px;""><span style=""font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"">Thank you for your time and communication. We wish you the best.</span></p><p style=""margin: 0px;"">&nbsp;</p><p style=""margin: 0px;""><s