ride.  <br><br>We encourage you to stay connected by joining our talent community. Simply complete this <a href=""https://flows.beamery.com/stride/tc-signup"">form</a> and we'll stay in touch with information about job opportunities, upcoming recruitment events, and other news about Stride.   <br><br>We wish you success in your professional endeavors.  <br><br>Regards,<br>Stride Careers</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:middle;width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:middle;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px 25px 25px 25px;"" class=""mj-column-per-100-0 mj-outlook-group-fix"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px 25px 25px 25px;"" width=""100%"" ><tr><td align=""center"" vertical-align=""middle"" style=""font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;direction:ltr;"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""border-collapse:separate;line-height:100%;"" ><tr><td align