   <body><div><img src=""cid:xCkEAEsLHx""/></div><div><br/></div><div>Dear Faith, <br/><br/>Thank you for your desire to pursue career opportunities at
      Cincinnati Children's. After reviewing your qualifications and experience as it relates
      to the specific needs of the Bioinformatics Analyst position, Requisition/Job # JR215732,
      in the Neonate & Pul Biol department, we regret that we will not be moving forward
      with your application.<br><br>We appreciate your time and patience during this process. We will keep your resume
      on file and may reach out to you if we have another opening for a position that better
      aligns with your skill sets and accomplishments.<br><br>Your personal skill set and goals may align with other opportunities at Cincinnati
      Children’s, and we encourage you to visit our career site for current and future openings.
      We look forward to exploring other career options with you.<br><br>Again, thank you for your time and efforts. We wish you success in all future career
      endeavors.<br><br>Human Resources - Talent Acquisition</div><div><br/></div><div>Replies to this message are undeliverable and will not reach the Human Resources Department.
      Please do not reply.</div>
