</html>","Dear Faith, Thank you for your desire to pursue career opportunities at Cincinnati Children's. After reviewing your qualifications and experience as it relates to the specific needs of the Bioinformatics Analyst position, Requisition/Job # JR215732, in the Neonate & Pul Biol department, we regret that we will not be moving forward with your application.We appreciate your time and patience during this process. We will keep your resume on file and may reach out to you if we have another opening for a position that better aligns with your skill sets and accomplishments.Your personal skill set and goals may align with other opportunities at Cincinnati Children’s, and we encourage you to visit our career site for current and future openings. We look forward to exploring other career options with you.Again, thank you for your time and efforts. We wish you success in all future career endeavors.Human Resources - Talent AcquisitionReplies to this message are undeliverable and will not reach the Human Resources Department. Please do not reply. This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-06-03 04:14:04+00:00,2026-06,Wednesday
204,19e8471ab2cbcd4d,"Mon, 1 Jun 2026 14:28:21 -0400 (EDT)",Ryan Thresher <heart+email+zk0w-8147d01d27@talent.icims.com>,Thank you for your interest in the American Heart Association," 
 

 

Dear Netanya,
 
Thank you for taking the time to apply to the Data Science Analyst role, requisition #2026-17019, at American Heart Association. We truly appreciate your interest in joining our vision of bringing health and hope to everyone, everywhere. 
  
After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with our current needs. We truly appreciate your interest in the American Heart Association and invite you to explore future opportunities with us at heart.jobs. 
  
We also invite you to stay in touch with us in one or more of the following ways: 
- Join our Talent Community to receive updates on events, new roles, and life at the Association. 


- Set up Job Search Alerts directly from heart.jobs to be notified when new opportunities match your interests. Enter your job search criteria and choose to receive an alert about new jobs via email or text. 


- Text “HeartJobs” to 469-840-1720 to learn about current openings via text message. 


- Follow #TheAHALife on LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, and X  to learn more about our culture and people. 
  
Thank you again for your interest in the American Heart Association and for considering a career with us. We wish you all the best in your continued career journey. 
 
Sincerely,
 
Ryan Thresher  
American Heart Association Talent Attraction Team
 
 
Due to the number of applications we receive, we are not able to follow up with individual inquiries.  If you no longer wish to receive e-mail from American Heart Association, click here: https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/XYfwrEgW4FyyRTxoYWEOlA~~/AAIB5hA~/kgZnl5W_BucyrHH0goNvBopweKQu_2zrARcHlmW7LhQc3dBYTASKVQgS9j0IHT80Bl8aoaiEs13Gdaj5BPn3AyT_mtvFqqcvInLiGiK81F9sGbBrBvlqwWv7HvpiO2tdou5BD-tDwf7O0WC9dIVUA4NPY4TBZzPHx5LSayyXWX8l69384aOlL2AFqD8N0VoH.
 
 
 


