","Dear Netanya, Thank you for taking the time to apply to the Data Science Analyst role, requisition #2026-17019, at American Heart Association. We truly appreciate your interest in joining our vision of bringing health and hope to everyone, everywhere. After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with our current needs. We truly appreciate your interest in the American Heart Association and invite you to explore future opportunities with us at heart.jobs. We also invite you to stay in touch with us in one or more of the following ways: - Join our Talent Community to receive updates on events, new roles, and life at the Association. - Set up Job Search Alerts directly from heart.jobs to be notified when new opportunities match your interests. Enter your job search criteria and choose to receive an alert about new jobs via email or text. - Text “HeartJobs” to 469-840-1720 to learn about current openings via text message. - Follow #TheAHALife on LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, and X to learn more about our culture and people. Thank you again for your interest in the American Heart Association and for considering a career with us. We wish you all the best in your continued career journey. Sincerely, Ryan Thresher American Heart Association Talent Attraction Team Due to the number of applications we receive, we are not able to follow up with individual inquiries. If you no longer wish to receive e-mail from American Heart Association, click here: https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/XYfwrEgW4FyyRTxoYWEOlA~~/AAIB5hA~/kgZnl5W_BucyrHH0goNvBopweKQu_2zrARcHlmW7LhQc3dBYTASKVQgS9j0IHT80Bl8aoaiEs13Gdaj5BPn3AyT_mtvFqqcvInLiGiK81F9sGbBrBvlqwWv7HvpiO2tdou5BD-tDwf7O0WC9dIVUA4NPY4TBZzPHx5LSayyXWX8l69384aOlL2AFqD8N0VoH. ************************************************** This message was sent to netanyakelley6@gmail.com. If you don't want to receive these emails from this company in the future, please go to: https://tr