 are not selected for this position, please keep an eye on our careers page as we are continuously growing and adding new opportunities.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Kind Regards,</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Paylocity Talent Acquisition</p><table cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody>  </tbody> </table> &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br> </td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <!--[if mso]> <div style='height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'></div> <table style='width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <div style=""height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""></div> <table style=""width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <tbody> <tr> <td> <table align=""center"" style=""width:440px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;""> <tbody> <!--[if mso]> <tr style='background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <tr style=""background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <td> <table style=""table-layout:fixed;"" align=""center"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody> <tr height=""39px""> <td>&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td style=""text-align:center""> <span style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"">This email is only for the person(s) addressed.</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=""text-align:center""> <span style=""text-align:center""> <a style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"" href=""https://www.paylocity.com/privacy/"">Privacy Policy</a>   | <a style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"" href=""https://2000app.paylocity.com/CommunicationUserPreferences/v1/companies/2000/unsubscribe?NotificationId=8aeb4940-1f81-4ef1-ae09-6f6355900ee1&amp;Appli