</table><table width=""600"" border=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" bgcolor=""#ffffff"" class=""containerWidth"">
  <tr>
    <td style=""padding-left:25px;padding-right:25px;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px"">
      <div>
 Hello Netanya Kelley,
</div>
<div>
 <br/>
</div>
<div>
 Thank you for your interest in Delta Dental! We have successfully received your application for the People Analytics Analyst role and appreciate the time you took to apply. Our recruiting team will review your application and be in touch. If you are not selected for this position, please check out our&nbsp;<a href=""https://www1.deltadentalins.com/careers.html"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">career site</font></a>&nbsp;as we continuously update it with new opportunities. Additionally, if you haven't already, we encourage you to sign up for our&nbsp;<a href=""https://www1.deltadentalins.com/careers.html"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">talent community</font></a>&nbsp;to receive job alerts about new opportunities that may be a perfect fit for you.
</div>
<div>
 <br/>
</div>
<div>
 Sincerely,
</div>
<div>
 Delta Dental Talent Acquisition Team
</div>
<div>
 Delta Dental of California and its Affiliates
</div>
<div>
 <i>Our purpose is to improve health by providing access to quality care.</i>
</div>
<div>
 <br/>
</div>
<div>
 <b><font color=""#41a928"">Life at Delta Dental&nbsp;</font></b>
</div>
<div>
 Here at Delta Dental, we’re behind millions of smiles and counting. Since 1955, we’ve served our communities by increasing access to affordable, quality care – but that commitment to care extends beyond the people we serve, to the dedicated employees who make those smiles genuine. We've come this far by building fair programs that offer opportunities for advancement, create meaningful connections, and improve the lives of our employees and their families. Because we know that when we take exceptional care of each other, we can make a positive impact for all.
</div>
<div>
 <br/>
</div>
<div>
 To learn more about what a career at Delta Dental looks like, we recommend you:&nbsp;
</div>
<div>
 <ul>
  <li><b>Review our&nbsp;<a href=""https://www1.deltadentalins.com/content/dam/ddins/en/pdf/careers/employee-benefits-brochure-delta-dental.pdf"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">comprehensive benefits brochure</font></a>!</b>&nbsp;Our benefits program reflects the shared interests and passions of our employees. We prioritize holistic well-being to ensure you have the resources and support to protect your personal and professional health.</li>
  <li><b>Follow us on&nbsp;<a href=""https://www.linkedin.com/company/delta-dental"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">LinkedIn</font></a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=""https://www.instagram.com/lifeatddins/"" target=""_blank""><font color=""#41a928"">Instagram</font></a>!&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;</li>
 </ul>
</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
","View in Browser Hello Netanya Kelley, Thank you for your interest in Delta Dental! We have successfully received your application for the People Analytics Analyst role and appreciate the time you took to apply. Our recruiting team will review your application and be in touch. If you are not selected for this position, please check out our career site as we continuously update it with new opportunities. Additionally, if you haven't already, we encourage you to sign up for our talent community to receive job alerts about new opportunities that may be a perfect fit for you. Sincerely, Delta Dental Talent Acquisition Team Delta Dental of California and its Affiliates Our purpose is to improve health by providing access to quality care. Life at Delta Dental Here at Delta Dental, we’re behind millions of smiles and counting. Since 1955, we’ve served our communities by increasing access to affordable, quality care – but that commitment to care extends beyond the people we serve, to the dedicated employees who make those smiles genuine. We've come this far by building fair programs that offer opportunities for advancement, create meaningful connections, and improve the lives of our employees and their families. Because we know that when we take exceptional care of each other, we can make a positive impact for all. To learn more about what a career at Delta Dental looks like, we recommend you: Review our comprehensive benefits brochure! Our benefits program reflects the shared interests and passions of our employees. We prioritize holistic well-being to ensure you have the resources and support to protect your personal and professional health. Follow us on LinkedIn and Instagram!",True,Delta Dental,Delta Dental,People Analytics Analyst - 3288,2026-05-30 19:53:31+00:00,2026-05,Saturday
