Thanks for applying to work with us at Datavant. We appreciate your interest in joining our company.

We carefully reviewed applications for the Health Information Specialist I Entry- Level role, and unfortunately, at this time we will not be moving forward with your candidacy. However, we encourage you to continue visiting our careers page ( https://www.datavant.com/about/careers ) and to follow us on Linkedin ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/datavant/mycompany/ ) to see the most current job openings.

Thanks again for your interest in Datavant and we wish you luck in your search.

Regards,

The Datavant Recruiting Team
