   <body><div><img src=""cid:UGiDQZqiUQ""/></div><div>Dear Netanya, <br/><br/>Thank you for your interest in the role of Credit Analyst-26941798.
      <br/><br/>We want to let you know that we unfortunately will not be moving forward
      with your application for this particular role. While this position might not have
      been right for you, there could be another opportunity for you to join our team listed
      in our <a href=""http://www.jobs.citi.com"">Careers Site</a> . So, when you have some
      time, we encourage you to take a look and submit an application if you see something
