241,19e18b55be4339e4,"Mon, 11 May 2026 20:23:18 +0000",Prizeout <no-reply@hire.lever.co>,Prizeout Application Update,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you so much for taking the time to apply to Prizeout and for sharing your background with us. We truly enjoyed learning more about you and your experience.

After careful consideration, we've decided to move forward with other candidates at this time. That said, we were genuinely impressed by your profile, and we’d love to keep in touch in case a future opportunity opens up that’s a better match.

We really appreciate your interest in Prizeout and the effort you put into your application. Wishing you all the best in your job search and continued success in your career.


Best,
The Prizeout Recruiting Team
