254,19dc63b1552eafcf,"Sat, 25 Apr 2026 20:00:53 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Important information about your application to Kodiak Solutions,"Netanya,

Thank you so much for your interest around the Healthcare Data Analyst position at Kodiak Solutions.

After careful consideration, we've decided to move forward with other candidates for this role. This decision was not easy, as we had many strong candidates, and we truly appreciate the opportunity to learn more about your background and experience.

We’ll be keeping your information on file for future opportunities that may be a better fit. We wish you all the best in your job search and continued success in your career.

Regards,

Kodiak Talent Acquisition
