<p><!--EndFragment--></p>","Netanya, Thank you so much for your interest around the Healthcare Data Analyst position at Kodiak Solutions. After careful consideration, we've decided to move forward with other candidates for this role. This decision was not easy, as we had many strong candidates, and we truly appreciate the opportunity to learn more about your background and experience. We’ll be keeping your information on file for future opportunities that may be a better fit. We wish you all the best in your job search and continued success in your career. Regards, Kodiak Talent Acquisition Netanya, Thank you so much for your interest around the Healthcare Data Analyst position at Kodiak Solutions. After careful consideration, we've decided to move forward with other candidates for this role. This decision was not easy, as we had many strong candidates, and we truly appreciate the opportunity to learn more about your background and experience. We’ll be keeping your information on file for future opportunities that may be a better fit. We wish you all the best in your job search and continued success in your career. Regards, Kodiak Talent Acquisition",True,Kodiak Solutions,Kodiak Solutions,Unknown,2026-04-25 20:00:53+00:00,2026-04,Saturday
255,19dc10662de6bc3b,"Fri, 24 Apr 2026 19:45:13 +0000",louis vuitton talents <louis.vuitton.talents@jobs.louisvuitton.com>,Your application: Client Insights Associate - LVM31361," Dear&nbsp; Netanya Kelley, Thank you for your interest in Louis Vuitton as an employer. After careful consideration, we have decided not to proceed with your application for the position of Client Insights Associate - LVM31361. Regretfully, due to the large volume of application we receive, we are unable to provide individual feedback. To view or amend your active applications and your profile, please click on the following link: Access my active applications 
We wish you the best of luck in your future career. Talent Acquisition Team Unless you instruct us otherwise, we will retain your data in our “applicants” database for two years. At the end of this period your data will be deleted, unless you give us your explicit permission to continue to store it for another two years. In accordance with current regulations, you can exercise your right to access, amend, or delete your personal data at any time, as well as remove your consent, dispute the way your data is handled, and obtain limitation or transferability wherever applicable. To learn more about how we use your personal data, please read our Personal Data Protection Policy 
