257,19dc02134008536c,"Fri, 24 Apr 2026 11:34:53 -0400 (EDT)",Ian Ramsey <iramsey@brasfieldgorrie.com>,Brasfield & Gorrie application update,"Hi Netanya Kelley,
 
Thank you for considering Brasfield & Gorrie as a career option. After careful consideration of our applicants, we’ve decided to pursue other candidates for the Project Assistant, ID # 9772. It wasn’t a fit this time, but we’re always looking for talented individuals who share our values. Please keep an eye on our website to see if there are other jobs that interest you and don’t hesitate to apply again in the future. Thank you again for your time. 

 
Sincerely,
 
Ian Ramsey

iramsey@BrasfieldGorrie.com
 
 
BRASFIELD & GORRIE  | 3021 7th Avenue South  |  Birmingham,  Alabama  35233 
brasfieldgorrie.com
 
