260,19db6fe2badd7a2f,"Wed, 22 Apr 2026 21:00:02 +0000",Bobby Patterson - State Farm Agent <no-reply@careerplug.com>,Regarding your employment application (Bobby Patterson - State Farm Agent),"Dear Netanya:

Thank you for your interest in the employment opportunity at my agency. After considering a number of candidates with a variety of skills and experiences, I have decided to pursue other candidates who I believe match my needs more closely.

Thank you again for considering this opportunity. Please accept my best wishes for your success in finding a suitable position.

Sincerely,

Bobby Patterson
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN"" ""http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd"">
<html><body>
<div class=""trix-content"">
  <div>Dear Netanya:<br><br>
</div>
<div>Thank you for your interest in the employment opportunity at my agency. After considering a number of candidates with a variety of skills and experiences, I have decided to pursue other candidates who I believe match my needs more closely.<br><br>
</div>
<div>Thank you again for considering this opportunity. Please accept my best wishes for your success in finding a suitable position.<br><br>
</div>
<div>Sincerely,<br><br>
