261,19db5b5187f80306,"Wed, 22 Apr 2026 15:00:36 +0000 (UTC)",Descartes HR Team <Recruiting@descartes.com>,Update on Your Application for Data Processing Analyst​,"<p>Dear Netanya,</p>

<p>Thank you for your interest in the Data Processing Analyst position at The Descartes Systems Group Inc. and for taking the time to apply.</p>

<p>After reviewing your impressive qualifications and extensive experience, we have decided to move forward with other candidates. While your background is exceptional, we believe that this role may not fully utilize your skills and experience.</p>

<p>We truly appreciate the time and effort you invested in the application process and are confident that you will find a position that is a better match for your qualifications. Please feel free to explore other opportunities at The Descartes Systems Group Inc. that may be a better fit in the future.</p>

<p>Thank you again for considering us as a potential employer. We wish you continued success in your career.</p>

<p> Best regards,</p>

<p>Your Descartes Recruiting Team<br>
<img src=https://hcm17.sapsf.com/companyLogoServlet/?companyId=thedescart&amp;mod=1738182986383 alt='Company Logo' style='background-color:#fff;' /></p>
