273,19d999958acc2da5,"Fri, 17 Apr 2026 04:00:56 +0000",Ekimetrics <no-reply@hire.lever.co>,Thank you for your application to Ekimetrics,"<div>Hi Netanya,</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Thank you for your interest in Ekimetrics! We wanted to let you know we received your application for Junior Business Scientist, Data Science and Marketing Effectiveness, and we are delighted that you would consider joining our team.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Our team will review your application and will be in touch if your qualifications match our needs for the role. If you are not selected for this position, keep an eye on our jobs page as we're growing and adding openings.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Best,</div>
<div>The Ekimetrics Team</div>
","Hi Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Ekimetrics! We wanted to let you know we received your application for Junior Business Scientist, Data Science and Marketing Effectiveness, and we are delighted that you would consider joining our team. Our team will review your application and will be in touch if your qualifications match our needs for the role. If you are not selected for this position, keep an eye on our jobs page as we're growing and adding openings. Best, The Ekimetrics Team",True,Ekimetrics,Ekimetrics,Unknown,2026-04-17 04:00:56+00:00,2026-04,Friday
