284,19d72cee192d8940,"Thu, 09 Apr 2026 15:14:13 +0000",no-reply@ensono.com,Status of your application,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for taking the time to apply to our role of Associate, IT Process Analyst. We know how time consuming a job search can be and are so appreciative that you chose to apply for a role with Ensono.

Throughout the process, we take the time to closely review each applicant’s skillsets, looking for alignment with the key requirements to be successful in this role.  Although our team was impressed with your skill set, your application didn’t precisely align with this position. 

We understand that not moving forward in the process is disappointing, but please don’t let it hold you back. Your connection with Ensono doesn’t end here and there are some things you can do to open yourself up to other possibilities.

* Refer to our LinkedIn ( https://www.linkedin.com/company/ensono ) page to take advantage of valuable content to keep you up to date on what’s happening at Ensono.
* Keep an eye on our career site ( https://www.ensono.com/company/careers/jobs-board/ ); we are a growing company and invite you to apply for any opening that piques your interest.

We truly value our candidates and thank you for your interest in a career opportunity with Ensono. We wish you the best of luck as you continue your search!
