292,19d4491900ffcd0b,"Tue, 31 Mar 2026 15:44:43 +0000",noreply@crelate.net,CORA Physical Therapy - Update on Your Application,"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN""><HTML><HEAD><STYLE>p { margin: 0; min-height: 1em; padding: 0; } table.crelateTable{border: solid 1px #000; border-collapse: collapse; } table.crelateTable td { border: solid 1px #000; padding: 4px 2px; } .crelateTable-td { border: solid 1px #000; padding: 4px 2px; }</STYLE></HEAD><BODY style='font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;'><p>Dear Netanya,</p><p><br /></p><p>Thank you for applying for the Revenue Relations Specialist role at CORA Physical Therapy. We appreciate your interest in joining our team.</p><p><br /></p><p>After reviewing your background, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely meet the needs of this position.</p><p><br /></p><p>We’re grateful you considered us and encourage you to explore future opportunities with CORA as they become available.</p><p><br /></p><p>Warmly,</p><p>CORA Talent Acquisition Team<br /></p></BODY></HTML>
