   <body><div>Dear Netanya <br/><br/>Thank you for your interest in the Treasury Analyst position
      with Regional Finance. After considering a number of candidates with a variety of
      skills and experiences, we have decided to pursue other candidates who we believe
      match our needs more closely.<br><br>We appreciate that you are interested in our company. Please do apply again in the
      future should you see a job posting for which you qualify.<br><br>Thank you again for considering this opportunity. We wish you success with your ongoing
      job search.<br><br>Sincerely,<br><br>Regional Finance</div><div><br/></div><div>This email box is not monitored. Please do not reply to this message.</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:qsOQvwJaEA""/></div>
