   <body><div>Dear Netanya Kelley , <br/><br/>Thank you for taking the time to apply for the "" Sourcing
      Analyst "" position at Fox Corporation. At this time, we have decided to move forward
      with other candidates whose qualifications more closely align with our current needs.
      Please continue to visit the career website (www.foxcareers.com) to apply for positions
      that are of interest to you.<br><br>Once again, thank you for your interest in Fox Corporation. We wish you the best of
      luck.<br><br>Sincerely,<br>Fox Talent Acquisition Team</div><div><br/></div><div>Business Process: Job Application: Netanya Kelley ‎- R50031474 Sourcing Analyst (CAN51179381)
      on 02/18/2026</div><div>Subject: Netanya Kelley ‎- R50031474 Sourcing Analyst (CAN51179381)</div><div><a href=""https://www.myworkday.com/fox/email-universal/inst/779$15156963/rel-task/2997$4086.htmld"">Click here to view the notification details.</a></div><div><br/></div><div>Thank You</div><div><br/></div><div><img src=""cid:qixuCBWpGW""/></div>
