300,19cf8b06f061b0d0,"Mon, 16 Mar 2026 22:07:17 +0000",Naik Group <7d89a1de-5dbc-40ab-9302-700467f2952c@pinpoint.email>,Your application for Junior Analyst,"Hi Netanya,


Thank you for your application to Naik Group for the Junior Analyst position in New York, NY.
&nbsp;
This position has been filled, and we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time.

We appreciate your interest in working with us. We encourage you to keep an eye on our [Careers Page](https://trilongroup.pinpointhq.com/) and consider re-applying in the future.&nbsp;

We are dedicated to improving the candidate experience for everyone who decides to apply with us. If you have any feedback that you would like to share, please reply to this message. If you have applied to other position(s) within the organization, please know your application is being reviewed and you will receive feedback accordingly.

We wish you the best of luck in your search.

Best Regards,
Talent Acquisition Team
Naik Group

--------------------------------------------------
If you have any questions or would like to give us some feedback, you can reply to this email and it will go to the hiring team responsible for this role.
--------------------------------------------------
Want to stop receiving communications from us? Manage your communication preferences.
https://trilongroup.pinpointhq.com/candidates/communication_preferences/Z7K2uESXBBZtiWPXCzDyU4A2

