          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class=""wrapper"" style=""font-family: -apple-system, 'BlinkMacSystemFont', 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Ubuntu', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 45px;"" valign=""top"">
              <table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 100%;"" width=""100%"">
                <tr>
                  <td style=""font-family: -apple-system, 'BlinkMacSystemFont', 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Ubuntu', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;"" valign=""top"">

                      <h1 style=""color: #222222; font-family: -apple-system, &#39;BlinkMacSystemFont&#39;, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Roboto&#39;, &#39;Ubuntu&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 35px; text-align: center;"">
    Your application for Junior Analyst

</h1>
<p style=""font-family: -apple-system, &#39;BlinkMacSystemFont&#39;, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Roboto&#39;, &#39;Ubuntu&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 25.6px; line-height: 1.6;"">
  Hi Netanya,

</p>
<p style=""font-family: -apple-system, &#39;BlinkMacSystemFont&#39;, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Roboto&#39;, &#39;Ubuntu&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 25.6px; line-height: 1.6;"">
  Thank you for your application to Naik Group for the Junior Analyst position in New York, NY.<br> <br>This position has been filled, and we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time.<br><br>We appreciate your interest in working with us. We encourage you to keep an eye on our <a href=""https://track.pstmrk.it/3s/trilongroup.pinpointhq.com%2F/h0sH/UBDEAQ/AQ/579080a4-d860-46bf-b2f8-b37b74289dfc/1/QSsTRzaIRw"">Careers Page</a> and consider re-applying in the future. <br><br>We are dedicated to improving the candidate experience for everyone who decides to apply with us. If you have any feedback that you would like to share, please reply to this message. If you have applied to other position(s) within the organization, please know your application is being reviewed and you will receive feedback accordingly.<br><br>We wish you the best of luck in your search.
</p>
  <p style=""font-family: -apple-system, &#39;BlinkMacSystemFont&#39;, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Roboto&#39;, &#39;Ubuntu&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 25.6px; line-height: 1.6;"">
    Best Regards,<br>Talent Acquisition Team<br>Naik Group
</p>



