301,19cf7954a3b01702,"Mon, 16 Mar 2026 16:58:02 +0000",Catholic Guardian Services <CGSno-reply@notifications.ukg.net>,Update on Your Application,"<p><span>Dear Applicant,</span></p>
<p><span>Thank you for your interest in employment with our organization and for taking the time to apply for this position.</span></p>
<p><span>At this time, we would like to inform you that we will not be moving forward with this role due to internal budget adjustments. As a result, the position is no longer being recruited for.</span></p>
<p><span>We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into your application and your interest in joining our team. We encourage you to apply for future opportunities that may align with your experience.</span></p>
<p><span>Thank you again for your interest in our organization, and we wish you the best in your continued job search.</span></p>
<p><span>Kind regards,</span></p>
