305,19ce1f4622a6054e,"Thu, 12 Mar 2026 12:10:14 +0000",Andrew Huff <ahuff@rarebreedvet.com>,Important information about your application to Rarebreed Home Office,"Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in joining our team at Rarebreed Home Office. After careful consideration, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy for the open Pricing Analyst position.

We encourage you to stay connected and apply for future opportunities.

Thanks again for your interest, and we wish you the very best in your job search.

Regards,

Andrew
<p>Netanya,</p>
<p>Thank you for your interest in joining our team at Rarebreed Home Office. <!--StartFragment-->After careful consideration, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy for the open Pricing Analyst position.</p>
