316,19cc53aa14155d18,"Fri, 6 Mar 2026 17:17:58 -0500 (EST)",Rebecca Ernst <ropesgray+email+qf8-c8d3651267@talent.icims.com>,Thank You from Ropes & Gray LLP,"Hi Netanya,
 
Thank you for your interest in the Strategy and Planning Analyst position.
 
After careful review of your application, unfortunately, we will not be moving forward with your candidacy. While we appreciate your interest, there are other candidates whose qualifications more closely align with the requirements of this position.
 
We encourage you to apply for any suitable positions that are of interest to you moving forward and wish you the best.
 
Thank you,
Ropes & Gray LLP
 
 
 
 
 
 
