","Thank you for applying to the Compensation Analyst position at Find Great People.Unfortunately, Find Great People has moved to the next step in their hiring process, and your application was not selected at this time. ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏An update on your application from Find Great PeopleThank you for applying to the Compensation Analyst position at Find Great People.Unfortunately, Find Great People has moved to the next step in their hiring process, and your application was not selected at this time.Replying to this email will not result in sending a message to the employer.© 2026 Indeed, Inc.Austin Indeed Tower, 200 West 6th Street, Floor 36, Austin, TX 78701Indeed.comPrivacy PolicyTermsHelp",True,Find Great People,Find Great People,Compensation Analyst,2026-03-05 14:43:13+00:00,2026-03,Thursday
323,19cb958d41d4edae,"Wed, 04 Mar 2026 14:55:31 +0000","""AdaptHealth, LLC"" <do-not-reply@mail.paylocity.com>",Update on Your Application for AdaptHealth,"<html style=""background-color: #F4F6F8;""><head><meta http-equiv=""Content-Type"" content=""text/html; charset=us-ascii""> <!--[if mso]> <html style='background-color: #FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!-->  <!--<![endif]-->   </head> <body><div style=""display: none; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; max-height: 0px; max-width: 0px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;""> &nbsp;Dear Netanya,Thank you for your interest in the Fleet and Logistics Analyst position with Adap...</div> <div style=""display: none; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; max-height: 0px; max-width: 0px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;""> &nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;</div> <!--[if mso]> <table align='center' class='backgroundmso'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <table align=""center"" style=""width: 100%;background-color: #FAFCFD""> <!--<![endif]--> <tbody>  <tr> <td align=""center""> <div style=""width: 680px;border-radius: 20px;border: 1px solid rgba(75, 88, 99, 0.5);box-shadow: 0px 4px 12px 0px rgba(75, 88, 99, 0.5);border-collapse: collapse;background-color: #ffffff;color: #222222;font-size: 14px;text-align: left""> <table cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" align=""center"" style=""table-layout: fixed;border-radius: 20px;width: 680px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: #ffffff;color: #222222;font-size: 14px;text-align: left""> <tbody> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td></td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td>  <td style=""color: #4B5863; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;""> AdaptHealth, LLC [130666] </td>  <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr height=""44px""> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td></td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> <td> <p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">&nbsp;</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Dear Netanya,</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Thank you for your interest in the Fleet and Logistics Analyst position with AdaptHealth and for taking the time to share your qualifications with our team. We genuinely appreciate the effort you invested in our application process.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>Application Status Update:</strong> After careful consideration and thorough review of all applications, our hiring team has made the difficult decision to move forward with other candidates whose backgrounds more closely align with our current needs for this specific role.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>Your Application Status:</strong> Please know that this decision in no way reflects negatively on your qualifications or professional capabilities. We received an exceptionally strong pool of candidates, making our selection process highly competitive.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>Future Opportunities:</strong> We would like to retain your application in our candidate database for future consideration. Should a position become available that aligns with your skills and experience, we will reach out to you directly.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>Stay Connected:</strong> We encourage you to continue monitoring our career opportunities by visiting <strong>adapthealth.com/careers</strong>, where you can view our current openings and apply for positions that match your interests and qualifications.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>Our Appreciation:</strong> Thank you again for considering AdaptHealth as a potential employer. We were impressed by your interest in our organization and wish you continued success in your career journey.</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;"">Best regards,</p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><br></p><p style=""margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;""><strong>AdaptHealth Human Resources Team</strong></p><table cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody>  </tbody> </table> &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br> </td> <td width=""32"">&nbsp;</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <!--[if mso]> <div style='height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'></div> <table style='width:100%;background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <div style=""height:25px;width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""></div> <table style=""width:100%;background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <tbody> <tr> <td> <table align=""center"" style=""width:440px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;""> <tbody> <!--[if mso]> <tr style='background-color:#FAFCFD;'> <![endif]--> <!--[if !mso]><!--> <tr style=""background-color:#F4F6F8;""> <!--<![endif]--> <td> <table style=""table-layout:fixed;"" align=""center"" cellspacing=""0"" cellpadding=""0""> <tbody> <tr height=""39px""> <td>&nbsp;</td> </tr> <tr> <td style=""text-align:center""> <span style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"">This email is only for the person(s) addressed.</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=""text-align:center""> <span style=""text-align:center""> <a style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"" href=""https://prod.url.paylocity.com?q=2594fb1005c44059aca18dcb50d75d35"">Privacy Policy</a>   | <a style=""color:#626F79;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"" href=""https://prod.url.paylocity.com?q=444b70e8a7e64869b430dbd64cb64bea"">Unsubscribe</a>  </span> </td> </tr>   </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <img width=""1"" height=""1"" alt="""" src=""http://email.mail.paylocity.com/o/eJw0y7FqxDAMgOGnOW8-rFiS7SFD6dSlhb6BLCltaC45Qijk7csVbv7_73Xbd1_kmLf1zcahlKlKbxFbThGZNbY-QeSCrrVAVSnhfTvmadanMTZBwBSZB4lYlWID9ZgI3SfjWoTDx933J1Cj3FLukSt4xIQURSVHUpReKhObhU-ffPdV_QFktdnk8Et-AajEuVELNopp0uAjlDJwZsgQvkckw1oBwaUwEqZJtFM3ZjGfJIV5HNLAKScEJMpwbbUnkEJuLRfofsF0k3m53uVcNp2P86rbLezj6oesp_z4svjJF0xf_9sj_o7DXwAAAP__PElhfA""></body></html>
","Dear Netanya,Thank you for your interest in the Fleet and Logistics Analyst position with Adap... ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ AdaptHealth, LLC [130666] Dear Netanya,Thank you for your interest in the Fleet and Logistics Analyst position with AdaptHealth and for taking the time to share your qualifications with our team. We genuinely appreciate the effort you invested in our application process.Application Status Update: After careful consideration and thorough review of all applications, our hiring team has made the difficult decision to move forward with other candidates whose backgrounds more closely align with our current needs for this specific role.Your Application Status: Please know that this decision in no way reflects negatively on your qualifications or professional capabilities. We received an exceptionally strong pool of candidates, making our selection process highly competitive.Future Opportunities: We would like to retain your application in our candidate database for future consideration. Should a position become available that aligns with your skills and experience, we will reach out to you directly.Stay Connected: We encourage you to continue monitoring our career opportunities by visiting adapthealth.com/careers, where you can view our current openings and apply for positions that match your interests and qualifications.Our Appreciation: Thank you again for considering AdaptHealth as a potential employer. We were impressed by your interest in our organization and wish you continued success in your career journey.Best regards,AdaptHealth Human Resources Team This email is only for the person(s) addressed. Privacy Policy | Unsubscribe",True,"""AdaptHealth, LLC""","""AdaptHealth, LLC""",AdaptHealth,2026-03-04 14:55:31+00:00,2026-03,Wednesday
