ect fit, we encourage you to keep an eye on our Careers page for future opportunities that you may interest you. Thanks again for your interest in YA, we wish you the best of luck in your job search. _____________________________ - YA HUMAN RESOURCES",True,Unknown,Unknown,Project Specialist (Technical Team),2026-03-01 21:42:06+00:00,2026-03,Sunday
