330,19c8ca3c5848d981,"Mon, 23 Feb 2026 22:34:28 +0000",Cardian Page from RR Donnelley <notifications@smartrecruiters.com>,RRD: Thank you for your interest - Billing Operations Analyst,"
Hi Netanya,
We&rsquo;re delighted you would consider RRD for your next career opportunity and appreciate the time you took to apply for the Billing Operations Analyst&nbsp;role. Upon careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we&#39;ve decided to move forward with other candidates that more closely match our needs.
We know that this isn&rsquo;t the news you hoped to hear and this is the hardest part of the process. However, we encourage you to actively check our career page for other opportunities, and to follow us on LinkedIn to keep up with new roles and opportunities at R.R. Donnelley. We hope to see you apply for other roles in the future that align with your interests and skill-set and we wish you the best in finding your next opportunity.&nbsp;
Sincerely,
RRD Human Resources
&nbsp;
Disclaimer: If you have applied to multiple roles with us, please note that you may receive separate notifications regarding each position.
