Thank you for your interest in employment with VTG for the Agile Business Analyst opportunity.
 
We previously emailed you in regards to completing an application and self-ID forms for our opening. At this time, we have not received the requested information, and we have decided to pursue other candidates for this position.
 
We encourage you to visit our website as new positions become available at www.vtgdefense.com/careers.
 
We appreciate your interest in our company and wish you success in your career search.
 
Regards,
 
Andrea Parsons
VTG


