   <body><div><img src=""cid:npifWauPHF""/></div><div>Hello Netanya, Thank you again for submitting your application for the position of
      Jr. Quality Engineer We have carefully reviewed your application. While we were impressed
      by your experience, we have not selected your application for this position. We encourage
      you to keep checking for job opportunities on our Careers page and to apply for positions
      that reflect your professional goals.<br><br>Please note we will keep your profile in our system and contact you if any future
      openings match your career profile.<br><br>Thank you for your interest in Magna, we wish you all the best for your future and
      your career.<br><br>Best Regards,<br>Magna Recruitment Team</div>
