343,19c7181aabb94698,"Wed, 18 Feb 2026 16:07:28 +0000",Workday <resurgent@myworkday.com>,Thank you for your interest in Resurgent Capital Services,"<!doctype html><html xmlns:v=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml"" xmlns:o=""urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"">
