</body></html>","Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at Concierge Home Care using ADP services. Hello Netanya,Thank you for applying with Concierge Home Care. A great deal of thought and consideration went into reviewing the qualifications of all who applied. At this time, we have decided to move forward with other candidates for the role. Thank you again for your interest in our team. Please feel free to join our Talent Community to be one of the first notified of new opportunities. Thank you for your time, and we wish you all the best in your future endeavors. With Gratitude, The Talent Acquisition Department Join the Talent Community https://workforcenow.adp.com/mascsr/default/mdf/recruitment/recruitment.html?cid=ce2f2d73-4f05-4dc0-bee5-c701d2b36516&ccId=19000101_000001⟨=en_US Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.",True,adp,adp,Unknown,2026-02-17 16:11:51+00:00,2026-02,Tuesday
