351,19c4da250c1bea06,"Wed, 11 Feb 2026 16:56:48 +0000",DeceraClinical.hr@adp.com,Thank you for your interest in Decera Clinical,"<html><head><style type=""text/css"">p {margin-block-start: 0 !important; margin-block-end: 0 !important; margin: 0px !important;}</style></head><body><div style='background-color: #ffff00;padding: 5px 10px 5px 10px;width:100%;text-align: center'>Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at Decera Clinical using ADP services. </div><br/><br/>
    <link href=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/mas/mdf-components/25.49.15/styles/froala_editor.pkgd.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css"" />
    <link href=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/mas/mdf-components/25.49.15/styles/froala_style.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css"" />

    <div class=""fr-view"">
      <p data-pasted=""true"">Hi <span data-placeholder-token=""true""><span contenteditable=""false"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272509"" label=""Candidate First Name"" datatype=""Text"" comboservice=""undefined"">Netanya</span></span>,</p><p>Thank you for taking the time to apply for the <span data-placeholder-token=""true""><span contenteditable=""false"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272512"" label=""Position Title"" datatype=""Text"" comboservice=""undefined"">Associate Data & Analytics Engineer </span></span> role at Decera Clinical. We appreciate your interest and the effort you put into your application.</p><p>After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with our current needs.</p><p>This was not an easy decision, and we encourage you to apply for future opportunities with us that may be a better fit for your background and interests. We truly appreciate your interest in joining our team and wish you all the best in your job search.</p><p>Warm regards,</p><p>Decera Clinical Talent Acquisition Team</p><p><a target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"" href=""http://81hmpnd6.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/L0/%2F%2Fdeceraclinical.com/1/0100019c4da24ec8-9a099885-ccb2-4cd2-b242-5e041990c7da-000000/SM7U4iWNtgpv-3lhJqhqHbi44J8=465"">deceraclinical.com</a></p>
    </div>
  <br/><br/>Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.<img alt="""" src=""https://81hmpnd6.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/I0/0100019c4da24ec8-9a099885-ccb2-4cd2-b242-5e041990c7da-000000/P3rSirqnl016o-iy4itm2A1qVWQ=465"" style=""display: none; width: 1px; height: 1px;"">
</body></html>","Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at Decera Clinical using ADP services. Hi Netanya,Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Associate Data & Analytics Engineer role at Decera Clinical. We appreciate your interest and the effort you put into your application.After careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with our current needs.This was not an easy decision, and we encourage you to apply for future opportunities with us that may be a better fit for your background and interests. We truly appreciate your interest in joining our team and wish you all the best in your job search.Warm regards,Decera Clinical Talent Acquisition Teamdeceraclinical.com Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.",True,Decera Clinical,Decera Clinical,Unknown,2026-02-11 16:56:48+00:00,2026-02,Wednesday
