354,19c4862bba238884,"Tue, 10 Feb 2026 16:29:15 +0000 (UTC)",Professional Recruiting Team <recruiting@htijobs.com>,HTI Application Response,"Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in the Change Control Compliance Specialist position. While you were not selected for this specific opportunity, we sincerely appreciate the time and effort you invested in your application. 
Please note that if you’ve applied for other roles with us, you may still be under consideration for those positions. We also regularly update our career page with new opportunities and would be delighted to see your application again in the future. You can explore current and upcoming vacancies at https://www.htijobs.com/job-openings/.
 We wish you all the best in your job search and future career endeavors! Warm regards,HTI Recruiting Team Kindly note: This is an automated message from an unmonitored inbox. Replies to this email will not be seen or responded to. 
