356,19c42bdae476b859,"Mon, 09 Feb 2026 14:10:52 +0000",noreply@crelate.net,UGT: Application Status,"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN""><HTML><HEAD><STYLE>p { margin: 0; min-height: 1em; padding: 0; } table.crelateTable{border: solid 1px #000; border-collapse: collapse; } table.crelateTable td { border: solid 1px #000; padding: 4px 2px; } .crelateTable-td { border: solid 1px #000; padding: 4px 2px; }</STYLE></HEAD><BODY style='font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;'><p>Netanya,</p><p><br /></p><p>Thank you for your time and interest in the role of 9694 DES Business Analyst at United Global Technologies. We sincerely appreciate your interest in joining our team and the effort you put into the application process. After careful consideration, we have decided to move forward with other candidates as we consider qualifications, location, salary, and availability.</p><p><br /></p><p>We will keep your information on file for future opportunities, and we encourage you to apply should a role that fits your skills and experience arise.</p><p><br /></p><p>Thank you once again for your interest in UGT. We wish you the best in your job search and future endeavors.</p></BODY></HTML>
