","Thank You Req Title: Operations Analyst Req Number: OPE-25-00003 Thank you for your interest in employment opportunities with Sawdey Solution Services, Inc. Although we will not be moving forward with your application for this position, we will be reviewing your application against the qualifications for any other positions to which you may have applied. We invite you to review our other open opportunities at www.sawdeysolutionservices.com. We greatly appreciate you taking the time to submit an application. We wish you the best of luck in your job search! Thank you, Sawdey Solution Services Recruiting The information contained in this message may be privileged, confidential and protected from disclosure. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, or an employee or agent responsible for delivering this message to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that any dissemination, distribution or copying of this communication is strictly prohibited. If you have received this communication in error, please notify your representative immediately and delete this message from your computer. Thank you.",True,,,Unknown,2026-02-08 11:52:07+00:00,2026-02,Sunday
360,19c3a1d6a92390a0,"Sat, 07 Feb 2026 21:58:51 +0000",no-reply@embroker.com,Thank you for your interest in Embroker,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for applying for the Service Operations Associate - Atlanta at Embroker.

After reviewing your experience, we will not be moving forward with your candidacy for this role. We encourage you however to keep an eye on our careers page for future opportunities that may align with your experience.

We appreciate your interest in Embroker and wish you success in your job search.

Talent Acquisition Team
