363,19c34c12f49548fb,"Fri, 06 Feb 2026 21:00:01 +0000",recruiting@amwins.com,Important information about your application to Amwins,"Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in our Commissions Analyst opening. We have had a chance to review your resume and compare it against other people who have expressed an interest in this position as well.

Unfortunately, we have decided to pursue other candidates who appear to match our requirements more closely at this time.

Should something change on our side, we will not hesitate to contact you.

Thank you again for your interest in an employment opportunity with Amwins, and we wish you the best in your current job search.

Amwins Talent Acquisition Team | Human Resources | Amwins Group
recruiting@amwins.com | Current Openings ( amwins.com/about-us/careers )
<p>Netanya,</p>
<p>Thank you for your interest in our Commissions Analyst opening. We have had a chance to review your resume and compare it against other people who have expressed an interest in this position as well.<br><br>Unfortunately, we have decided to pursue other candidates who appear to match our requirements more closely at this time.<br><br>Should something change on our side, we will not hesitate to contact you.<br><br>Thank you again for your interest in an employment opportunity with Amwins, and we wish you the best in your current job search.</p>
