364,19c2fd8372bcf9e5,"Thu, 5 Feb 2026 22:07:04 +0000",SunMedGroupHoldingsLLCdbaAirLife.hr@adp.com,Application Status Update,"<html><head><style type=""text/css"">p {margin-block-start: 0 !important; margin-block-end: 0 !important; margin: 0px !important;}</style></head><body><div style='background-color: #ffff00;padding: 5px 10px 5px 10px;width:100%;text-align: center'>Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at SunMed Group Holdings, LLC dba AirLife using ADP services. </div><br/><br/><p><link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.2.0/css/froala_editor.pkgd.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""><link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.2.0/css/froala_style.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""></p><div class=""fr-view""><p><a href=""https://81hmpnd6.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.myairlife.com%2Fcareers%2F/1/0100019c2fd835ae-9c32335c-4f98-47d0-8d70-f4816d390edb-000000/hdtuzL9VMUU4hk0zL8IiWEd4Q9Y=464"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer""><img src=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/cccustom/Client/Recruitment/airlife%20banner_ff335764-d6a8-4038-976f-3143ec8f044b.jpg"" style=""width: 1114px;"" class=""fr-fic fr-dib"" filepath=""/Client/Recruitment/airlife%20banner_ff335764-d6a8-4038-976f-3143ec8f044b.jpg"" status=""success"" isreadonly=""false"" requestresponseid=""a31860c1-1c10-46d1-ad1c-b4a1cc9c29a5"" servertimetaken=""1171""></a><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Dear <span comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Candidate First Name"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272509"" class=""fr-deletable"">Netanya</span> <span comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Candidate Last Name"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272511"" class=""fr-deletable"">Kelley</span>,</p><p><br></p><p id=""isPasted"">Thank you for your interest in our <span class=""fr-deletable"" contenteditable=""false"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272512"" label=""Position Title"" datatype=""Text"" comboservice=""undefined"">Junior Salesforce Administrator/Sales Analyst</span> at AirLife. At this time, we will not be moving forward with your application for this opportunity. We will retain your application for future opportunities. We wish you the best in your career search and appreciate your interest in AirLife. </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>AirLife Talent Acquisition Team</p><p><br></p><p><img src=""https://static.workforcenow.adp.com/cccustom/Client/Recruitment/airlife_final_color_dd2db940-0447-4777-83e9-1f812b555049.jpg"" style=""width: 172px;"" class=""fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil"" filepath=""/Client/Recruitment/airlife_final_color_dd2db940-0447-4777-83e9-1f812b555049.jpg"" status=""success"" isreadonly=""false"" requestresponseid=""f40e76a2-2107-4d94-bca6-89d3ade36484"" servertimetaken=""1216""></p></div><style>p {margin-block-start: 0em !important; margin-block-end: 0em !important;}</style><br/><br/>Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.<img alt="""" src=""https://81hmpnd6.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/I0/0100019c2fd835ae-9c32335c-4f98-47d0-8d70-f4816d390edb-000000/AOjbarM44zcTP61WjeEMkwJB17Y=464"" style=""display: none; width: 1px; height: 1px;"">
</body></html>","Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at SunMed Group Holdings, LLC dba AirLife using ADP services. Dear Netanya Kelley,Thank you for your interest in our Junior Salesforce Administrator/Sales Analyst at AirLife. At this time, we will not be moving forward with your application for this opportunity. We will retain your application for future opportunities. We wish you the best in your career search and appreciate your interest in AirLife. AirLife Talent Acquisition TeamNote: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.",True,adp,adp,Unknown,2026-02-05 22:07:04+00:00,2026-02,Thursday
