368,19c1ff20de423d8b,"Mon, 2 Feb 2026 20:01:22 +0000",ARMADAANALYTICSLLC.hr@adp.com,Thank you for your application for Zoning Analyst I at ARMADA ANALYTICS LLC,"<html><head><style type=""text/css"">p {margin-block-start: 0 !important; margin-block-end: 0 !important; margin: 0px !important;}</style></head><body><div style='background-color: #ffff00;padding: 5px 10px 5px 10px;width:100%;text-align: center'>Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at ARMADA ANALYTICS LLC using ADP services. </div><br/><br/><link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.1.0/css/froala_editor.pkgd.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""><link href=""https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/froala-editor@3.1.0/css/froala_style.min.css"" rel=""stylesheet"" type=""text/css""><p><span style='font-family: garamond, ""times new roman"", serif; font-size: 14px;'>Dear </span><span class=""fr-deletable"" comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Candidate First Name"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272509"">Netanya</span><span style='font-family: garamond, ""times new roman"", serif; font-size: 14px;'>,<br id=""isPasted""><br><span id=""isPasted"" style=""color: rgb(51, 62, 73); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;"">Thank you for applying to the</span><span style=""color: rgb(51, 62, 73); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;""> <span class=""fr-deletable"" comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Position Title"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272512"">Zoning Analyst I</span> position at <span class=""fr-deletable"" comboservice=""undefined"" contenteditable=""false"" datatype=""Text"" label=""Company Name"" oid=""SYS:WFN23:2272513"">ARMADA ANALYTICS LLC</span></span></span></p><p style=""box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 32px; color: rgb(51, 62, 73); font-family: proxima-nova, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;""><br></p><p id=""isPasted"" style=""box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 32px; color: rgb(51, 62, 73); font-family: proxima-nova, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;""><span id=""isPasted"" style='color: rgb(55, 54, 57); font-family: garamond, ""times new roman"", serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;'>We are currently reviewing resumes and will be scheduling interviews within the next two weeks. You will be contacted if we need additional information or wish to schedule a phone or personal interview with you. If you are not selected for an interview, we encourage you to view our job postings regularly as new positions are posted frequently.</span> </p><br><p id=""isPasted"" style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 2.5rem 0px 0px; grid-column: article-content-normal / article-content-normal; font-family: ""Noto Sans"", ""Helvetica Neue"", Helvetica, Arial, ""Liberation Sans"", Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(45, 45, 45); font-size: 1.25rem; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span style='font-family: garamond, ""times new roman"", serif; font-size: 14px;'>Thank you again for the time you invested in your application.</span></p><p style=""box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 32px; color: rgb(51, 62, 73); font-family: proxima-nova, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;""><br></p><p style=""box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 32px; color: rgb(51, 62, 73); font-family: proxima-nova, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;""><span style='font-family: garamond, ""times new roman"", serif; font-size: 14px;'>Best regards,</span></p><span style='font-family: garamond, ""times new roman"", serif; font-size: 14px;'>Human Resource Department</span><br><style>p {margin-block-start: 0em !important; margin-block-end: 0em !important;}</style><br/><br/>Note: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.<img alt="""" src=""https://81hmpnd6.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/I0/0100019c1ff20af6-b404e10f-1df7-45cb-bed3-c4590a83c0b2-000000/74_ecal0ZHmMYIG1awYEMXT8cKg=463"" style=""display: none; width: 1px; height: 1px;"">
</body></html>","Disclaimer: This email has been sent by the HR team at ARMADA ANALYTICS LLC using ADP services. Dear Netanya,Thank you for applying to the Zoning Analyst I position at ARMADA ANALYTICS LLCWe are currently reviewing resumes and will be scheduling interviews within the next two weeks. You will be contacted if we need additional information or wish to schedule a phone or personal interview with you. If you are not selected for an interview, we encourage you to view our job postings regularly as new positions are posted frequently. Thank you again for the time you invested in your application.Best regards,Human Resource DepartmentNote: You must use the same email you used to log in to the career center when applying for jobs.",True,adp,adp,Zoning Analyst I at ARMADA ANALYTICS LLC,2026-02-02 20:01:22+00:00,2026-02,Monday
