376,19c0ba5c52af6253,"Thu, 29 Jan 2026 21:25:38 +0000",no-reply@doubleverify.com,Thank you for your interest in DoubleVerify and the Programmatic Optimization Analyst role,"Hello Netanya,

Thank you for allowing us to consider you for employment at DoubleVerify in the role of Programmatic Optimization Analyst.

We appreciate your interest in the role. At this time, we will not be moving forward.

Thank you for your time and dedication to DoubleVerify. We wish you all the best in your job search.

Best Regards,
DoubleVerify Recruiting Team
<p><span style=""font-weight: 400;"">Hello Netanya,</span></p>
<p>Thank you for allowing us to consider you for employment at DoubleVerify in the role of Programmatic Optimization Analyst.&nbsp;<br><br>We appreciate your interest in the role. At this time, we will not be moving forward.&nbsp;<br><br>Thank you for your time and dedication to DoubleVerify. We wish you all the best in your job search.&nbsp;<br><br>Best Regards,<br>DoubleVerify Recruiting Team</p><img width=""1"" height=""1"" alt="""" src=""http://email.gh-mail.doubleverify.com/o/eJwczN1uwyAMxfGnGXeLjPkwvuBZJuo4LRoNE1kr5e0rcnf0l85vzY5JbDCaLUUmtOySeWQH4kBks8U6YgJZOaBypMiy3Yo3NSNgBIuMFoNLS4qFA1DUUBwJyZeH--P7WWpb1v66NX3rqNu5SH-aPu4_dc0eAIJHADR_Oo6-z4ghJY-JaeaRd_0v-1l-tTU940QvcipHbf16mNehYy7zzvgJAAD__9cfPgQ"">","Hello Netanya, Thank you for allowing us to consider you for employment at DoubleVerify in the role of Programmatic Optimization Analyst. We appreciate your interest in the role. At this time, we will not be moving forward. Thank you for your time and dedication to DoubleVerify. We wish you all the best in your job search. Best Regards, DoubleVerify Recruiting Team Hello Netanya, Thank you for allowing us to consider you for employment at DoubleVerify in the role of Programmatic Optimization Analyst. We appreciate your interest in the role. At this time, we will not be moving forward. Thank you for your time and dedication to DoubleVerify. We wish you all the best in your job search. Best Regards,DoubleVerify Recruiting Team",True,DoubleVerify and the Programmatic Optimization Analyst role,DoubleVerify and the Programmatic Optimization Analyst role,Programmatic Optimization Analyst,2026-01-29 21:25:38+00:00,2026-01,Thursday
