384,19bebcce3ae0a0d2,"Fri, 23 Jan 2026 17:00:17 +0000",no-reply@synapsehealth.com,Update on your Billing & Supplier Statement Analyst application at Synapse Health,"Synapse Health Logo ( https://synapsehealth.com )

Hi Netanya,

Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Billing & Supplier Statement Analyst role. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application and the interest you showed in Synapse Health.

After thoughtful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with what the team needs right now. That said, we were grateful for the opportunity to review your background and learn more about you.

Synapse Health is growing quickly, and we encourage you to explore future opportunities on our Careers Page that may be a stronger match. We wish you all the best in your job search and future endeavors, and we hope our paths may cross again down the road.

Best,
Synapse Health Talent Acquisition Team

Synapse Health Careers Page ( https://synapsehealth.com/careers/ )
<p><a href=""https://synapsehealth.com""><img style=""width: 600px;"" src=""https://synapsehealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/SH-email-hdr.png"" alt=""Synapse Health Logo""></a></p>
<hr>
<p data-start=""271"" data-end=""299"">Hi Netanya,</p>
<p data-start=""301"" data-end=""474"">Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Billing &amp; Supplier Statement Analyst role. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application and the interest you showed in Synapse Health.</p>
<p data-start=""476"" data-end=""732"">After thoughtful consideration, we&rsquo;ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with what the team needs right now. That said, we were grateful for the opportunity to review your background and learn more about you.</p>
<p data-start=""734"" data-end=""990"">Synapse Health is growing quickly, and we encourage you to explore future opportunities on our Careers Page that may be a stronger match. We wish you all the best in your job search and future endeavors, and we hope our paths may cross again down the road.</p>
<p><span data-contrast=""auto"">Best,</span>&nbsp;<br><span data-contrast=""auto"">Synapse Health Talent Acquisition Team</span><span data-ccp-props=""{}"">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style=""font-size: 12px;""><a href=""https://synapsehealth.com/careers/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Synapse Health Careers Page</a></span></p>","Synapse Health Logo ( https://synapsehealth.com ) Hi Netanya, Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Billing & Supplier Statement Analyst role. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application and the interest you showed in Synapse Health. After thoughtful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with what the team needs right now. That said, we were grateful for the opportunity to review your background and learn more about you. Synapse Health is growing quickly, and we encourage you to explore future opportunities on our Careers Page that may be a stronger match. We wish you all the best in your job search and future endeavors, and we hope our paths may cross again down the road. Best, Synapse Health Talent Acquisition Team Synapse Health Careers Page ( https://synapsehealth.com/careers/ ) Hi Netanya, Thank you for taking the time to apply for the Billing & Supplier Statement Analyst role. We truly appreciate the effort you put into your application and the interest you showed in Synapse Health. After thoughtful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with other candidates whose experience more closely aligns with what the team needs right now. That said, we were grateful for the opportunity to review your background and learn more about you. Synapse Health is growing quickly, and we encourage you to explore future opportunities on our Careers Page that may be a stronger match. We wish you all the best in your job search and future endeavors, and we hope our paths may cross again down the road. Best, Synapse Health Talent Acquisition Team Synapse Health Careers Page",True,synapsehealth,synapsehealth,Synapse Health,2026-01-23 17:00:17+00:00,2026-01,Friday
