400,19bb84d40cc57fdb,"Tue, 13 Jan 2026 17:00:26 +0000 (UTC)",NAL <NALCoord@nal.com>,​North American Lighting​ - ​Business Systems Analyst - I​,"<p>Dear&nbsp;Netanya&nbsp;,</p>

<p>Thank you for your interest in&nbsp;North American Lighting.&nbsp; We appreciate your time in pursuing the position of&nbsp;<span contenteditable=""false"">Business Systems Analyst - I</span>.</p>

<p>We were fortunate to have many well-qualified candidates apply for this position. After careful consideration, we have decided to pursue other candidates at this time. We encourage you to apply for new opportunities as they become available in the future.&nbsp;</p>

<p>We appreciate your interest in NAL and wish you success in your future endeavors. We will retain your resume and other employment information for at least one year. If you have any further questions, please contact us.</p>

<p>Sincerely,</p>

<p>North American Lighting&nbsp;Recruiting Team</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=""text-align:justify"">&nbsp;</p>
","Dear Netanya , Thank you for your interest in North American Lighting. We appreciate your time in pursuing the position of Business Systems Analyst - I. We were fortunate to have many well-qualified candidates apply for this position. After careful consideration, we have decided to pursue other candidates at this time. We encourage you to apply for new opportunities as they become available in the future. We appreciate your interest in NAL and wish you success in your future endeavors. We will retain your resume and other employment information for at least one year. If you have any further questions, please contact us. Sincerely, North American Lighting Recruiting Team",True,NAL,NAL,I,2026-01-13 17:00:26+00:00,2026-01,Tuesday
