:&#34;Basel Grotesk&#34;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;""><span style=""font-size:13.5pt;white-space:pre-wrap;"">LegitScript Recruiting Team</span></p>         </p>             </div>                                                                                                                             </div> <p style=""display:none"" title=""X-Secure-Token:eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJub3RpZmljYXRpb25JZCI6IjY5NjU2ZjI5NTY5NDRjYTI5MDdkMWM4NiIsImNvbXBhbnlJZCI6IjY1MzgzZDg2MzgyODg5NDYwMzhlYmUwYyIsImFwcE5hbWUiOjExfQ.b244RVG9KGOINCb3zj29AMW8_v6PGwA9eLIB1HmnFNo""></p><img src=""https://u33389577.ct.sendgrid.net/wf/open?upn=u001.9LQPT7DXxrZpL07iY1pDwSAETVs9eCpT7C8MPM61r3N6OdADui-2BqHQC-2Bkgt7CmDtwbUQi9y70y4t2ztf-2F0k1PLNphDbRm4Wpz54gVPR6P8P4vYBYhe1U4hgNCpzQZMwEY9Nk4XPNZ2nzH-2B51MPJwJMFhRIwp6SRQEGAaORAmf5eoqn9SbiRvola9UYjAgaoRNbHg08cf7n66436aox7Ik2JV2EzfnBHCmOseTPEbgxj4vaCe-2F4sQV07yjstcJWUxwzIFMtTjPvio587-2BiTcwt01MaWxq1oEgy0eIsGSwRUPcgjIMzBsh0vZfClXObL6Pl-2BT6Kus-2BzO2eS0Afe89dDV2B8bOU6wHTj0WVLgBF1wQK1vpzjvgKGGAomv9GfQY3DUWUkgqAEVw52a2yjk92lVr9NglHi3KR3X0ErWPr2NY-3D"" alt="""" width=""1"" height=""1"" border=""0"" style=""height:1px !important;width:1px !important;border-width:0 !important;margin-top:0 !important;margin-bottom:0 !important;margin-right:0 !important;margin-left:0 !important;padding-top:0 !important;padding-bottom:0 !important;padding-right:0 !important;padding-left:0 !important;""/></body>  </html> ","Hi Netanya , First and foremost, thank you for your interest in LegitScript. We know that a lot of time and effort goes into job hunting. We were very fortunate to have a strong group of applicants to consider for this position and unfortunately have decided to move forward with other candidates. We’re still growing at LegitScript, so new positions are opening regularly. We encourage you to keep an eye on our career site ( https://www.legitscript.com/company/careers/ ) for other roles you may find interesting. We sincerely appreciate your interest and hope that you’ll stay in touch regarding future opportunities. Thank you, LegitScript Recruiting Team Hi Netanya,First and foremost, thank you for your interest in LegitScript. We know that a lot of time and effort goes into job hunting. We were very fortunate to have a strong group of applicants to consider for this position and unfortunately have decided to move forward with other candidates.We’re still growing at LegitScript, so new positions are opening regularly. We encourage you to keep an eye on our career site for other roles you may find interesting.We sincerely appreciate your interest and hope that you’ll stay in touch regarding future opportunities.Thank you,LegitScript Recruiting Team",True,LegitScript,LegitScript,Unknown,2026-01-12 22:01:15+00:00,2026-01,Monday
