","Thank you for applying to the Administrative Assistant/Project Coordinator (20 hrs/week) position at Gateway Imports.Unfortunately, Gateway Imports has moved to the next step in their hiring process, and your application was not selected at this time. ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏An update on your application from Gateway ImportsThank you for applying to the Administrative Assistant/Project Coordinator (20 hrs/week) position at Gateway Imports.Unfortunately, Gateway Imports has moved to the next step in their hiring process, and your application was not selected at this time.Replying to this email will not result in sending a message to the employer.© 2026 Indeed, Inc.Austin Indeed Tower, 200 West 6th Street, Floor 36, Austin, TX 78701Indeed.comPrivacy PolicyTermsHelp",True,Gateway Imports,Gateway Imports,Administrative Assistant/Project Coordinator (20 hrs/week),2026-01-10 05:04:59+00:00,2026-01,Saturday
405,19ba48076c9d684a,"Fri, 09 Jan 2026 15:43:59 -0500",notify@dayforce.com,Thank you for applying to Logistics Specialist at Allyn International,"<html xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml""><body><div><p class=""resetParagraphCSS"" STYLE=""color:#000000;font-family:portable user interface, sans-serif;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:11px;""><span STYLE=""background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:13.3333333333333px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;color:#333333;"">Hi Netanya,</span><br /><br /><span STYLE=""font-size:13.3333333333333px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;""><span STYLE=""background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">We appreciate your interest in Allyn International and the time you've invested in applying for the Logistics Specialist </span><span STYLE=""background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">position.</span></span><br /><br /><span STYLE=""font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333333333333px;background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">We decided to move forward with other candidates, but we thank you for giving us the opportunity to learn about your skills and accomplishments.</span><br /><br /><span STYLE=""font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333333333333px;background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">We will be advertising more positions in the coming months. We hope you’ll keep us in mind and we encourage you to apply again <a href=""https://www.allynintl.com/about-allyn-international/careers/open-positions/"" target=""_blank"" STYLE=""color:#0782C1;"">here</a>. We wish you good luck with your job search and future professional endeavors.</span><br /><br /><span STYLE=""font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333333333333px;background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">Best regards,</span><br /><br /><span STYLE=""font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333333333333px;background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">Allyn International, Inc. </span><br /><span STYLE=""font-size:13.3333333333333px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;""><span STYLE=""background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">Talent</span><span STYLE=""background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;""> </span><span STYLE=""background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#222222;"">Acquisition</span></span><br /><span STYLE=""font-size:13.3333333333333px;font-family:arial, sans-serif;""><a href=""https://www.allynintl.com/"" target=""_blank"" STYLE=""background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#0782C1;"">https://www.allynintl.com/</a></span></p></div><!--_dfFormat_=html--></body></html>","Hi Netanya,We appreciate your interest in Allyn International and the time you've invested in applying for the Logistics Specialist position.We decided to move forward with other candidates, but we thank you for giving us the opportunity to learn about your skills and accomplishments.We will be advertising more positions in the coming months. We hope you’ll keep us in mind and we encourage you to apply again here. We wish you good luck with your job search and future professional endeavors.Best regards,Allyn International, Inc. Talent Acquisitionhttps://www.allynintl.com/",True,Logistics Specialist at Allyn International,Logistics Specialist at Allyn International,Logistics Specialist,2026-01-09 20:43:59+00:00,2026-01,Friday
