/td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:top;width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px;"" class=""mj-column-per-100-0 mj-outlook-group-fix"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""vertical-align:top;background-color:#ffffff;padding:25px;"" width=""100%"" ><tr><td align=""left"" style=""font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;direction:ltr;"" ><div style=""font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;text-align:left;color:#333333;word-break:break-word;"">Hi Faith, <br/><br/>Thank you for your time and interest regarding the Junior Credit Analyst position at UACC. <br/><br/>At this time, we have decided to move forward with other candidates for this role. If you have applied to multiple opportunities with UACC, your candidacy may still be under consideration.<br><br>As we continue to grow, new opportunities will become available. Please continue to monitor our careers page for positions that are of interest to you.  <br><br>We wish you good luck with your job search and professional future endeavors.<br><br>Best,<br><br>UACC Talent Acquisition</div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></div><!--[if mso | IE]><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" width=""600"" align=""center"" style=""width:600px;""><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:auto;max-width:600px;"">
