<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></body></html>","Hi Faith, Thank you for your time and interest regarding the Junior Credit Analyst position at UACC. At this time, we have decided to move forward with other candidates for this role. If you have applied to multiple opportunities with UACC, your candidacy may still be under consideration.As we continue to grow, new opportunities will become available. Please continue to monitor our careers page for positions that are of interest to you. We wish you good luck with your job search and professional future endeavors.Best,UACC Talent Acquisition This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com Vroom • 1375 Broadway New York, New York 10018",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2026-01-08 05:18:49+00:00,2026-01,Thursday
