ble></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:top;width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;padding:20px;"" class=""mj-column-per-100-0 mj-outlook-group-fix"" ><table border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""vertical-align:top;background-color:#ffffff;padding:20px;"" width=""100%"" ><tr><td align=""left"" style=""font-size:0px;word-break:break-word;direction:ltr;"" ><div style=""font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;text-align:left;color:#333333;word-break:break-word;"">2026 01 06 <br/><br/>Hi Faith , <br/><br/>Thank you so much for applying for our R157891 Reimbursement Cash Control Analyst (Open) position at Intermountain Health. We understand the time, energy, and care that goes into searching for a new job and sincerely appreciate your interest in growing in your career with us.<br><br>After careful consideration, we have decided to move forward with other candidates who more closely match our needs for this position at this time. However, your right fit with us could be right around the corner!<br><br>Explore new opportunities: we encourage you to keep an eye on our career website at <div style=""word-break:break-all"">https://imh.wd108.myworkdayjobs.com/IntermountainCareers</div> for additional job openings that could be a good fit for you.<br><br>Be the first to know: you can sign up to receive email notifications as soon as a new job opening matching your interests is available by signing in to your Workday account and selecting 'Job Alerts.'<br><br>Stay in the loop: follow us on your preferred social media platforms for the latest company news and a behind-the-scenes look into life at Intermountain.<br><br>We wish you all the best in your job search and thank you again for considering Intermountain as a place for you to grow in your career.  <br><br>Best Regards, <br/><br/>Julie Kuhlmann <br/>Talent Acquisition<br>Intermountain Health <br/><br/></div></td></tr></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]></table><![endif]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" style=""width:600px;"" width=""600px"" ><tr><td style=""line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-url:exactly;""><![endif]--><div style=""margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;""><table align=""center"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" role=""presentation"" style=""width:100%;"" ><tbody><tr><td style=""direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;display:table;width:100%;""><!--[if mso | IE]><table role=""presentation"" border=""0"" cellpadding=""0"" cellspacing=""0"" ><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><tr><![endif]--><!--[if mso | IE]><td style=""vertical-align:top;width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;"" ><![endif]--><div style=""font-size:0px;text-align:left;display:table-cell;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;widt