415,19b93a3536ace6e4,"Tue, 06 Jan 2026 14:08:31 +0000",no-reply@us.greenhouse-mail.io,Your application to The Nuclear Company - IT Support Specialist,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for taking the time applying to IT Support Specialist. Unfortunately, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy at this time.

The decision was difficult as we received many qualified applicants, but we encourage you to continue to check back into our career site for additional opportunities in the future. We are a growing company and adding new jobs often.

Thank you again for your interest in The Nuclear Company and we wish you the best of luck in your search.

Regards,
The Nuclear Company
