","Dear Netanya, Thank you for your interest in Konica Minolta and for applying to the GSD Account Specialist position. We are always delighted to find people who share our passion for reshaping ideas and the way work gets done. Because this opportunity is no longer available, we will not be moving forward with your candidacy at this time. If you have applied for multiple positions, your candidacy will continue in those positions. We will be sure to keep your information on file for future opportunities and encourage you to visit our career site to view and apply to other open positions as new opportunities open up frequently here at Konica Minolta. You can also login to your account on our career site to view our Dashboard and check on the status of your applications at any time. https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/Yx24VR_y5zTTrMPWz0NXcg~~/AAIB5hA~/qPITCcnmpBj_1FKFvrSBf0qALl-2cnnNpnjhmnnZs0ARoowoUTZvmw3dq5S3dYV7qJ4DstwPV7VSngP-nvN-tO11Mspf2APSdhakH8-ethDkoIWFU0PD-0rPihhy8Nq_qgVqsVbkopMvTnmK9ulnkw~~ Thank you again for your time and interest. We wish you the best in your career endeavors! Kind Regards, The Konica Minolta Talent Acquisition Team If you no longer wish to receive e-mail from us, click here: https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/MofnQklS8BUAJ5vF-w-zVg~~/AAIB5hA~/3P4JysT6iwEoTz8xRz4fa8trtNmH3m7IJDw7lK2SzVKjtOXvJj0l6aWJWalYnOUbB4Gcz9s7dneyzr2hq62j1XYOOWRB_CLDOWFaeQqe1FgWyrQNOXDjIvEekxh_qvMZMtUHJY8GGVbFCSmjANHeBeFqzhtBs9GS2PZ8bBozD9LPWQpi5sDvTY1-RZsg36xvSyma7hfIUbBH9lSj8oa_KQ~~. ************************************************** This message was sent to netanyakelley6@gmail.com. If you don't want to receive these emails from this company in the future, please go to: https://tracking.icims.com/f/a/lHdJ1_J72EIxu0WEwH9T7w~~/AAIB5hA~/ouYNAmV46XPdNRHuRM52BceGDNKyWiegbgsllQiQZ0mTUtVHE_x0VyRe7gqVTDc9wZMy0q0Fqjz_f1WXIapCoabx2Tz4aieK_ntcBqi_l7KFLpvN88sqFM96qato-lCGIO6MZ3wck2rBfJfZAw-CKM4bqHK2Yl98Amq9P3ee4eZTUAx0NkvP7c_4MdMKBxnX /n © Konica Minolta Business Solutions, U.S.A., I