ate, Pricing Tech Enablement position, Job #129666, based on reviewing your resume. Although interested in your experience, we will not be moving forward with you for this position at this time. (Please note that this is a status update only for this specific position that we considered you for by reviewing your resume. You may be in consideration for other opportunities. If so, please disregard this message and continue to work with your respective recruiter.) Your resume will remain in our database and our recruiters will be in touch with you in the future should they identify positions that may fit your background. Thanks again for considering opportunities here at KPMG LLP. Please continue to visit us at: [1] https://www.kpmguscareers.com/ and join our [2] Talent Community to create job alerts based on your interests. Thank you, KPMG Recruiting [3] [4] [5] [6] [7] [8] www.kpmguscareers.com [9] Privacy | [10] Legal (c) 2025 KPMG LLP, a Delaware Limited Liability Partnership, and its subsidiaries are part of the KPMG global organization of independent member firms affiliated with KPMG International Limited, a private English company limited by guarantee. All rights reserved. The KPMG name and logo are trademarks used under license by the independent member firms of the KPMG global organization. To unsubscribe from this email list, please click [11] here. References Visible links 1. http://uskpmgats.avature.net/ltrk/eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpZCI6NTc2MzUxOCwiaGFzaCI6IjVkMTA0MjI3ODEyNjFiZmU4OGZlZWJkODdhNzZkNDNkMDk0MzBmNDAzYzljYmNmZWQ0MGMzMzA5NmRmZmVmZjQifQ.ICRTJz6nnzNRAtHHAuy0uFRZII_6AcsklxFMs0vPYtI 2. http://uskpmgats.avature.net/ltrk/eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpZCI6NTc2MzUxOCwiaGFzaCI6IjUxZDM5NDUzNTE5NTFlODhlMGU5MDMwZGEyNTA0MDM1ZjQ2ZTYxMWQxOWMxMzgzM2Y2ZDc1NGYyMmMyNzIwMzgifQ.01vwjhOfqMKVo30gwRvOdbmJEzIE6cMju_PgbrCybfo 3. http://uskpmgats.avature.net/ltrk/eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpZCI6NTc2MzUxOCwiaGFzaCI6ImFjY2U5OWM1MTZhMzg3