431,19b742c950bc3c0c,"Wed, 31 Dec 2025 11:30:37 +0000 (UTC)",Thrive Notification <notification@thrivehrgateway.com>,Thank you for your interest in FLUOR Corporation,"<p>​<br><img src=https://performancemanager4.successfactors.com/companyLogoServlet/?companyId=fluor&amp;mod=1765826420318 alt='Company Logo' style='background-color:#fff;' /></p>
