433,19b725bb08da85b9,"Tue, 30 Dec 2025 22:02:49 -0500 (EST)",Jill Johnson <capbluecross+email+31np-bf895dff3d@talent.icims.com>,Thank you for your interest,"Hi Netanya- 
 
I’d like to thank you for your interest in our Managed File Transfer Administrator opportunity and for considering Capital Blue Cross as a potential employer. While there is so much to be admired in your career history, I’m writing to inform you that we will not be moving forward in the interview process. You were among a very talented pool of candidates for this opportunity and we had to make a challenging selection decision. I do hope that you will consider applying to future opportunities and wish you much success in your career search. 
 
 
Respectfully,
Capital Blue Cross, Talent Acquisition Team
CapitalBlueCross.com
 


