438,19b60452703e4e67,"Sat, 27 Dec 2025 14:45:02 +0000",Recruiting Department <recruitingdepartment@businessolver.com>,Businessolver > Important Information Regarding Your Application,"Hi Netanya,

Thank you for your interest in a career with Businessolver.

Unfortunately, we have decided not to proceed with your candidacy for the Integrations Analyst II position. We received many qualified applicants and have decided to move ahead with another candidate whose work experience is a closer match for this particular role.

Please feel free to visit our Careers page for any other opportunities that may match your skills and experience HERE. ( https://businessolver.com/careers/openings/ )

Thanks again for your interest in Businessolver.

Warm Regards,
The Businessolver Recruiting Team
