Thank you for applying to the Inventory Support Specialist position at LaserAway Corporate. After careful consideration, we will not be moving forward with your application. Though your resume is strong, there are other applicants whose qualifications more closely fit the position.

We appreciate your interest in employment with LaserAway.

Sincerely,

LaserAway Recruiting Team

