   <body><div><p>Dear <span data-class-id=""146"" data-node-type=""simpleSubstitution"" data-token-id=""4465b1aae78a100026dfa2606b9f0109"">Netanya</span>,</p><p></p><p><span>Thank
      you so much for your time in pursuing our current <span data-class-id=""146"" data-node-type=""simpleSubstitution""
      data-token-id=""b6c60cb8ba87100015e51d58ae15008b""></span></span> <span>opening.</span></p><p></p><p>We
      were impressed with your résumé and work experience. However, we have made the determination
      to pursue other candidates at this time and will not be able to move forward with
      your candidacy. However, we would like to keep you in mind for future opportunities
      or if there is any change regarding the current position – we will not hesitate to
      reach out!</p><p></p><p>Thank you again for your interest in Graham Healthcare Group,
      and we wish you the best in your current job search.</p><p></p><p>Sincerely,</p><p>The
      Graham Healthcare Group Team</p></div><div><img src=""cid:MXCybYsKve""/></div><div><a href=""http://www.workday.com"">Workday</a></div>
