</html>","Dear Netanya,Thank you so much for your time in pursuing our current opening.We were impressed with your résumé and work experience. However, we have made the determination to pursue other candidates at this time and will not be able to move forward with your candidacy. However, we would like to keep you in mind for future opportunities or if there is any change regarding the current position – we will not hesitate to reach out!Thank you again for your interest in Graham Healthcare Group, and we wish you the best in your current job search.Sincerely,The Graham Healthcare Group TeamWorkday This email was intended for netanyakelley6@gmail.com",True,Unknown,Unknown,Unknown,2025-12-09 13:11:33+00:00,2025-12,Tuesday
